rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "Although players may respond to the activated ability, they can\'t respond to the paying of its costs. The creature card will already be exiled by the time any player could respond."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'The Zombie creature token you put onto the battlefield will also get a +1/+1 counter.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "Each of the copies will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal). If there are two copies, you may change the targets of each of them to different legal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'If the spell Increasing Vengeance copies has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "If the spell Increasing Vengeance copies is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copies will have the same mode(s). You can\'t choose different ones."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'Increasing Vengeance can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell you control, not just one with targets.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "When Increasing Vengeance resolves, it creates one or two copies of a spell. You control each of the copies. Those copies are created on the stack, so they\'re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger. The copies will then resolve like normal spells, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copies. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copies too. For example, if you sacrifice a 3/3 creature to cast Fling and then copy it with Increasing Vengeance, the copies of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "If a creature with first strike deals damage in the first combat damage step, but then loses first strike before regular combat damage, it won\'t deal combat damage a second time (unless it also has double strike)."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'A creature that’s both a Wolf and a Werewolf gets the bonus only once.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'A “non-Human Werewolf” is a creature that is a Werewolf but is not a Human.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Immerwolf’s bonus never applies to itself, even if it somehow becomes a Werewolf creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'A creature whose toughness is being increased by Thraben Doomsayer’s fateful hour ability loses that bonus as soon as its controller has 6 or more life (or as soon as Thraben Doomsayer leaves the battlefield). If damage marked on that creature is greater than or equal to its toughness after the fateful hour ability stops applying, the creature is destroyed and put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Thraben Doomsayer’s activated ability resolves while you have 5 or less life, the creature token will be 3/3 as it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'A creature with power 0 or less assigns no combat damage. (It doesn’t assign a negative amount of combat damage.)'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'A player with protection from a color can’t be damaged, enchanted (including by Curses), or targeted by anything of that color.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Faith’s Shield targets a permanent regardless of how much life you have. If that permanent is an illegal target when Faith’s Shield tries to resolve, Faith’s Shield won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Neither you nor any of your permanents will gain protection from a color.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You choose only one color (not one color per player and permanent). You choose the color as Faith’s Shield resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Abilities like lifelink and deathtouch that care about any kind of damage are taken into account.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Combat abilities like first strike, double strike, and trample don’t apply and will have no impact on Alpha Brawl’s effect.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the targeted creature has infect or wither, the damage it deals will result in -1/-1 counters being put on each creature it deals damage to. The power of those creatures will be reduced when they deal damage back to the targeted creature.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'None of the damage dealt due to Alpha Brawl is combat damage.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The damage dealt by the targeted creature is not divided in any way. For example, if a 3/3 creature is targeted, it will deal 3 damage to each other creature controlled by its controller.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The two parts of Alpha Brawl’s effect happen sequentially: first the targeted creature deals damage, then the other creatures deal damage. State-based actions aren’t checked in the middle, so creatures that are dealt lethal damage by the targeted creature will still deal damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'All Humans are destroyed, not just ones you control.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If a creature card in your graveyard is both a Zombie and a Human, it will be returned to the battlefield tapped, then be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'All the copies are created on the stack, so none of them are cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copies will then resolve as normal, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Each copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless its controller chooses new ones. That player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, that player can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the original spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, each copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the original spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), each copy will have the same mode(s). You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'When the triggered ability resolves, it creates a copy of that spell for each other player. The active player creates their copy and may choose new targets first (if that player isn’t the enchanted player), then each other player (except the enchanted player) creates their copy and may choose new targets in turn order. The last player who creates their copy controls the copy that will resolve first.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if the enchanted player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, each copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Altar of the Lost doesn’t allow you to cast spells from any other player’s graveyard, although you can spend the mana it produces on such spells if something else allows you to.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can spend mana produced by Altar of the Lost to cast any spell with flashback that you cast from a graveyard. You don’t have to be using flashback to cast that spell, however, as long as something else is allowing you to cast that spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Although players may respond to Ghoultree once it’s been cast, once it’s announced, they can’t respond before the cost is calculated and paid.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Ghoultree’s ability can’t reduce the total cost to cast the spell below {G}.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'An artifact token that’s destroyed is put into its owner’s graveyard before it ceases to exist. If a token is destroyed by Werewolf Ransacker ability, Werewolf Ransacker deals damage to that token’s controller.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If something becomes a copy of Werewolf Ransacker, that doesn’t count as “transforming into Werewolf Ransacker.” The first triggered ability of the new Werewolf Ransacker doesn’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You choose the target artifact when Werewolf Ransacker’s first triggered ability goes on the stack. You choose whether or not to destroy the artifact when that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If the targeted artifact has indestructible or regenerates (or you choose not to destroy it), Werewolf Ransacker doesn’t deal damage to that artifact’s controller. Similarly, if the targeted artifact is destroyed but a replacement effect moves it to a different zone instead of its owner’s graveyard, Werewolf Ransacker doesn’t deal damage to that artifact’s controller.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Another double-faced card that becomes a copy of Loyal Cathar and then dies will return to the battlefield with its back face up.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you gain control of a Loyal Cathar owned by another player and it dies, it will be put into to its owner’s graveyard and then return to the battlefield under your control.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'When Loyal Cathar dies, it will return to the battlefield with its back face (Unhallowed Cathar) up. It doesn’t return to the battlefield and then transform.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If a card that isn’t a double-faced card becomes a copy of Loyal Cathar (due to Cytoshape, for example) and then dies, that card won’t return to the battlefield. It will remain in its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Archangel’s Light isn’t put into the graveyard until after its instructions are followed. You won’t gain 2 life for it, and it won’t be shuffled into your library.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you have no cards in your graveyard, you won’t gain any life, but you’ll still shuffle your library.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'As long as the card remains exiled, you may still play it, even if Fiend of the Shadows leaves the battlefield or changes controllers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'If this creature deals combat damage to multiple players simultaneously, perhaps because some combat damage was redirected, its ability will trigger for each of those players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'Playing a card exiled with Fiend of the Shadows follows all the normal rules for playing that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all timing restrictions, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "You may only play the card, meaning play it as a land or cast it as a spell. It\'s not in your hand. You can\'t discard it, activate its cycling abilities, and so on."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Because Lost in the Woods will trigger once for each creature that attacks you or a planeswalker you control, it’s important to specify which trigger is associated with which attacking creature before revealing any cards.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Removing an attacking creature from combat doesn’t untap that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Because targets are chosen before costs are paid, you can activate Deranged Outcast’s ability targeting itself and then sacrifice Deranged Outcast to pay the cost.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Human you control, including Deranged Outcast itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Because targets are chosen before costs are paid, you can activate Skirsdag Flayer’s ability targeting itself and then sacrifice Skirsdag Flayer to pay the cost.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Human you control, including Skirsdag Flayer itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Blood Feud can target two creatures with the same controller.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Check the creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine if it was a Human. If it was, use its toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the target creature isn’t on the battlefield or is otherwise an illegal target when Death’s Caress tries to resolve, Death’s Caress doesn’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Death’s Caress resolves but the target creature isn’t destroyed, perhaps because it has indestructible or it regenerated, you still check if it’s a Human. If so, you’ll gain life equal to its toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Check the sacrificed creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how many Wolves you put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You choose whether to sacrifice a nontoken creature and which creature to sacrifice when Feed the Pack’s ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Clinging Mists doesn’t track the controller of the attacking creatures. If one of them changes controller before its previous controller’s next untap step, it won’t untap during its new controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'In most cases, attacking creatures will already be tapped. They still won’t untap during their controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Count the number of creature cards in your graveyard when Grim Flowering resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Creature abilities like deathtouch or lifelink may affect the results of the damage dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Curse of Bloodletting works with any damage, not just combat damage. It also doesn’t matter who controls the source of the damage that’s being dealt.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If more than one Curse of Bloodletting enchants the same player, damage dealt to that player will double for each one (two of them will end up multiplying the damage by four, three of them by eight, and four of them by sixteen).'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If multiple effects modify how damage will be dealt to the enchanted player, that player chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, Mending Hands says, “Prevent the next 4 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.” Suppose a spell would deal 5 damage to enchanted player and that player has cast Mending Hands targeting themselves. The enchanted player can either (a) prevent 4 damage first and then let Curse of Bloodletting’s effect double the remaining 1 damage, taking 2 damage, or (b) double the damage to 10 and then prevent 4 damage, taking 6 damage.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The source of the damage doesn’t change. A spell that deals damage will specify the source of the damage, often the spell itself. An ability that deals damage will also specify the source of the damage, although the ability itself will never be that source. Often the source of the ability is also the source of the damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Curse of Exhaustion will look at the entire turn to see if the enchanted player has cast a spell yet that turn, even if Curse of Exhaustion wasn’t on the battlefield when that spell was cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Each time a creature dies, check whether Predator Ooze had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Predator Ooze’s ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Elbrus will transform even if you are unable to unattach it (most likely because the equipped creature died).'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game using the limited range of influence option (such as a Grand Melee game), if a spell or ability says that you win the game, it instead causes all of your opponents within your range of influence to lose the game. This is another way by which Withengar’s ability can trigger.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The “legend rule” checks only for permanents with exactly the same name. Elbrus, the Binding Blade and Withengar Unbound can be on the battlefield at the same time without either going to its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Withengar’s triggered ability will trigger no matter how a player loses the game: due to a state-based action (as a result of having a life total of 0 or less, trying to draw a card from an empty library, or having ten poison counters), a spell or ability that says that player loses the game, a concession, or a game loss awarded by a judge.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Farbog Boneflinger’s ability is mandatory. If it’s the only creature on the battlefield, you must choose it as the target and give it -2/-2 until end of turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Flayer of the Hatebound is the source of the ability, but it may be another creature that is the source of the damage. If a black creature enters the battlefield from your graveyard, the ability could target a creature with protection from black, although the damage will be prevented. It couldn’t target a creature with protection from red.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Flayer of the Hatebound’s last ability will trigger even if a creature enters the battlefield from your graveyard under another player’s control.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you cast a creature card from your graveyard, that card will be put on the stack before entering the battlefield. Flayer of the Hatebound won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Since damage is dealt by the creature, abilities like lifelink and deathtouch are taken into account, even if the creature has left the battlefield by the time it deals damage.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The creature that entered the battlefield from your graveyard deals damage equal to its current power (including any +1/+1 counters it entered the battlefield with) to the target permanent or player. If it’s no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, its last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Follow the instructions in the order listed on the card: if you target yourself, you’ll put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard and then draw a card.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the target player is an illegal target when Thought Scour tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'For each of the activated abilities, the equipped creature is the source of the ability and the damage. For example, if the equipped creature is not an artifact, you could activate either ability targeting a creature with protection from artifacts.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Only the equipped creature’s controller can activate the abilities it gains from Wolfhunter’s Quiver.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You could activate the first ability targeting a Werewolf creature if you wanted to.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Gravecrawler’s ability doesn’t change when you could cast it.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Once you’ve cast Gravecrawler and it’s on the stack, it doesn’t matter if you lose control of the other Zombie.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Havengul Lich’s activated ability creates a delayed triggered ability that triggers when you cast the creature card. This triggered ability will go on the stack on top of the creature spell and will resolve before the creature spell will.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you don’t cast the creature card that turn, Havengul Lich won’t gain any of its abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Havengul Lich’s ability changes the zone you are permitted to cast the card from, not the times you are permitted to cast it. You can cast a creature card that has been targeted by Havengul Lich from the graveyard, but unless it has flash, you can only do so if it’s your main phase, the stack is empty, and you have priority.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2019-10-04', 'text': 'Havengul Lich gains the activated abilities of the card as it existed in the graveyard while that card is still a spell on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Helvault’s first and third abilities are linked. Similarly, Helvault’s second and third abilities are linked. Only cards exiled as a result of Helvault’s first or second abilities will be returned to the battlefield by its third ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Drogskol Reaver deals enough first-strike damage to destroy each creature it’s blocking or was blocked by, it won’t deal any damage during the regular combat damage step (unless it’s attacking and somehow gains trample). Its ability won’t trigger a second time that combat.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If a creature with lifelink you control deals damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time, the ability will trigger just once. The damage dealt by that creature is a single life-gaining event.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with lifelink you control deal combat damage at the same time, the damage dealt by each of those creatures is a separate life-gaining event and Drogskol Reaver’s ability will trigger that many times.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The ability triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life was gained.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Hinterland Scourge is attacking, the defending player must assign at least one blocker to it during the declare blockers step if that player controls any creatures that could block it.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'If Sorin, Lord of Innistrad somehow becomes a creature, it can be chosen as a target of its own third ability. If Sorin, Lord of Innistrad is still on the battlefield when that ability resolves, it will then destroy Sorin and return him to the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "If a creature with undying is destroyed by Sorin, Lord of Innistrad\'s third ability, the undying ability will trigger, but the creature will already have been returned to the battlefield by Sorin. The undying ability won\'t do anything when it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'The emblems are cumulative. If you get two of them, creatures you control will get +2/+0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "You can target a token creature with Sorin, Lord of Innistrad\'s third ability, but it won\'t return to the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Soul Seizer has any +1/+1 counters on it when it transforms, they remain on Ghastly Haunting. They won’t affect the power or toughness of the enchanted creature, however.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Soul Seizer leaves the battlefield in response to its triggered ability, you won’t be able to transform it and it won’t return to the battlefield or become attached to the target.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You choose the target for Soul Seizer’s triggered ability when that ability triggers and goes on the stack. You choose whether or not to transform it when that ability resolves. If the creature is an illegal target by that time, the ability doesn’t resolve and none of its effects happen. You can’t have Soul Seizer transform.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Sudden Disappearance’s delayed triggered ability is countered or otherwise removed from the stack after triggering, the exiled cards will remain in exile indefinitely. The delayed triggered ability will only trigger once.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You cast the card in your hand as part of the resolution of Counterlash. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (such as creature or sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the target creature is attacking, the defending player must assign at least one blocker to it during the declare blockers step if that player controls any creatures that could block it.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If the targeted land is an illegal target when Scorch the Fields tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt to any Human.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Scorch the Fields doesn’t target any Humans. You can cast Scorch the Fields even if there aren’t any Humans on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If there are multiple combat phases in a turn, a creature that’s been removed from combat can still attack or block in future combat phases that turn.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Removing a blocking creature from combat doesn’t cause the creature it was blocking to become unblocked. If no other creatures are blocking that attacking creature, it won’t assign combat damage (unless it has trample).'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Removing an attacking creature from combat doesn’t untap that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If there’s only one card in your library when Tower Geist enters the battlefield, you’ll look at that card and put it into your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If this creature deals combat damage to multiple players simultaneously, perhaps because some combat damage was redirected, its ability will trigger for each of those players.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter isn’t put on Markov Blademaster in time to increase the amount of combat damage dealt during that combat step. However, the +1/+1 counter put on Markov Blademaster when first-strike damage is dealt will increase the amount of damage dealt during the regular combat damage step.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If this creature deals combat damage to multiple players simultaneously, perhaps because some combat damage was redirected, its ability will trigger for each of those players.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter isn’t put on the creature in time to increase the amount of combat damage dealt during that combat step.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you activate one face’s ability, and some effect causes the card to transform twice that turn, you won’t be able to activate that face’s ability again that turn.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can activate Wolfbitten Captive’s ability, let it transform into Krallenhorde Killer, then activate Krallenhorde Killer’s ability, all on the same turn, and vice versa.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If you cast Gravepurge with at least one target and all of those targets become illegal, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t get to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can cast Gravepurge with zero targets. If you do, you’ll draw a card as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You choose the order of the cards you put on top of your library.'}, {'date': '2015-02-25', 'text': 'You can cast Gravepurge with no targets. If you do, you’ll just draw a card. However, if you cast it with at least one target and all of those targets become illegal, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If, during a player’s declare attackers step, a creature is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can’t attack, or hasn’t been under that player’s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn’t have haste), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The creature’s controller still decides which player or planeswalker the creature attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'In order to activate the ability, you must be able to target a creature with power less than or equal to the number of creatures you control. The comparison is made again when the ability resolves. If the power is greater than the number of creatures you control at that time, the target is illegal and the ability doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The control-changing effect lasts indefinitely, even if the power of the creature becomes greater than the number of creatures you control after the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of deathtouch or lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "Vault of the Archangel\'s last ability affects only creatures you control when that ability resolves. It won\'t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Mystic Retrieval can’t target itself. It’s on the stack when you choose its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Only Burden of Guilt’s controller can activate its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Regardless of which zone Increasing Confusion is cast from, it puts cards from the top of target player’s library into that player’s graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Saving Grasp can target any creature you own, even one controlled by another player.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Secrets of the Dead’s triggered ability resolves before the spell you cast from your graveyard does.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Spiteful Shadows causes the enchanted creature to deal damage to its controller. Abilities like lifelink and infect will apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Tapping creatures to attack with them happens just before any required costs to attack with those creatures are paid. If paying such a cost causes your life total to fall below 6, your tapped attackers will have vigilance, but the ability will have no benefit that combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The Curse card you put onto the battlefield must have a different name than each other Curse enchanting the enchanted player when the triggered ability resolves. If multiple of these abilities trigger, the Curse card you put onto the battlefield when the first resolves may impact your choices for each subsequent one.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The ability checks whether the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield was a Human. (It doesn’t matter what its creature types are in the graveyard.)'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Falkenrath Torturer itself to activate its ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The ability will trigger only once per combat, even if the enchanted creature somehow blocks multiple attacking creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The creature need only share one creature type with enchanted creature, not necessarily all of them. For example, if the enchanted creature was a Human Soldier, you could put a Human Wizard creature card, a Goblin Soldier creature card, or a Human Soldier Ally creature card onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The creatures can’t block any creatures that turn, not just Markov Warlord.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You may target zero, one, or two creatures with Markov Warlord’s enters-the-battlefield triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The number of Curses attached to the player is counted when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'The triggered ability checks whether the equipped creature as it last existed on the battlefield was a Human. (It doesn’t matter what its creature types are in the graveyard.)'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Tovolar’s Magehunter’s first triggered ability will resolve before the spell that caused it to trigger. If this causes the player who cast that spell to lose the game, that spell won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Warden of the Wall still has the ability to tap for mana when it’s not your turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'When Relentless Skaabs returns to the battlefield because of its undying ability, it’s not being cast. You won’t exile a creature card from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to otherwise remove the creature card you exiled in order to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must exile exactly one creature card from your graveyard to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without exiling a creature card, and you cannot exile additional creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped Vampire you control, including one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Chosen of Markov’s activated ability. You must have controlled Chosen of Markov continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, however.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You check your life total to see if Chalice of Life transforms only when its ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Your starting life total is the life total you began the game with. For most two-player formats, this is 20. For Two-Headed Giant, it’s the life total your team started with, usually 30. In Commander games, the starting life total is 40.'}, {'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'You must put a creature card from among the revealed cards into your hand if one is there, even if you’d rather put all the revealed cards into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to otherwise remove the creature card you exiled in order to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must exile exactly one creature card from your graveyard to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without exiling a creature card, and you cannot exile additional creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The ability can target a tapped creature. If the targeted creature is already tapped when it resolves, that creature just remains tapped and doesn’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Dungeon Geists’s triggered ability can target a tapped creature. If the targeted creature is already tapped when it resolves, that creature just remains tapped and won’t untap during its controller’s untap step.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If Dungeon Geists leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability has resolved, the target creature will be tapped, but it will be able to untap as normal.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If another player gains control of Dungeon Geists, its effect expires. It won’t keep the creature from untapping anymore, even if you later regain control of Dungeon Geists.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Because Break of Day affects only creatures you control when it resolves. It won’t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Break of Day checks your life total only at the time it resolves. Any creatures that gain indestructible will continue to be indestructible that turn even if you gain life.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Forge Devil’s ability is mandatory. If it’s the only creature on the battlefield, you’ll have to choose it as the target and have it deal 1 damage to itself and 1 damage to you.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'For more information on double-faced cards, see the Shadows over Innistrad mechanics article (http://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/feature/shadows-over-innistrad-mechanics).'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Creatures you control may attack multiple players and/or planeswalkers. For each attacking creature, Hellrider will deal damage to the corresponding player or planeswalker.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the copied card has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability that exiles the token isn’t a characteristic of the token. If an effect such as populate copies the token, the new copy won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The token doesn’t have haste (unless the card it’s copying has haste) and usually won’t be able to attack.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The token is a Spirit in addition to its other types. This is a copiable value of the token that other effects may copy.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Thalia\'s ability affects each spell that\'s not a creature spell, including your own."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "Thalia\'s ability affects each spell that\'s not a creature spell, including your own."}, {\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'All players get to see which card you return to your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Because Haunted Fengraf\'s ability doesn\'t target any creature card, any creature card put into the graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The creature card returned to your hand is chosen at random as the ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won\'t yet know what card will be returned."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Any damage dealt to you by a Human will cause Mikaeus’s ability to trigger, including noncombat damage dealt to you by a Human and damage dealt to you by a Human you control.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a Human deals damage to you at the same time that Mikaeus is dealt lethal damage, Mikaeus’s triggered ability triggers. That Human will be destroyed even though Mikaeus has left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a non-Human creature you control without a +1/+1 counter dies at the same time as Mikaeus, that creature’s undying ability granted by Mikaeus triggers and will return it to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'The +1/+1 bonus that Mikaeus gives to other non-Human creatures you control isn’t a counter. It won’t prevent undying from triggering.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A creature spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Bone to Ash. The creature spell won’t be countered when Bone to Ash resolves, but you’ll still draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If an effect exiles a card from a library and allows a player to cast it, that player may do so. The spell is cast from exile, not a library.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Look at the card as it exists in your graveyard to determine whether it can enter the battlefield. For example, Sculpting Steel can be put onto the battlefield as a copy of a creature, but Phyrexian Metamorph can’t be put onto the battlefield, even if it would copy a noncreature artifact.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Manifesting a card from a graveyard or library is an impossible action while Grafdigger’s Cage is on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Players can still play lands from graveyards or libraries if an effect allows them to do so.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to interfere with the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Falkenrath Aristocrat\'s activated ability checks whether the sacrificed creature was a Human as it last existed on the battlefield. It doesn\'t matter what its creature types are in the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'If the sacrificed creature was a Human, Falkenrath Aristocrat gains indestructible and also gets a +1/+1 counter.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can sacrifice Falkenrath Aristocrat to pay the cost of its own ability. It won\'t receive a counter or gain indestructible, but it will enable abilities that check when or if a creature dies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Alphatier des Dornenrudels\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)Wenn das Alphatier des Dornenrudels ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wölfe kamen auf uns zu, und mich überkam ein Frösteln. Das Rudel hatte einen neuen Anführer." —Alena, Fallenstellerin aus Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a49cf0-4aa6-4aee-9135-46d0ccebe662\', \'multiverseId\': 337014}, \'multiverseid\': 337014}, {\'name\': \'Alfa de la Manada del Brezo\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nCuando el Alfa de la Manada del Brezo entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los lobos se volvieron contra nosotros y un escalofrío me recorrió el cuerpo. La manada tenía un nuevo líder." —Alena, trampera de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd43373-cbc3-4638-b972-f68ccb26776b\', \'multiverseId\': 337185}, \'multiverseid\': 337185}, {\'name\': \'Alpha de la meute de bruyère\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nQuand l\'Alpha de la meute de bruyère arrive sur le champ de bataille, la créature ciblée gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': \'« Les loups se sont soudain retournés contre nous et un frisson me parcourut. La meute avait un nouveau chef. » —Alena, trappeur de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336672&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'637eb90a-3e60-4111-ba93-0f9a664f366f\', \'multiverseId\': 336672}, \'multiverseid\': 336672}, {\'name\': \'Rovobranco Alfa\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nQuando il Rovobranco Alfa entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'"I lupi si rivoltarono contro di noi e un brivido mi gelò il sangue. Il branco aveva un nuovo capo." —Alena, trappolatrice del Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1bcb420-6b1d-43c3-831b-fcf897a368b6\', \'multiverseId\': 337356}, \'multiverseid\': 337356}, {\'name\': \'茨群れの頭目\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）茨群れの頭目が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'「狼がこっち向いた時、全身に寒気が走ったわ。群れの頭が新しくなっていたのよ。」――ケッシグの罠師、アレイナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac484ee5-00ef-424d-937b-073b1fe11f78\', \'multiverseId\': 337527}, \'multiverseid\': 337527}, {\'name\': \'들장미떼 우두머리\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)들장미떼 우두머리가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': \'"늑대들이 우리를 향해 고개를 돌린 순간 내 등에 식은땀이 흘렀지. 늑대떼의 우두머리가 바뀌었더군." —케시그의 덫사냥꾼 알레나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3c9f631-a7a0-493e-a713-fe17a95eca5f\', \'multiverseId\': 336159}, \'multiverseid\': 336159}, {\'name\': \'Alfa da Alcateia dos Espinhos\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)Quando Alfa da Alcateia dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lobos se voltaram contra nós e senti um calafrio no corpo todo. A alcateia tinha um novo líder." — Alena, armadilheira de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95459df9-08d6-44d3-a9d7-8717e6664abb\', \'multiverseId\': 336501}, \'multiverseid\': 336501}, {\'name\': \'Вожак Терновой Стаи\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)Когда Вожак Терновой Стаи выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': \'«Волки набросились на нас, и меня объял холодный ужас. В стае был новый вожак». — Алена, капканщица из Кессига\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'169d8be8-79ca-4cac-8b1c-fed21222b4ea\', \'multiverseId\': 336843}, \'multiverseid\': 336843}, {\'name\': \'荆群首领\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）当荆群首领进战场时，目标生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「狼群掉头过来，让我打了冷颤。这群有了新的领袖。」～凯锡革布陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da627f0d-f929-4c32-a6ee-c927365abd51\', \'multiverseId\': 335988}, \'multiverseid\': 335988}, {\'name\': \'荊群首領\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）當荊群首領進戰場時，目標生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「狼群掉頭過來，讓我打了冷顫。這群有了新的領袖。」～凱錫革佈陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb42234b-2399-4ad2-a821-b4cd5fca9eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 336330}, \'multiverseid\': 336330}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar der Verlorenen\', \'text\': \'Der Altar der Verlorenen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um zwei Mana einer beliebigen Farbkombination. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Zaubersprüche mit Rückblende aus einem Friedhof zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d7e934-e3fc-4d46-990e-7276ce6103cb\', \'multiverseId\': 337067}, \'multiverseid\': 337067}, {\'name\': \'Altar de los perdidos\', \'text\': \'El Altar de los perdidos entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega dos maná de cualquier combinación de color a tu reserva de maná. Usa este maná sólo para lanzar hechizos con retrospectiva desde un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebcc85b6-94d3-4b11-922d-cf53b57002f9\', \'multiverseId\': 337238}, \'multiverseid\': 337238}, {\'name\': \'Autel des égarés\', \'text\': "L\'Autel des égarés arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez deux manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix à votre réserve. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts avec le flashback depuis un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336725&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe08c5d2-d6fb-41ab-85e6-8d44a5e38ff8\', \'multiverseId\': 336725}, \'multiverseid\': 336725}, {\'name\': \'Altare degli Smarriti\', \'text\': "L\'Altare degli Smarriti entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi due mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori alla tua riserva di mana. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie con flashback da un cimitero.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0019932a-0cdd-4374-a384-b878bd01876f\', \'multiverseId\': 337409}, \'multiverseid\': 337409}, {\'name\': \'迷いし者の祭壇\', \'text\': \'迷いし者の祭壇はタップ状態で戦場に出る。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに、望む色の組み合わせのマナ２点を加える。これらのマナは、いずれかの墓地にあるフラッシュバックを持つ呪文を唱えるためにのみ支払うことができる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'028fdf7a-ed09-4192-97ab-84869fd973f5\', \'multiverseId\': 337580}, \'multiverseid\': 337580}, {\'name\': \'길을 잃은 자들의 제단\', \'text\': \'길을 잃은 자들의 제단은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: 원하는 색의 조합으로 마나 두 개를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다. 이 마나는 회상 능력을 가진 주문을 무덤에서 발동하는 데만 사용할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b792b2-f644-447c-8213-484d3cb3d7fd\', \'multiverseId\': 336212}, \'multiverseid\': 336212}, {\'name\': \'Altar dos Perdidos\', \'text\': \'Altar dos Perdidos entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione dois manas em qualquer combinação de cores à sua reserva de mana. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas com recapitular de um cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f5f7047-5827-43c1-9ab7-1b08179e87d7\', \'multiverseId\': 336554}, \'multiverseid\': 336554}, {\'name\': \'Алтарь Сгинувших\', \'text\': \'Алтарь Сгинувших выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте две маны в любой комбинации цветов в ваше хранилище маны. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинаний с Воспоминанием из кладбища.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87deb114-8212-4773-a727-1d9ea06ada2e\', \'multiverseId\': 336896}, \'multiverseid\': 336896}, {\'name\': \'逝者祭坛\', \'text\': \'逝者祭坛须横置进战场。{T}：加两点法术力到你的法术力池中，其颜色组合由你选择。此法术力只能用来从坟墓场中施放具返照的咒语。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc6a5c1b-575e-43e3-9ddd-8c3d03c01394\', \'multiverseId\': 336041}, \'multiverseid\': 336041}, {\'name\': \'逝者祭壇\', \'text\': \'逝者祭壇須橫置進戰場。{T}：加兩點魔法力到你的魔法力池中，其顏色組合由你選擇。此魔法力只能用來從墳墓場中施放具返照的咒語。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ade5c0-6665-4e8a-a314-cab5a2de15e5\', \'multiverseId\': 336383}, \'multiverseid\': 336383}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aristokratin aus Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Die Aristokratin aus Falkenrath ist in diesem Zug unzerstörbar. Falls die geopferte Kreatur ein Mensch ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Aristokratin aus Falkenrath.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Blut schmeckt recht gut. Leider ist nicht für uns beide genug da."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337068&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f7871f-c3f5-4cc0-a955-67f4fc134f54\', \'multiverseId\': 337068}, \'multiverseid\': 337068}, {\'name\': \'Aristócrata Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nSacrificar una criatura: La Aristócrata Falkenrath es indestructible este turno. Si la criatura sacrificada era un Humano, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Aristócrata Falkenrath.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu sangre es sabrosa. Lástima que no haya suficiente para los dos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4688cdf5-949f-48e3-9d00-b6ff4f775c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 337239}, \'multiverseid\': 337239}, {\'name\': \'Aristocrate Falkenrath\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nSacrifiez une créature : L\'Aristocrate Falkenrath est indestructible ce tour-ci. Si la créature sacrifiée était un humain, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Aristocrate Falkenrath.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Votre sang est d\'une exquise douceur. Quel dommage qu\'il n\'y en ait pas suffisamment pour nous deux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d505855-d6c3-4d39-89f1-a3806b385006\', \'multiverseId\': 336726}, \'multiverseid\': 336726}, {\'name\': \'Aristocratica Falkenrath\', \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nSacrifica una creatura: L\'Aristocratica Falkenrath è indistruttibile in questo turno. Se la creatura sacrificata era un Umano, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Aristocratica Falkenrath.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tuo sangue è piuttosto gradevole. Peccato non ce ne sia abbastanza per entrambi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69678666-4067-4be7-a84b-e6acb6ed8da0\', \'multiverseId\': 337410}, \'multiverseid\': 337410}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの貴種\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\nクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：このターン、ファルケンラスの貴種は破壊されない。その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーが人間だった場合、ファルケンラスの貴種の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の血は極めて喜ばしい。共に楽しめぬとは残念なことだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a32640d-4d5e-423e-af78-823c8289789f\', \'multiverseId\': 337581}, \'multiverseid\': 337581}, {\'name\': \'팔켄라스가의 화족\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 희생한다: 팔켄라스가의 화족은 이 턴에 파괴될 수 없다. 만약 희생된 생물이 인간이었다면, 팔켄라스가의 화족에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"네놈의 피는 참 맛이 뛰어나군. 둘이서 나눠 갖기에는 부족한 게 아쉬울 따름이네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a482cb0-3b39-4877-88e5-d93a15966eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 336213}, \'multiverseid\': 336213}, {\'name\': \'Aristocrata Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nSacrifique uma criatura: Aristocrata Falkenrath é indestrutível neste turno. Se a criatura sacrificada era um Humano, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Aristocrata Falkenrath.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Seu sangue é muito saboroso. É um pecado que não baste para nós dois."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42197eea-3a56-4d71-bd26-c0659ddd8e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 336555}, \'multiverseid\': 336555}, {\'name\': \'Фалькенратская Аристократка\', \'text\': \'Полет, Ускорение\\nПожертвуйте существо: Фалькенратская Аристократка не может быть уничтожена в этом ходу. Если пожертвованное существо было Человеком, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Фалькенратскую Аристократку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Твоя кровь приятна на вкус. Жаль, что ее недостаточно для нас обоих».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42c2b76b-0853-454c-bab6-6c8671baaf5a\', \'multiverseId\': 336897}, \'multiverseid\': 336897}, {\'name\': \'伐肯纳豪族\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：伐肯纳贵族本回合不会毁坏。如果牺牲的生物是人类，在伐肯纳贵族上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「你的血相当令我满意。只可惜份量不够我俩共享。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a059fa05-e211-4e6e-bb00-dd8437055362\', \'multiverseId\': 336042}, \'multiverseid\': 336042}, {\'name\': \'伐肯納豪族\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物：伐肯納貴族本回合不會毀壞。如果犧牲的生物是人類，在伐肯納豪族上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「你的血相當令我滿意。只可惜份量不夠我倆共享。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5219cce3-1d4c-43b6-85f3-ef7f4b442cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 336384}, \'multiverseid\': 336384}]', '[{\'name\': \'Atem-Nibilis\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Du kannst eine Kreatur deiner Wahl tappen oder enttappen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Warum bleiben die Toten unter uns? Wo ist der Alabasterschwarm, um sie nach Hause zu geleiten? Wo ist Avacyn?" —Eruth von Lammholt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31bc6bd-5328-40e4-a65f-3d788486805e\', \'multiverseId\': 336936}, \'multiverseid\': 336936}, {\'name\': \'Niblis del aliento\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{U}, {T}: Puedes girar o enderezar la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Por qué los muertos permanecen con nosotros? ¿Dónde está la Legión Alabastro para llevarlos a casa? ¿Dónde está Avacyn?" —Eruth de Lambholt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd414d3-ecf3-45b1-8398-b32b08ef77ea\', \'multiverseId\': 337107}, \'multiverseid\': 337107}, {\'name\': \'Niblis du souffle\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{U}, {T} : Vous pouvez engager ou dégager la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« Pourquoi les défunts restent-ils parmi nous ? Pourquoi le vol d\'albâtre ne les conduit-il pas au repos ? Où est Avacyn ? » —Eruth de Lambholt", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58993c12-04c6-444f-91fb-d58984fff5d7\', \'multiverseId\': 336594}, \'multiverseid\': 336594}, {\'name\': \'Niblis del Respiro\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{U}, {T}: Puoi TAPpare o STAPpare una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Perché i morti rimangono in mezzo a noi? Dov\\\'è la Schiera Alabastro per portarli a casa? Dov\\\'è Avacyn?" —Eruth di Lambholt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6cc6b1-d789-4673-b054-ca7b3d949a30\', \'multiverseId\': 337278}, \'multiverseid\': 337278}, {\'name\': \'息吹のニブリス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{U}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップまたはアンタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の中に死者が残るのは何故なのでしょう？ 空翔ける雪花石が導く故郷とはどこなのでしょうか？ アヴァシンはどこにいるのでしょうか？」――ラムホルトのエルス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a1a931-f328-49a4-821a-481b5110b70c\', \'multiverseId\': 337449}, \'multiverseid\': 337449}, {\'name\': \'숨결의 니블리스\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 탭하거나 언탭할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'"왜 망자들이 우리들 사이에 남아있는 것인가? 그들을 인도할 순백 편대는 어디 있는 것인가? 아바신은 어디 있는 것인가?" —램홀트의 에루스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea4c88e-83cc-4c1e-905d-2ee45becc0da\', \'multiverseId\': 336081}, \'multiverseid\': 336081}, {\'name\': \'Niblis da Respiração\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{U}, {T}: Você pode virar ou desvirar a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Por que os mortos permanecem entre nós? Onde está o Bando Alabastro para guiá-los para casa? Onde está Avacyn?" — Eruth de Lambholt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3991e878-9369-4ee6-a864-7b98144274ad\', \'multiverseId\': 336423}, \'multiverseid\': 336423}, {\'name\': \'Ниблис Дыхания\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{U}, {T}: вы можете повернуть или развернуть целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«Почему мертвецы остаются среди нас? Куда подевался Алебастровый Сонм ангелов, который должен провожать их в новый дом? Где Авацина?» — Эрут из Ламбхольта\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e996d2-ba53-496a-a1ef-de7cb954c862\', \'multiverseId\': 336765}, \'multiverseid\': 336765}, {\'name\': \'吐息寒灵\', \'text\': \'{U}，{T}：你可以横置或重置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'「亡者为何留在世上？领我们回家的洁羽在哪里？艾维欣又在哪里？」～羊屯的伊如\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca3f14e-da7c-47ac-886f-03a9f5880aef\', \'multiverseId\': 335910}, \'multiverseid\': 335910}, {\'name\': \'吐息寒靈\', \'text\': \'{U}，{T}：你可以橫置或重置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'「亡者為何留在世上？領我們回家的潔羽在哪裡？艾維欣又在哪裡？」～羊屯的伊如\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'665f03fb-ac0e-4e76-8878-f6a07bffbe22\', \'multiverseId\': 336252}, \'multiverseid\': 336252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avacyns Kollier\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und hat Wachsamkeit.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, bringe einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel, falls sie ein Mensch war.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68420b9b-f681-4ea1-89a0-822bd7812424\', \'multiverseId\': 337081}, \'multiverseid\': 337081}, {\'name\': \'Collar de Avacyn\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene vigilancia.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, si era un Humano, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0bdbfcd-1c68-4683-b3a0-d2d8023ebcf3\', \'multiverseId\': 337252}, \'multiverseid\': 337252}, {\'name\': "Collier d\'Avacyn", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/+0 et a la vigilance.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, si elle était un humain, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336739&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077a206d-2675-484e-b2fd-fba7e1649b92\', \'multiverseId\': 336739}, \'multiverseid\': 336739}, {\'name\': \'Collare di Avacyn\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0 e ha cautela.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, se era un Umano, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37c0b183-9a99-45ab-809a-cebaaa7fa089\', \'multiverseId\': 337423}, \'multiverseid\': 337423}, {\'name\': \'アヴァシンの首飾り\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに警戒を持つ。装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、それが人間だった場合、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。 装備 {2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43a2d50c-d797-4242-b1a4-ec51e1153a88\', \'multiverseId\': 337594}, \'multiverseid\': 337594}, {\'name\': \'아바신의 목걸이\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +1/+0을 받고 경계 능력을 가진다.\\n장착된 생물이 죽을 때마다, 그 생물이 인간이었다면, 비행 능력을 가진 1/1 백색 신령 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\\n장착 {2}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cdb3ef6-5617-4d0a-86b4-3a4b013eef42\', \'multiverseId\': 336226}, \'multiverseid\': 336226}, {\'name\': \'Colar de Avacyn\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+0 e tem vigilância.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morrer, se ela for do tipo Humano, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8e4a22-44e3-4ba7-b0af-baa900f73340\', \'multiverseId\': 336568}, \'multiverseid\': 336568}, {\'name\': \'Ошейник Авацины\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/+0 и имеет Бдительность.\\nКаждый раз когда снаряженное существо умирает, если оно было Человеком, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Дух с Полетом.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44073c10-b94b-4091-99fb-3b3f3b442375\', \'multiverseId\': 336910}, \'multiverseid\': 336910}, {\'name\': \'艾维欣颈环\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0且具有警戒异能。每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，若它是人类，将一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物放进战场。佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c346737e-0f65-4ac6-adc6-bc3b80559416\', \'multiverseId\': 336055}, \'multiverseid\': 336055}, {\'name\': \'艾維欣頸環\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+1/+0且具有警戒異能。每當佩帶此武具的生物死去時，若它是人類，將一個1/1白色，具飛行異能的精靈衍生生物放進戰場。佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df0b08c1-8614-4e10-9c03-b93f0ede9ead\', \'multiverseId\': 336397}, \'multiverseid\': 336397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befallener Abtrünniger // Werwolf-Einsacker\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn diese Kreatur in einen Werwolf-Einsacker transformiert, kannst du ein Artefakt deiner Wahl zerstören. Falls dieses Artefakt auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, fügt der Werwolf-Einsacker dem Beherrscher dieses Artefakts 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Werwolf-Einsacker, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Werwolf-Einsacker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73d2b7b-860c-4dea-8785-50e9586fa1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 337021}, \'multiverseid\': 337021}, {\'name\': \'Desertor afligido // Saqueador licántropo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que esta criatura se transforme en el Saqueador licántropo, puedes destruir el artefacto objetivo. Si ese artefacto es puesto en un cementerio de esta manera, el Saqueador licántropo le hace 3 puntos de daño al controlador de ese artefacto.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Saqueador licántropo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Saqueador licántropo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc95ffd-12d5-4d90-8b6d-e3a7c1290d98\', \'multiverseId\': 337192}, \'multiverseid\': 337192}, {\'name\': \'Déserteur affligé // Saccageur loup-garou\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que cette créature se transforme en Saccageur loup-garou, vous pouvez détruire un artefact ciblé. Si cet artefact est mis dans un cimetière de cette manière, le Saccageur loup-garou inflige 3 blessures au contrôleur de cet artefact.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez le Saccageur loup-garou.\', \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Saccageur loup-garou\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4cb4ac-d69a-4902-8dd6-77f08dc6e7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 336679}, \'multiverseid\': 336679}, {\'name\': \'Disertore Afflitto // Predone Mannaro\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura si trasforma nel Predone Mannaro, puoi distruggere un artefatto bersaglio. Se quell\'artefatto viene messo in un cimitero in questo modo, il Predone Mannaro infligge 3 danni al controllore di quell\'artefatto.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma il Predone Mannaro.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Predone Mannaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75739829-6191-4974-875a-016903838b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 337363}, \'multiverseid\': 337363}, {\'name\': \'苦悩の脱走者 // 狼男の荒らし屋\', \'text\': \'このクリーチャーが狼男の荒らし屋に変身するたび、アーティファクト１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。これによりそのアーティファクトがいずれかの墓地に置かれた場合、狼男の荒らし屋はそのアーティファクトのコントローラーに３点のダメージを与える。各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、狼男の荒らし屋を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'狼男の荒らし屋\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4bbf708-b651-4a4f-958d-627bb149bf4c\', \'multiverseId\': 337534}, \'multiverseid\': 337534}, {\'name\': \'감염된 탈영병 // 늑대인간 약탈자\', \'text\': \'이 생물이 늑대인간 약탈자로 변신할 때마다, 마법물체 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 마법물체를 파괴할 수 있다. 그 마법물체가 이렇게 해서 무덤에 들어간다면, 늑대인간 약탈자는 그 마법물체의 조종자에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 늑대인간 약탈자를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'늑대인간 약탈자\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb807d4-26ff-416c-8139-6dcafc248f30\', \'multiverseId\': 336166}, \'multiverseid\': 336166}, {\'name\': \'Desertor Atormentado // Lobisomem Saqueador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que esta criatura se transformar em Lobisomem Saqueador, você poderá destruir o artefato alvo. Se aquele artefato for colocado num cemitério dessa maneira, Lobisomem Saqueador causará 3 pontos de dano ao controlador daquele artefato.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Lobisomem Saqueador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Lobisomem Saqueador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13823755-37b6-4aba-a449-4137e76ba27b\', \'multiverseId\': 336508}, \'multiverseid\': 336508}, {\'name\': \'Одержимый Дезертир // Вервольф-Погромщик\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда это существо трансформируется в Вервольфа-Погромщика, вы можете уничтожить целевой артефакт. Если тот артефакт попадает на кладбище таким образом, Вервольф-Погромщик наносит 3 повреждения игроку, контролирующему тот артефакт.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Вервольфа-Погромщика.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Вервольф-Погромщик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f340f4-d03d-4b79-9e17-2d21238d8676\', \'multiverseId\': 336850}, \'multiverseid\': 336850}, {\'name\': \'受苦逃亡者 // 搜括狼人\', \'text\': \'每当此生物转化为搜括狼人时，你可以消灭目标神器。如果该神器以此法置入坟墓场，则搜括狼人对该神器的操控者造成3点伤害。在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化搜括狼人。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'搜括狼人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e08cf9-83dc-4c5a-8939-140a77f05348\', \'multiverseId\': 335995}, \'multiverseid\': 335995}, {\'name\': \'受苦逃亡者 // 搜括狼人\', \'text\': \'每當此生物轉化為搜括狼人時，你可以消滅目標神器。如果該神器以此法置入墳墓場，則搜括狼人對該神器的操控者造成3點傷害。在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化搜括狼人。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'搜括狼人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec72c3d-6b80-4cd1-abb0-ae39b6bd6051\', \'multiverseId\': 336337}, \'multiverseid\': 336337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befallener Abtrünniger // Werwolf-Einsacker\', \'text\': \'Transformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Befallenen Abtrünnigen, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Als der erste Vollmond aufging, schwanden die letzten Zweifel an der schrecklichen Wahrheit.\', \'faceName\': \'Befallener Abtrünniger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e73d2b7b-860c-4dea-8785-50e9586fa1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 337021}, \'multiverseid\': 337021}, {\'name\': \'Desertor afligido // Saqueador licántropo\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Desertor afligido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Al salir la primera luna llena desapareció cualquier duda sobre la horrible verdad que escondía.\', \'faceName\': \'Desertor afligido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc95ffd-12d5-4d90-8b6d-e3a7c1290d98\', \'multiverseId\': 337192}, \'multiverseid\': 337192}, {\'name\': \'Déserteur affligé // Saccageur loup-garou\', \'text\': "Au début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez le Déserteur affligé.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "L\'apparition de la première pleine lune dissipa les derniers doutes quant à l\'horrible vérité qui sommeillait en lui.", \'faceName\': \'Déserteur affligé\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a4cb4ac-d69a-4902-8dd6-77f08dc6e7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 336679}, \'multiverseid\': 336679}, {\'name\': \'Disertore Afflitto // Predone Mannaro\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma il Disertore Afflitto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Umano\', \'flavor\': "Il sorgere della prima luna piena cancellò ogni dubbio sull\'orribile verità che vi si nascondeva.", \'faceName\': \'Disertore Afflitto\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75739829-6191-4974-875a-016903838b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 337363}, \'multiverseid\': 337363}, {\'name\': \'苦悩の脱走者 // 狼男の荒らし屋\', \'text\': \'各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、苦悩の脱走者を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狼男\', \'flavor\': \'最初の満月が昇る時、その中の恐ろしい真実への疑いは排除された。\', \'faceName\': \'苦悩の脱走者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4bbf708-b651-4a4f-958d-627bb149bf4c\', \'multiverseId\': 337534}, \'multiverseid\': 337534}, {\'name\': \'감염된 탈영병 // 늑대인간 약탈자\', \'text\': \'각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 감염된 탈영병을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'첫 보름달이 뜨자 더 이상 진실은 숨겨질 수 없었다.\', \'faceName\': \'감염된 탈영병\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb807d4-26ff-416c-8139-6dcafc248f30\', \'multiverseId\': 336166}, \'multiverseid\': 336166}, {\'name\': \'Desertor Atormentado // Lobisomem Saqueador\', \'text\': \'No início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Desertor Atormentado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'A primeira lua cheia eliminou qualquer dúvida com relação à horripilante verdade escondida.\', \'faceName\': \'Desertor Atormentado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13823755-37b6-4aba-a449-4137e76ba27b\', \'multiverseId\': 336508}, \'multiverseid\': 336508}, {\'name\': \'Одержимый Дезертир // Вервольф-Погромщик\', \'text\': \'В начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Одержимого Дезертира.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'С восходом первой полной луны исчезли все сомнения насчет страшной правды, скрывающейся внутри.\', \'faceName\': \'Одержимый Дезертир\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55f340f4-d03d-4b79-9e17-2d21238d8676\', \'multiverseId\': 336850}, \'multiverseid\': 336850}, {\'name\': \'受苦逃亡者 // 搜括狼人\', \'text\': \'在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化受苦逃亡者。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'首度的满月消灭了任何疑虑与埋藏其间的恐怖事实。\', \'faceName\': \'受苦逃亡者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e08cf9-83dc-4c5a-8939-140a77f05348\', \'multiverseId\': 335995}, \'multiverseid\': 335995}, {\'name\': \'受苦逃亡者 // 搜括狼人\', \'text\': \'在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化受苦逃亡者。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'首度的滿月消滅了任何疑慮與埋藏其間的恐怖事實。\', \'faceName\': \'受苦逃亡者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec72c3d-6b80-4cd1-abb0-ae39b6bd6051\', \'multiverseId\': 336337}, \'multiverseid\': 336337}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestie aus Hohlhengel\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'In einer Welt voller Monster sehen Albträume so aus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6129c225-0879-4238-b2ac-c6cb74a22e61\', \'multiverseId\': 337086}, \'multiverseid\': 337086}, {\'name\': \'Bestia de Hollowhenge\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'En un mundo de monstruos, protagoniza las pesadillas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda04895-d00f-4216-a4ee-ee55db8be063\', \'multiverseId\': 337257}, \'multiverseid\': 337257}, {\'name\': \'Bête de Cerclecreux\', \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Dans un monde de monstres, elle est l\'étoffe des cauchemars.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336744&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f424a1b-0a67-4f81-97bd-5d5e76fdcfe9\', \'multiverseId\': 336744}, \'multiverseid\': 336744}, {\'name\': \'Bestia di Fossocavo\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'In un mondo di mostri, è ciò che compone gli incubi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28b5a2d0-5899-4c8f-8c6b-0b117d7824dd\', \'multiverseId\': 337428}, \'multiverseid\': 337428}, {\'name\': \'ホロウヘンジの獣\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'怪物の世界では、それは悪夢の本質だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a85b7f8e-2b67-482a-b543-d86c4d480b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 337599}, \'multiverseid\': 337599}, {\'name\': \'할로우헨지 야수\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'괴물로 가득 찬 세상의 악몽이란 이런 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9177932b-a225-4067-8ae8-1ead77049f14\', \'multiverseId\': 336231}, \'multiverseid\': 336231}, {\'name\': \'Fera de Vale Seco\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Num mundo de monstros encontra-se a essência dos pesadelos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd5858c-998a-41df-bd82-74292864d42d\', \'multiverseId\': 336573}, \'multiverseid\': 336573}, {\'name\': \'Зверь из Холлоухенджа\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'В мире монстров он является в самых страшных кошмарах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'719235ea-934f-4415-90dd-4d7266d34049\', \'multiverseId\': 336915}, \'multiverseid\': 336915}, {\'name\': \'空圆地野兽\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'在这充满怪物的世界，它出没于恶梦中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8385e06-4674-4a14-ac80-43467c20735f\', \'multiverseId\': 336060}, \'multiverseid\': 336060}, {\'name\': \'空圓地野獸\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'在這充滿怪物的世界，它出沒於惡夢中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867685b9-858e-4be6-bff2-d5ca5936af08\', \'multiverseId\': 336402}, \'multiverseid\': 336402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beutegreifender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'Der Beutegreifende Schlamm ist unzerstörbar.\\nImmer wenn der Beutegreifende Schlamm angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt, der in diesem Zug Schaden durch den Beutegreifenden Schlamm zugefügt wurde, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Beutegreifenden Schlamm.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5fedf7-4021-404e-8dc9-7e7d87d6fbb5\', \'multiverseId\': 337084}, \'multiverseid\': 337084}, {\'name\': \'Cieno depredador\', \'text\': \'El Cieno depredador es indestructible.\\nSiempre que el Cieno depredador ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nSiempre que una criatura que haya recibido daño del Cieno depredador este turno muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cieno depredador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90edf716-9d88-4fc9-af12-b206bf137fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 337255}, \'multiverseid\': 337255}, {\'name\': \'Limon prédateur\', \'text\': "Le Limon prédateur est indestructible.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Limon prédateur attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature blessée par le Limon prédateur ce tour-ci meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Limon prédateur.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f28e4a3-3e83-40e6-87c1-7eb77f719eec\', \'multiverseId\': 336742}, \'multiverseid\': 336742}, {\'name\': \'Melma Predatrice\', \'text\': \'La Melma Predatrice è indistruttibile.\\nOgniqualvolta la Melma Predatrice attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Predatrice.\\nOgniqualvolta muore una creatura a cui la Melma Predatrice ha inflitto danno in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Predatrice.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f968f025-00cb-4611-8feb-085b724a978b\', \'multiverseId\': 337426}, \'multiverseid\': 337426}, {\'name\': \'捕食者のウーズ\', \'text\': \'捕食者のウーズは破壊されない。捕食者のウーズが攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。このターン、捕食者のウーズによってダメージを与えられたクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、捕食者のウーズの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a02c72d6-61de-40f1-82d2-92019d800630\', \'multiverseId\': 337597}, \'multiverseid\': 337597}, {\'name\': \'포식자 점액괴물\', \'text\': \'포식자 점액괴물은 파괴될 수 없다.\\n포식자 점액괴물이 공격할 때마다, 포식자 점액괴물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n포식자 점액괴물에게 이 턴에 피해를 입은 생물이 죽을 때마다, 포식자 점액괴물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 점액괴물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aca2a256-1728-49aa-ba77-769fe8279bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 336229}, \'multiverseid\': 336229}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Predador\', \'text\': \'Lodo Predador é indestrutível.\\nToda vez que Lodo Predador atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre ele.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que tiver sofrido dano de Lodo Predador neste turno morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Lodo Predador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1db25c62-c4da-4846-b23b-444db13fe823\', \'multiverseId\': 336571}, \'multiverseid\': 336571}, {\'name\': \'Хищная Тина\', \'text\': \'Хищная Тина не может быть уничтожена.\\nКаждый раз когда Хищная Тина атакует, положите на нее один жетон +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз когда существо, которому Хищная Тина нанесла повреждения в этом ходу, умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Хищную Тину.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e6acf0b-ef97-4057-8ee0-0d013e34f64b\', \'multiverseId\': 336913}, \'multiverseid\': 336913}, {\'name\': \'掠食流浆\', \'text\': \'掠食流浆不会毁坏。每当掠食流浆攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。每当本回合中曾受到掠食流浆伤害的生物死去时，在掠食流浆上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fb1731-e1ac-4fdc-99cd-c9e2b2728676\', \'multiverseId\': 336058}, \'multiverseid\': 336058}, {\'name\': \'掠食流漿\', \'text\': \'掠食流漿不會毀壞。每當掠食流漿攻擊時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。每當本回合中曾受到掠食流漿傷害的生物死去時，在掠食流漿上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～流漿\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6500aada-81ec-4179-b94b-4a5e3100384b\', \'multiverseId\': 336400}, \'multiverseid\': 336400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Ghul\', \'text\': \'Der Blinde Ghul kann nicht blocken.\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Er marschiert blind auf die Tore Thrabens zu, gelenkt nur vom düsteren Willen seines Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93523eff-8286-4d1b-af47-0c786371872f\', \'multiverseId\': 337028}, \'multiverseid\': 337028}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago ciego\', \'text\': \'El Necrófago ciego no puede bloquear.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Marcha ciegamente a las puertas de Thraben, guiado por la voluntad de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509f6e23-82b2-4fea-8467-6e8e2add9ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 337199}, \'multiverseid\': 337199}, {\'name\': \'Goule aveugle\', \'text\': "La Goule aveugle ne peut pas bloquer.\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Aveugle, il avance vers les portes de Thraben, uniquement guidé par la sinistre volonté de son maître.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72761d76-44d0-42ee-9d36-43a630213e95\', \'multiverseId\': 336686}, \'multiverseid\': 336686}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Cieco\', \'text\': \'Il Ghoul Cieco non può bloccare.\\nImmortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Marcia alla cieca verso i cancelli di Thraben, guidato dalla volontà orrenda del suo padrone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'591bf4d3-c204-467c-a629-5f3f4030755d\', \'multiverseId\': 337370}, \'multiverseid\': 337370}, {\'name\': \'盲いたグール\', \'text\': \'盲いたグールではブロックできない。不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'それは主の恐ろしい意思に導かれ、闇雲にスレイベンの門へと進み続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffdf1691-36e7-4f96-9f67-45c65e36781e\', \'multiverseId\': 337541}, \'multiverseid\': 337541}, {\'name\': \'눈먼 악귀\', \'text\': \'눈먼 악귀는 방어할 수 없다.\\n불사 (이 생물이 죽을 때, 만약 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 올라가있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 +1/+1 카운터 한 개가 올라간 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 병사\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 주인의 악랄한 의지에 이끌려, 앞을 보지 않은 채 트레이벤을 공격한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b866bf-7436-4154-a5d2-d3325b56ca48\', \'multiverseId\': 336173}, \'multiverseid\': 336173}, {\'name\': \'Carniçal Cego\', \'text\': \'Carniçal Cego não pode bloquear.\\nImortal (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Ele marcha cego pelos portões de Thraben, guiado pelo desejo insano de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'608a713a-4293-44ce-8b12-e3b88e560408\', \'multiverseId\': 336515}, \'multiverseid\': 336515}, {\'name\': \'Незрячий Упырь\', \'text\': \'Незрячий Упырь не может блокировать.\\nНетленность (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Он слепо шагает к вратам Трейбена, ведомый злой волей своего хозяина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e03143-6cb6-4dba-b4f9-2060826abe01\', \'multiverseId\': 336857}, \'multiverseid\': 336857}, {\'name\': \'盲目食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'盲目食尸鬼不能进行阻挡。不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下返回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'其主子的可怕意念引它向瑟班城门盲目前进。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76a5eea9-5e1e-43ee-a9c3-0061325c503f\', \'multiverseId\': 336002}, \'multiverseid\': 336002}, {\'name\': \'盲目食屍鬼\', \'text\': \'盲目食屍鬼不能進行阻擋。不息（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有+1/+1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下返回戰場，且其上有一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'其主子的可怕意念引它向瑟班城門盲目前進。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9f9a5d-b0f5-4f82-a6b8-c7979c989de0\', \'multiverseId\': 336344}, \'multiverseid\': 336344}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutfehde\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kämpft gegen eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl. (Jede dieser Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Nachfolge ist eine Frage des Blutes und wird oft blutig entschieden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b75a450c-27fb-4d2d-b6f5-0cb2663f3a6a\', \'multiverseId\': 336968}, \'multiverseid\': 336968}, {\'name\': \'Feudo de sangre\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo lucha con otra criatura objetivo. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La sucesión es un tema de sangre, y con sangre se decide.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba27f6fb-b648-4eb3-9855-926a3ae5236e\', \'multiverseId\': 337139}, \'multiverseid\': 337139}, {\'name\': \'Luttes sanglantes\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée se bat contre une autre créature ciblée. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La succession est une question de sang, et c\'est souvent par ce dernier qu\'elle est décidée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336626&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7905a306-685c-4b81-9be0-82acfbbb6fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 336626}, \'multiverseid\': 336626}, {\'name\': \'Faida di Sangue\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio lotta con un\'altra creatura bersaglio. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La successione è una questione di sangue ed è spesso decisa proprio col sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a8d926-268b-4186-869c-b86ba97ffcbc\', \'multiverseId\': 337310}, \'multiverseid\': 337310}, {\'name\': \'血の抗争\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。&\\n（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'継承は血統の問題であるが、血流によって決まることも多々ある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd8aabdc-7460-4531-b215-8c31cbab6f15\', \'multiverseId\': 337481}, \'multiverseid\': 337481}, {\'name\': \'혈족의 분쟁\', \'text\': \'생물 두 개를 목표로 정한다. 정해진 생물들은 서로 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'계승은 핏줄의 문제라서 대부분의 경우 유혈 사태로 결정된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd30f16-2da8-4f4f-9935-f06ab26dedf4\', \'multiverseId\': 336113}, \'multiverseid\': 336113}, {\'name\': \'Rixa de Sangue\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo luta com outra criatura alvo. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A sucessão é uma questão de sangue, e geralmente é decidida com o próprio sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81100d31-4c1c-4ba9-8235-eacfac5a8374\', \'multiverseId\': 336455}, \'multiverseid\': 336455}, {\'name\': \'Кровная Вражда\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо дерется с другим целевым существом. (Эти существа наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Преемственность — вопрос крови, и решается он зачастую тоже кровью.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5a789a-5c15-48ec-807e-90ae6033005d\', \'multiverseId\': 336797}, \'multiverseid\': 336797}, {\'name\': \'不共血仇\', \'text\': \'目标生物与另一个目标生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'继任问题会导致流血，也通常要以流血解决。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d3c2286-6773-45e4-bedc-685e1194a56d\', \'multiverseId\': 335942}, \'multiverseid\': 335942}, {\'name\': \'不共血仇\', \'text\': \'目標生物與另一個目標生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'繼任問題會導致流血，也通常要以流血解決。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b2d185-3cf7-4091-b2d1-2566bd81f197\', \'multiverseId\': 336284}, \'multiverseid\': 336284}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafte Schatten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der verzauberten Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie ihrem Beherrscher ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Lasst uns diesen Menschenherden wieder einmal zeigen, warum sie die Schatten dieser Welt fürchten." —Aldreg, Skirsdag-Kultist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f14dd26-e9fb-4146-915c-9ae2b54c362d\', \'multiverseId\': 337017}, \'multiverseid\': 337017}, {\'name\': \'Sombras malévolas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada reciba daño, le hace esa misma cantidad de daño a su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Recordémosle a este ganado humano por qué le temen a las sombras de este mundo." —Aldreg, cultista Skirsdag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f74709d-e53a-426a-8529-8219a78a12e2\', \'multiverseId\': 337188}, \'multiverseid\': 337188}, {\'name\': \'Ombres malignes\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée subit des blessures, elle inflige autant de blessures à son contrôleur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Rappelons à ce bétail humain pourquoi il craint les ombres de ce monde. » —Aldreg, cultiste de Skirsdag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b86d89b-0297-47b7-9a40-530addc6c0b7\', \'multiverseId\': 336675}, \'multiverseid\': 336675}, {\'name\': \'Ombre Astiose\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno alla creatura incantata, essa infligge altrettanti danni al suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Ricordiamo a questo bestiame umano perché teme le ombre di questo mondo." —Aldreg, cultista Skirsdag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e441bcb5-1d84-4801-b555-ab7049834357\', \'multiverseId\': 337359}, \'multiverseid\': 337359}, {\'name\': \'悪意に満ちた影\', \'text\': \'エンチャントされているクリーチャーにダメージが与えられるたび、それはその点数に等しい点数のダメージをそれのコントローラーに与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「この家畜としての人間が、何故この世界の影におびえるかを心に留めよ。」―スカースダグの信者、アルドレグ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0932677b-4fdb-4c71-927f-ac8e599a70c9\', \'multiverseId\': 337530}, \'multiverseid\': 337530}, {\'name\': \'악의로 가득 찬 그림자\', \'text\': \'부여된 생물이 피해를 입을 때마다, 그 생물은 자신의 조종자에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"이 나약한 인간들에게 왜 이 세상의 그림자를 두려워해야 하는지를 상기시켜줍시다." —스커스대그 광신도 알드레그\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77f802eb-f7e0-472a-b896-e8f336626913\', \'multiverseId\': 336162}, \'multiverseid\': 336162}, {\'name\': \'Sombras Malévolas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada sofre dano, ela causa uma quantidade equivalente de dano ao seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos lembrar a esse rebanho humano por que eles têm medo das sombras deste mundo." — Aldreg, cultista Skirsdag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427e052e-c86b-4d4d-96db-9284739b8e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 336504}, \'multiverseid\': 336504}, {\'name\': \'Зловредные Тени\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКаждый раз когда зачарованное существо получает повреждения, оно наносит столько же повреждений контролирующему его игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Давайте напомним этому человеческому стаду, почему они боятся теней этого мира». — Алдрег, последователь Скирдагского культа\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0de6c97-c861-46aa-9993-105aca7e7eb4\', \'multiverseId\': 336846}, \'multiverseid\': 336846}, {\'name\': \'怨毒身影\', \'text\': \'每当所结附的生物受到伤害时，它对其操控者造成等量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「让我们来提醒这些人类笨牛，他们为何该害怕这世界的影子。」～史革达教众埃焯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b76f10-02a8-4468-b90a-50a8bd9d9c6b\', \'multiverseId\': 335991}, \'multiverseid\': 335991}, {\'name\': \'怨毒身影\', \'text\': \'每當所結附的生物受到傷害時，它對其操控者造成等量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「讓我們來提醒這些人類笨牛，他們為何該害怕這世界的影子。」～史革達教眾埃焯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b9176ad-896e-4add-bcd8-6d033a88a8d8\', \'multiverseId\': 336333}, \'multiverseid\': 336333}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brennendes Öl\', \'text\': \'Brennendes Öl fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {3}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ab und zu kann auch der Schabernack eines Teufels zu einer guten Idee führen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337048&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e08a1b6-9403-42a4-a501-2235e1561859\', \'multiverseId\': 337048}, \'multiverseid\': 337048}, {\'name\': \'Aceite ardiente\', \'text\': \'El Aceite ardiente hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'De vez en cuando, la broma de un diablo puede darte una buena idea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70be7116-807d-4f8d-a8a0-2b8522acb9e8\', \'multiverseId\': 337219}, \'multiverseid\': 337219}, {\'name\': \'Huile brûlante\', \'text\': "L\'Huile brûlante inflige 3 blessures à une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'De temps en temps, une mauvaise plaisanterie de démon vous donne une bonne idée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12026823-8849-4158-9aba-33650a761d73\', \'multiverseId\': 336706}, \'multiverseid\': 336706}, {\'name\': \'Olio Bollente\', \'text\': "L\'Olio Bollente infligge 3 danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni tanto, lo scherzo di un diavolo può darti una buona idea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64cdaf9d-bf35-4879-835c-927b9a363302\', \'multiverseId\': 337390}, \'multiverseid\': 337390}, {\'name\': \'燃える油\', \'text\': \'攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。燃える油はそれに３点のダメージを与える。フラッシュバック {3}{W} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'時折、小悪魔の悪戯が良いアイデアとなることもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52ea87b3-0f22-489f-92a4-00eed8d85382\', \'multiverseId\': 337561}, \'multiverseid\': 337561}, {\'name\': \'불타는 기름\', \'text\': \'공격생물이나 방어생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 불타는 기름은 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\\n회상 {3}{W} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'악령의 장난이 영감을 주는 경우도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fbb4fee-87d2-4f2f-bc03-a67f432b6c89\', \'multiverseId\': 336193}, \'multiverseid\': 336193}, {\'name\': \'Óleo Ardente\', \'text\': \'Óleo Ardente causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora.\\nRecapitular {3}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'De vez em quando, uma diabrura pode se transformar numa boa ideia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d410fdcf-a76b-41a7-b5ba-db683f8f3d44\', \'multiverseId\': 336535}, \'multiverseid\': 336535}, {\'name\': \'Горящее Масло\', \'text\': \'Горящее Масло наносит 3 повреждения целевому атакующему или блокирующему существу.\\nВоспоминание {3}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Время от времени проделка дьявола может дать вам неплохую идею.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d431fc9-6f1f-48de-82f7-5caa5178699d\', \'multiverseId\': 336877}, \'multiverseid\': 336877}, {\'name\': \'燃烧油\', \'text\': \'燃烧油对目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物造成3点伤害。\\n返照{3}{W} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼的恶戏总不时能让你想出好主意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef82ad0a-887e-463f-8865-14fa887af083\', \'multiverseId\': 336022}, \'multiverseid\': 336022}, {\'name\': \'燃燒油\', \'text\': \'燃燒油對目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物造成3點傷害。\\n返照{3}{W}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼的惡戲總不時能讓你想出好主意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812da007-302b-4ffd-af8f-188d98cace56\', \'multiverseId\': 336364}, \'multiverseid\': 336364}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Rudel füttern\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine Kreatur opfern, die kein Spielstein ist. Falls du dies tust, bringe X 2/2 grüne Wolf-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel, wobei X die Widerstandskraft der geopferten Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337076&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e421b6e-dde9-4a62-9f54-6dd95cbcefda\', \'multiverseId\': 337076}, \'multiverseid\': 337076}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar a la manada\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, puedes sacrificar una criatura que no sea ficha. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla X fichas de criatura Lobo verde 2/2, donde X es la resistencia de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164e193b-fd89-4ca7-9b61-a1a4beca1cc8\', \'multiverseId\': 337247}, \'multiverseid\': 337247}, {\'name\': \'Nourrir la meute\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature non-jeton. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez X jetons de créature 2/2 verte Loup sur le champ de bataille, X étant l\'endurance de la créature sacrifiée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336734&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9516116-fbdc-4513-a4c8-41ab4dd0e805\', \'multiverseId\': 336734}, \'multiverseid\': 336734}, {\'name\': \'Nutrire il Branco\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi sacrificare una creatura non pedina. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia X pedine creatura Lupo 2/2 verdi, dove X è la costituzione della creatura sacrificata.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc67d9e6-8511-4f06-9707-d069aca093dc\', \'multiverseId\': 337418}, \'multiverseid\': 337418}, {\'name\': \'群れに餌\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはトークンでないクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうした場合、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体戦場に出す。Ｘは、その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfdc0eb-d16f-4b16-8d01-2eb2e16968c9\', \'multiverseId\': 337589}, \'multiverseid\': 337589}, {\'name\': \'늑대 먹이\', \'text\': \'당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신은 토큰이 아닌 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 2/2 녹색 늑대 토큰 X개를 전장에 놓는다. X는 희생된 생물의 방어력이다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cd7c95c-a2d5-49d1-98fc-6629a49bb62b\', \'multiverseId\': 336221}, \'multiverseid\': 336221}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar a Alcateia\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, você pode sacrificar uma criatura que não seja uma ficha. Se fizer isso, coloque no campo de batalha X fichas de criatura verdes 2/2 do tipo Lobo, sendo X igual à resistência da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac849c91-c4ac-465b-83c8-a8c059893e8f\', \'multiverseId\': 336563}, \'multiverseid\': 336563}, {\'name\': \'Кормежка Стаи\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага вы можете пожертвовать не являющееся фишкой существо. Если вы это делаете, положите на поле битвы X фишек существа 2/2 зеленый Волк, где X — выносливость пожертвованного существа.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'233dc403-56bc-4b11-9758-eb0a9dd08bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 336905}, \'multiverseid\': 336905}, {\'name\': \'喂食狼群\', \'text\': \'在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以牺牲一个非衍生物的生物。若你如此作，将X个2/2绿色狼衍生生物放进战场，X为所牺牲之生物的防御力。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e49118a-4a63-4431-8eb1-3b228375914e\', \'multiverseId\': 336050}, \'multiverseid\': 336050}, {\'name\': \'餵食狼群\', \'text\': \'在你的結束步驟開始時，你可以犧牲一個非衍生物的生物。若你如此作，將X個2/2綠色狼衍生生物放進戰場，X為所犧牲之生物的防禦力。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6ee57f-c208-4467-8976-400d714da77e\', \'multiverseId\': 336392}, \'multiverseid\': 336392}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Bürger versammeln\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\\nSchicksalsstunde — Falls du 5 Lebenspunkte oder weniger hast, bringe stattdessen fünf dieser Spielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Aus der Erinnerung an die Gefallenen holen sie die Stärke, die sie zur Verteidigung ihrer Stadt benötigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337030&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a2597c6-a45d-405c-aceb-31709e1e62a7\', \'multiverseId\': 337030}, \'multiverseid\': 337030}, {\'name\': \'Reunir a los aldeanos\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1.\\nHora fatídica — Si tienes 5 vidas o menos, en vez de eso, pon en el campo de batalla cinco de esas fichas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En el recuerdo de aquellos que perdieron está la fortaleza para defender su ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f08512-40c4-4968-a87e-6e2598df3c1c\', \'multiverseId\': 337201}, \'multiverseid\': 337201}, {\'name\': \'Rassemblement des citadins\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nHeure fatidique — Si vous avez 5 points de vie ou moins, mettez sur le champ de bataille cinq de ces jetons à la place.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans les souvenirs de ceux qu\'ils ont perdus réside la force nécessaire pour défendre leur ville.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336688&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846dd320-8594-4269-8433-0a9a0bbf56a8\', \'multiverseId\': 336688}, \'multiverseid\': 336688}, {\'name\': \'Radunare i Cittadini\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche.\\nOra fatidica — Se hai 5 o meno punti vita, metti invece sul campo di battaglia cinque di quelle pedine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Nei ricordi di coloro che hanno perso trovano la forza necessaria a difendere la loro città.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07355cac-f4a6-4be1-ac8f-b8a76fe1622c\', \'multiverseId\': 337372}, \'multiverseid\': 337372}, {\'name\': \'町民の結集\', \'text\': \'白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。窮地 ― あなたのライフが５点以下である場合、代わりにそれらのトークンを５体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼らが失った仲間への想いの中には、街を守るために必要な力がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94ab297-64c7-4a2d-b918-d6906bc0ff20\', \'multiverseId\': 337543}, \'multiverseid\': 337543}, {\'name\': \'주민 소집\', \'text\': \'1/1 백색 인간 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다.\\n운명의 시간 — 만약 당신의 생명이 5점 이하라면, 대신에 그런 토큰 다섯 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'그들은 잃어버린 자들을 기억하며 도시를 지키는 데 필요한 힘을 얻는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5260bea-c8b9-46e9-a917-3859efe9ae4f\', \'multiverseId\': 336175}, \'multiverseid\': 336175}, {\'name\': \'Reunir o Povo\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura brancas 1/1 do tipo Humano.\\nHora fatal — Se você tiver 5 ou menos pontos de vida, em vez disso, coloque cinco dessas fichas no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nas lembranças dos entes queridos eles encontram as forças de que precisam para defender a sua cidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc2517a8-866a-4193-8e87-5520a12f332b\', \'multiverseId\': 336517}, \'multiverseid\': 336517}, {\'name\': \'Сбор Горожан\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 1/1 белый Человек.\\nРоковой час — Если количество ваших жизней меньше или равно 5, положите на поле битвы пять таких фишек вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В памяти о тех, кого они потеряли, заключается сила, необходимая для защиты их города.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d06f2e49-ef91-4797-acd4-e0db821ff233\', \'multiverseId\': 336859}, \'multiverseid\': 336859}, {\'name\': \'集合镇民\', \'text\': \'将两个1/1白色人类衍生生物放进战场。命悬一刻～如果你的生命为5或更少，则改为将五个上述的衍生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'对逝去事物的追忆化为他们守护市镇所需的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e39f0b41-170c-43dd-be26-b3940ad7b004\', \'multiverseId\': 336004}, \'multiverseid\': 336004}, {\'name\': \'集合鎮民\', \'text\': \'將兩個1/1白色人類衍生生物放進戰場。命懸一刻～如果你的生命為5或更少，則改為將五個上述的衍生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'對逝去事物的追憶化為他們守護市鎮所需的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec7c7809-6cbd-45d8-ae2d-462a804d7761\', \'multiverseId\': 336346}, \'multiverseid\': 336346}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Felder abbrennen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Die Felder abbrennen fügt jeder Mensch-Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine Felder werden so schwarz wie die Zunge eines Ghuls werden, und du wirst nur Feuer ernten können." —Minaldra, die Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a48185f-8774-4cd2-940a-c4d4478fb758\', \'multiverseId\': 337050}, \'multiverseid\': 337050}, {\'name\': \'Quemar los campos\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo. Quemar los campos hace 1 punto de daño a cada criatura Humano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sus campos se volverán negros como la lengua de un necrófago, y el fuego será su única cosecha." —Minaldra, la Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c09eb404-d2fb-4c66-a5b2-ec00ebb05a8f\', \'multiverseId\': 337221}, \'multiverseid\': 337221}, {\'name\': \'Brûlez les champs !\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le terrain ciblé. Brûlez les champs inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature Humain.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Vos champs deviendront aussi noirs que la langue d\'une goule et le feu sera votre unique moisson. » —Minaldra, la Vizag Atum", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81342dd0-d57e-4cb8-a889-67a20a70a483\', \'multiverseId\': 336708}, \'multiverseid\': 336708}, {\'name\': \'Bruciare i Campi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio. Bruciare i Campi infligge 1 danno a ogni creatura Umano.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"I vostri campi diventeranno neri come la lingua di un ghoul e il fuoco sarà il vostro unico raccolto." —Minaldra, la Vizag Atum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d58ec5e-cc65-442d-9922-4548008bac83\', \'multiverseId\': 337392}, \'multiverseid\': 337392}, {\'name\': \'野の焼き払い\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、その土地を破壊する。野の焼き払いは各人間・クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「お前たちの地はグールの舌の如く黒くなり、手に入る物は火のみとなりましょう。」――ヴィザグ・アトゥムのミナルドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581ad04c-d30d-4cbc-8c82-f9f7f4f69b32\', \'multiverseId\': 337563}, \'multiverseid\': 337563}, {\'name\': \'논밭 불태우기\', \'text\': \'대지 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 파괴한다. 논밭 불태우기는 각 인간 생물에게 피해 1점씩을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네놈의 농장은 악귀의 혀처럼 검게 변할 것이고, 꽃피는 건 불꽃 밖에 없을 것이다." —비자그 아툼의 수장 미날드라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1cfd0e6-6a7b-48fa-9dd5-c7cffeeaae3b\', \'multiverseId\': 336195}, \'multiverseid\': 336195}, {\'name\': \'Inflamar os Campos\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo. Inflamar os Campos causa 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura do tipo Humano.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Seus terrenos ficarão tão pretos quanto a língua de um carniçal e o fogo será sua única colheita." — Minaldra, a Vizag Athum\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'068378d1-33c0-4748-bea8-6318b1d2269f\', \'multiverseId\': 336537}, \'multiverseid\': 336537}, {\'name\': \'Спалить Поля\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю. Спалить Поля наносит 1 повреждение каждому существу-Человеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ваши поля почернеют, как язык упыря, а огонь станет единственным урожаем». — Миналдра, Визаг Атум\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cceec23c-185e-48b6-9ada-d9d4ed2fa903\', \'multiverseId\': 336879}, \'multiverseid\': 336879}, {\'name\': \'火焚原野\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。火焚原野对每个人类生物各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「愿你的田野漆黑如食尸鬼的舌头；愿火焰是你唯一的收成。」～威泽腾米娜查\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37076c78-2557-4875-818b-b2acea276c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 336024}, \'multiverseid\': 336024}, {\'name\': \'火焚原野\', \'text\': \'消滅目標地。火焚原野對每個人類生物各造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「願你的田野漆黑如食屍鬼的舌頭；願火焰是你唯一的收成。」～威澤騰米娜查\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d69614d9-ad7b-44e9-a646-8a842ef1e399\', \'multiverseId\': 336366}, \'multiverseid\': 336366}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Seegräber ernten\', \'text\': \'Bringe einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel.\\nRückblende {4}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Wrack hing im zackigen Riff und gab jede Nacht mehr von seiner grausigen Fracht frei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24478211-0b99-47b6-ac2c-58ce3060e8f4\', \'multiverseId\': 336974}, \'multiverseid\': 336974}, {\'name\': \'Cosechar las tumbamarinas\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los restos del naufragio permanecían en el arrecife, esparciendo cada noche parte de su carga horripilante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e0a2899-0415-4a39-a8fd-496acb4d02c6\', \'multiverseId\': 337145}, \'multiverseid\': 337145}, {\'name\': \'Fenaison du seegraf\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\nFlashback {4}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'épave, éventrée par le récif tranchant, se vidait chaque nuit un peu plus de sa sinistre cargaison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336632&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'789749fa-9735-4931-b363-9430ec832f46\', \'multiverseId\': 336632}, \'multiverseid\': 336632}, {\'name\': \'Raccolto nel Cimitero Marino\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\nFlashback {4}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il relitto rimaneva appeso alla scogliera frastagliata, vomitando ogni notte sempre più del suo carico orribile.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c03e8497-3639-4321-91a6-6f5453f904f9\', \'multiverseId\': 337316}, \'multiverseid\': 337316}, {\'name\': \'海墓の刈り取り\', \'text\': \'黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。フラッシュバック {4}{B} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'残骸はギザギザの岩礁に残り続け、毎夜さらなる陰惨な積み荷を吐き出し続けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23525699-6e7c-482a-910f-858b7d4d96a5\', \'multiverseId\': 337487}, \'multiverseid\': 337487}, {\'name\': \'수중묘지 수확\', \'text\': \'2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\\n회상 {4}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'난파선은 암초에 걸린 채 매일 밤마다 흉측한 화물을 조금씩 토해냈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4864140-3574-41e6-83c3-8b5ca845f8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 336119}, \'multiverseid\': 336119}, {\'name\': \'Colheita de Cemitério Marinho\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi.\\nRecapitular {4}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A carcaça do navio ficou presa nos recifes, e toda noite libera uma parte de sua carga sinistra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f11b5d57-469f-4fdf-9c31-d7b2696fe538\', \'multiverseId\': 336461}, \'multiverseid\': 336461}, {\'name\': \'Урожай Морского Могильника\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\nВоспоминание {4}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Затонувший корабль сидел на изрезанном рифе, ночь за ночью высвобождая очередную партию своего страшного груза.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'647c4089-7d70-4d72-8a9f-5ee0c7db17f9\', \'multiverseId\': 336803}, \'multiverseid\': 336803}, {\'name\': \'收获海墓\', \'text\': \'将一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物放进战场。\\n返照{4}{U} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'船骸搁浅在尖锐礁岩上，每晚都会吐出些恶心货物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866cc476-ad95-44f2-900d-fcc8099daab4\', \'multiverseId\': 335948}, \'multiverseid\': 335948}, {\'name\': \'收獲海墓\', \'text\': \'將一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物放進戰場。\\n返照{4}{U}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'船骸擱淺在尖銳礁岩上，每晚都會吐出些噁心貨物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff428b69-a0df-42a9-a40b-201b9d9a01d8\', \'multiverseId\': 336290}, \'multiverseid\': 336290}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Tür verrammeln\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +0/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Auch wenn sie nach nichts aussieht, es ist eine gute alte Tür mit starken Schutzzaubern. Sie wird halten." —Olgard vom Schildvolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337077&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2b5b3b-d1ec-499d-ad8e-8d9c12e50d73\', \'multiverseId\': 337077}, \'multiverseid\': 337077}, {\'name\': \'Bloquear la puerta\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +0/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede no parecerlo, pero es una buena puerta con fuertes guardas. Aguantará." —Olgard de los skiltfolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3279c4b2-2401-45ce-96c7-8b72b1e9d908\', \'multiverseId\': 337248}, \'multiverseid\': 337248}, {\'name\': \'Barricadez la porte !\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +0/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Elle n\'en a pas l\'air comme ça, mais c\'est une bonne vieille porte avec des défenses très puissantes. Elle tiendra. » —Olgard des Skiltfolk", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07fd316c-f1bd-4b09-bd7c-f5bedb13a348\', \'multiverseId\': 336735}, \'multiverseid\': 336735}, {\'name\': \'Sprangare La Porta\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli prendono +0/+4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Può sembrare poco resistente, ma è una vecchia porta robusta con protezioni rinforzate. Terrà." —Olgard degli Skiltfolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3ebc573-00c8-4f2a-8fbc-9e35d8fb8f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 337419}, \'multiverseid\': 337419}, {\'name\': \'扉に閂\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで＋０/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「大したことはないように見えるかもしれないが、頑丈な防護付きの古き良き扉だ。耐えてくれるだろうさ。」――スキルトの民のオルガード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60ff2ad-8368-4cde-bce2-692f58d172dc\', \'multiverseId\': 337590}, \'multiverseid\': 337590}, {\'name\': \'문 걸어잠그기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +0/+4를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"별볼일 없어 보여도 강한 보호마법이 걸려 있는 오래된 문일세. 버티기엔 충분할 거야." —스킬트폴크 방어투사단의 올가드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05202875-c60d-48cd-baa0-160fbdeade38\', \'multiverseId\': 336222}, \'multiverseid\': 336222}, {\'name\': \'Barrar a Porta\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla recebem +0/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pode não parecer grande coisa, mas é uma porta antiga e robusta com protetores mágicos potentes. Vai aguentar." — Olgard dos Skiltfolk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ca4e5d-91fc-431f-9b9b-bcc0f5e99633\', \'multiverseId\': 336564}, \'multiverseid\': 336564}, {\'name\': \'Запереть на Засов\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают +0/+4 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«С первого взгляда, может, и не скажешь, но это добротная старая дверь с сильными оберегами. Она выдержит». — Ольгард из отряда скилтфолков\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'897ef70c-a355-4c75-b133-97dce8893f03\', \'multiverseId\': 336906}, \'multiverseid\': 336906}, {\'name\': \'闩住大门\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+0/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「这门看来虽不起眼，但的确带着实实在在的守护。它能挡得住。」～技卫士欧贾得\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e398a1a-d3f2-4ae8-8416-48dae92706d1\', \'multiverseId\': 336051}, \'multiverseid\': 336051}, {\'name\': \'閂住大門\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物得+0/+4直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「這門看來雖不起眼，但的確帶著實實在在的守護。它能擋得住。」～技衛士歐賈得\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7144bea3-5baa-4d4c-88ca-1ac6ee3a26a5\', \'multiverseId\': 336393}, \'multiverseid\': 336393}]', "[{'name': 'Drogskol-Hauptmann', 'text': 'Andere Geist-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und sind fluchsicher. (Sie können nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Geist, Soldat', 'flavor': 'Ob tot oder lebendig: Echte Anführer können jederzeit ihre Armee anspornen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336978&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13b18047-62c3-46f7-af75-1fd94d111b55', 'multiverseId': 336978}, 'multiverseid': 336978}, {'name': 'Capitán Drogskol', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nLas otras criaturas Espíritu que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen antimaleficio. (No pueden ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlen tus oponentes.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado espíritu', 'flavor': 'Vivos o muertos, los verdaderos líderes pueden inspirar a todo un ejército.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337149&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f04e04af-4715-4c08-b826-944e3cb19cfe', 'multiverseId': 337149}, 'multiverseid': 337149}, {'name': 'Capitaine du drogskol', 'text': 'Vol\\nLes autres créatures Esprit que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la défense talismanique. (Elles ne peuvent pas être les cibles de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)', 'type': 'Créature : esprit et soldat', 'flavor': 'Morts ou vifs, les véritables chefs peuvent inspirer toute une armée.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336636&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db8c1b06-8b3c-40e7-8b34-901f732d5bfb', 'multiverseId': 336636}, 'multiverseid': 336636}, {'name': 'Capitano dei Drogskol', 'text': 'Volare\\nLe altre creature Spirito che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno anti-malocchio. (Non possono essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Spirito', 'flavor': 'Vivi o morti, i veri leader possono ispirare un intero esercito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337320&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99873383-7d65-4b53-8b9d-809a3fe90207', 'multiverseId': 337320}, 'multiverseid': 337320}, {'name': 'ドラグスコルの隊長', 'text': '飛行\\nあなたがコントロールする他のスピリット・クリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに呪禁を持つ。（それはあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士', 'flavor': '真の指揮官は、生死に関わらず軍全体を鼓舞する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337491&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78cb555c-3547-40a1-b061-054019227b30', 'multiverseId': 337491}, 'multiverseid': 337491}, {'name': '드로그스콜 대장', 'text': '당신이 조종하는 다른 신령 생물들은 +1/+1을 받고 방호 능력을 가진다. (그 생물들은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)', 'type': '생물 — 신령 병사', 'flavor': '진정한 지도자란 사후에도 살아있을 때처럼 군대를 이끌 수 있는 자다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336123&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72d060ef-5d96-44c1-9621-6adaf4f067bb', 'multiverseId': 336123}, 'multiverseid': 336123}, {'name': 'Capitão Drogskol', 'text': 'Voar\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Espírito que você controla recebem +1/+1 e têm resistência à magia. (Elas não podem ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades controladas por seus oponentes.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Espírito Soldado', 'flavor': 'Mortos ou vivos, os verdadeiros líderes podem inspirar um exército inteiro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336465&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '724932b0-48c9-4c16-b3c3-625484d63285', 'multiverseId': 336465}, 'multiverseid': 336465}, {'name': 'Дрогсколский Капитан', 'text': 'Полет\\nДругие существа-Духи под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и имеют Порчеустойчивость. (Они не могут быть целями заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших противников.)', 'type': 'Существо — Дух Солдат', 'flavor': 'Живые или мертвые, истинные предводители способны вдохновить целую армию.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336807&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8bdebd2e-a03d-4d27-b18a-844cb08a9337', 'multiverseId': 336807}, 'multiverseid': 336807}, {'name': '卓兹克队长', 'text': '由你操控的其他精怪生物得+1/+1并具有辟邪异能。（它们不能成为由对手所操控之咒语或异能的目标。）', 'type': '生物～精怪／士兵', 'flavor': '不论死活，真正的领导者都能激励整个部队。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335952&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd275228-13ee-43a1-a6dd-f15e02a43bcf', 'multiverseId': 335952}, 'multiverseid': 335952}, {'name': '卓茲克隊長', 'text': '由你操控的其他精靈生物得+1/+1並具有辟邪異能。（它們不能成為由對手所操控之咒語或異能的目標。）', 'type': '生物～精靈／士兵', 'flavor': '不論死活，真正的領導者都能激勵整個部隊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336294&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09cc04cd-6ca3-45d6-a0c9-33a00251576b', 'multiverseId': 336294}, 'multiverseid': 336294}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drogskol-Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Doppelschlag, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Von Pein durchdrungen und verzerrt sucht er verzweifelt nach anderen Seelen, die er mit in sein ewiges Gefängnis ziehen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337079&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d7c0606-0fba-47df-95ec-8d02aa27c168\', \'multiverseId\': 337079}, \'multiverseid\': 337079}, {\'name\': \'Desgarrador Drogskol\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña dos veces, vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que ganes vidas, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Quebrado por el dolor, busca obsesivamente otras almas para almacenar en su prisión eterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1db810c1-7f69-4a73-b8c0-3f793b529c82\', \'multiverseId\': 337250}, \'multiverseid\': 337250}, {\'name\': \'Pillard du drogskol\', \'text\': \'Vol, double initiative, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "Fou d\'angoisse, il traque d\'autres âmes pour les collectionner dans sa prison éternelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09423894-769c-4f09-a896-b3e902c130cd\', \'multiverseId\': 336737}, \'multiverseid\': 336737}, {\'name\': \'Drogskol Razziatore\', \'text\': \'Volare, doppio attacco, legame vitale\\nOgniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Tormentato e deformato dalla sofferenza, cerca ossessivamente altre anime da accumulare nella sua prigione eterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e05d70-7895-4766-b13a-1cc20e3a6a60\', \'multiverseId\': 337421}, \'multiverseid\': 337421}, {\'name\': \'ドラグスコルの肉裂き\', \'text\': \'飛行、二段攻撃、絆魂\\nあなたがライフを得るたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'苦悶に痛めつけられねじくれたそれは、永遠の牢獄に閉じ込めるための新たな魂を取り憑かれたかのように探し続けている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67678604-9ff0-49ee-9758-72bd847a209e\', \'multiverseId\': 337592}, \'multiverseid\': 337592}, {\'name\': \'드로그스콜 강탈자\', \'text\': \'비행, 이단공격, 생명연결\\n당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'괴로움에 시달려 뒤틀린 그것은 자신과 함께 영혼의 감옥에서 고통을 받을 자들을 끊임없이 찾아다닌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ac521a-532f-4716-a428-3ab4387d70e4\', \'multiverseId\': 336224}, \'multiverseid\': 336224}, {\'name\': \'Despojador Drogskol\', \'text\': \'Voar, golpe duplo, vínculo com a vida\\nToda vez que ganhar pontos de vida, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Angustiado e amargurado, ele busca obsessivamente outras almas para adicionar a sua coleção em sua prisão eterna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0775ca-68a0-4216-9b80-1395f43f6594\', \'multiverseId\': 336566}, \'multiverseid\': 336566}, {\'name\': \'Дрогсколский Громила\', \'text\': \'Полет, Двойной удар, Цепь жизни\\nКаждый раз когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Сокрушенный и покоробленный страданием, он одержим поисками других душ, чтобы заточить их в своей вечной темнице.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68fbdd8c-36b2-49d8-bf59-c2bb18ea6640\', \'multiverseId\': 336908}, \'multiverseid\': 336908}, {\'name\': \'卓兹克裂肢灵\', \'text\': \'飞行，连击，系命\\n每当你获得生命时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'它被极度痛苦所充盈而扭曲，亟欲将其他灵魂囚入自己的永恒牢笼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce126cec-c791-44da-b9ad-93fa2be5388a\', \'multiverseId\': 336053}, \'multiverseid\': 336053}, {\'name\': \'卓茲克裂肢靈\', \'text\': \'飛行，連擊，繫命\\n每當你獲得生命時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'它被極度痛苦所充盈而扭曲，亟欲將其他靈魂囚入自己的永恆牢籠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b89bf630-8ffd-452a-8fca-056c264c3bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 336395}, \'multiverseid\': 336395}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerungshirsch\', \'text\': \'{G}, opfere den Dämmerungshirsch: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'Still wie der Schnee im Winter sucht er Plätze in der Wildnis, die noch nicht von den wandernden Toten verunreinigt sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7faa5aa-5a1d-4ab8-a084-05c588f542bf\', \'multiverseId\': 336951}, \'multiverseid\': 336951}, {\'name\': \'Alce huella del alba\', \'text\': \'{G}, sacrificar el Alce huella del alba: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Silencioso como la nieve invernal, busca lugares salvajes no arruinados por los muertos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52a08efd-2753-4fdd-8b03-f9c26c8a54bf\', \'multiverseId\': 337122}, \'multiverseid\': 337122}, {\'name\': "Élan fouleur d\'aube", \'text\': "{G}, sacrifiez l\'Élan fouleur d\'aube : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': "Silencieux comme la neige d\'hiver, il recherche des lieux sauvages non pollués par les morts-vivants.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336609&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2b5195-388f-4a50-9855-afa624933481\', \'multiverseId\': 336609}, \'multiverseid\': 336609}, {\'name\': "Alce dell\'Alba", \'text\': "{G}, Sacrifica l\'Alce dell\'Alba: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Silenziosa come la neve in inverno, cerca i luoghi selvaggi e non rovinati dai morti viventi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7f3879-145c-4e76-b786-add0fa620d4c\', \'multiverseId\': 337293}, \'multiverseid\': 337293}, {\'name\': \'夜明け歩きの大鹿\', \'text\': \'{G}, 夜明け歩きの大鹿を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地カードを１枚探し、それをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'それは歩く死体の邪魔を受けずに、冬の雪のように静かに荒野を追い求める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c43d9788-c768-476b-907c-8df3d3d054b6\', \'multiverseId\': 337464}, \'multiverseid\': 337464}, {\'name\': \'여명발굽 엘크\', \'text\': \'{G}, 여명발굽 엘크를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 탭된 채로 전장에 놓는다. 그리고 나서 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘크\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 걸어다니는 시체들에게 더럽혀지지 않은 곳을 조용히 찾아다닌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65790280-8b59-4e1b-bf65-dbd35f92c3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 336096}, \'multiverseid\': 336096}, {\'name\': \'Alce Viajante da Aurora\', \'text\': \'{G}, Sacrifique Alce Viajante da Aurora: Procure um card de terreno básico no seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Silencioso como a neve no inverno, ele procura lugares selvagens incontaminados pelos zumbis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f775075-046e-4d02-ad8e-2b5a02fc4d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 336438}, \'multiverseid\': 336438}, {\'name\': \'Вапити Рассветной Поступи\', \'text\': \'{G}, пожертвуйте Вапити Рассветной Поступи: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'Бесшумный, словно зимний снег, он ищет дикие места, неоскверненные ходячими мертвецами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e179c9f7-6a4e-4865-890c-485140454f68\', \'multiverseId\': 336780}, \'multiverseid\': 336780}, {\'name\': \'晨行麋鹿\', \'text\': \'{G}，牺牲晨行麋鹿：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'他行踪如冬雪般静寂，寻找未遭横行亡者染指的野地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87609608-878f-4ee4-9292-ba0273007dac\', \'multiverseId\': 335925}, \'multiverseid\': 335925}, {\'name\': \'晨行麋鹿\', \'text\': \'{G}，犧牲晨行麋鹿：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'牠行蹤如冬雪般靜寂，尋找未遭橫行亡者染指的野地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2594d644-febe-4c8b-87d5-a0ab0694e45e\', \'multiverseId\': 336267}, \'multiverseid\': 336267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerwalddryade\', \'text\': \'(Diese Kreatur ist unblockbar, solange der verteidigende Spieler einen Wald kontrolliert.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dryade\', \'flavor\': \'Der Dämmerwald ist ihre Heimat, und bislang hat sie noch keine Entschuldigung für unerlaubtes Betreten gelten lassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'144eab31-a1f7-4477-90d9-6913b9a0559c\', \'multiverseId\': 336977}, \'multiverseid\': 336977}, {\'name\': \'Dríada de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Cruza bosques. (Esta criatura es imbloqueable mientras el jugador defensor controle un bosque.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dríada\', \'flavor\': \'Somberwald es su dominio, y todavía no escuchó una buena razón para permitir intrusos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff0a75b-268e-4fb3-9fd3-6a275e1bc887\', \'multiverseId\': 337148}, \'multiverseid\': 337148}, {\'name\': \'Dryade de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Traversée des forêts (Cette créature est imblocable si le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une forêt.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : dryade\', \'flavor\': "Le Somberwald est son domaine et elle n\'a jamais encore entendu d\'excuses acceptables de la part des intrus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336635&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2ee0bec-0b46-4aad-be16-fa729d79ff1b\', \'multiverseId\': 336635}, \'multiverseid\': 336635}, {\'name\': \'Driade di Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Passa-Foreste (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla una Foresta.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Driade\', \'flavor\': \'Somberwald è il suo territorio e deve ancora sentire una ragione accettabile per aver sconfinato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcd42f0-2c40-46d9-9959-21e57fb44ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 337319}, \'multiverseid\': 337319}, {\'name\': \'ソンバーワルドのドライアド\', \'text\': \'森渡り （このクリーチャーは防御プレイヤーが森をコントロールしている限りブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドライアド\', \'flavor\': \'ソンバーワルドは彼女の領地であり、彼女はまだ侵入者達の納得いく弁明を聞いていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d761330-dabb-492b-8184-87d73ad13b80\', \'multiverseId\': 337490}, \'multiverseid\': 337490}, {\'name\': \'솜버왈드 드라이어드\', \'text\': \'(수비플레이어가 숲을 조종하는 한, 이 생물은 방어될 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드라이어드\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 솜버왈드를 지배하며, 무단으로 그곳에 침입한 자 중에서 그녀의 처벌을 면한 자는 아무도 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79646931-0ca2-463a-b74a-a54fba588da8\', \'multiverseId\': 336122}, \'multiverseid\': 336122}, {\'name\': \'Dríade de Somberwald\', \'text\': \'Travessia de floresta (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Floresta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dríade\', \'flavor\': \'Somberwald é o seu território, e ninguém ainda foi capaz de dar-lhe uma boa desculpa para invadi-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4e8172-1734-4922-8e9f-137a6a8918c4\', \'multiverseId\': 336464}, \'multiverseid\': 336464}, {\'name\': \'Сомбервальдская Дриада\', \'text\': \'Знание Лесов (Это существо не может быть заблокировано, пока защищающийся игрок контролирует Лес.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дриада\', \'flavor\': \'Сомбервальд — ее владение, и пока что она не слышала ни одного приемлемого оправдания для нарушения его границ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3f379b6-f3b8-4179-80fe-e13ff0fb7f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 336806}, \'multiverseid\': 336806}, {\'name\': \'松柏森树灵\', \'text\': \'（只要防御牌手操控树林，此生物便不能被阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～树灵\', \'flavor\': \'松柏森是她的地盘，而她还没接受过任何擅闯者的理由。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb985fd-3d3c-4bb8-98da-bdc62a560fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 335951}, \'multiverseid\': 335951}, {\'name\': \'松柏森樹靈\', \'text\': \'（只要防禦玩家操控樹林，此生物便不能被阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～樹靈\', \'flavor\': \'松柏森是她的地盤，而她還沒接受過任何擅闖者的理由。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'324aa2a5-72ba-4ab2-aab7-30c14f3a5765\', \'multiverseId\': 336293}, \'multiverseid\': 336293}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düstergrab-Hauptmann\', \'text\': \'Andere Zombie-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Zombie stirbt, den du kontrollierst, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl sein Hirn schon lange verrottet ist, führt er sein Schwert mit tödlicher Genauigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27bb849-2f49-41d6-a828-6fd43bd2b0e0\', \'multiverseId\': 337013}, \'multiverseid\': 337013}, {\'name\': \'Capitán de la tumbanefasta\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nLas otras criaturas Zombie que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nSiempre que otro Zombie que controles muera, el oponente objetivo pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque su mente se pudrió hace mucho, maneja la espada con una habilidad mortal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a81d66-3213-47f5-9de3-bda7aa0c72a1\', \'multiverseId\': 337184}, \'multiverseid\': 337184}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine du diregraf\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nLes autres créatures Zombie que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre zombie que vous contrôlez meurt, l\'adversaire ciblé perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Son cerveau a beau s\'être liquéfié, il manie toujours l\'épée avec un talent incomparable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336671&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'383ef8a8-26b2-49da-a8cd-70b16be9f478\', \'multiverseId\': 336671}, \'multiverseid\': 336671}, {\'name\': \'Capitano del Cimitero di Guerra\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nLe altre creature Zombie che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta muore un altro Zombie che controlli, un avversario bersaglio perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Sebbene il suo cervello si sia da tempo putrefatto, impugna una spada con letale maestria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b21bf69-45e2-409e-b512-77b957367d02\', \'multiverseId\': 337355}, \'multiverseid\': 337355}, {\'name\': \'戦墓の隊長\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたがコントロールする他のゾンビ・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。あなたのコントロールする他のゾンビが１体死亡するたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'精神は腐り果ててからずいぶんと経つが、恐るべき剣とその腕前は変わっていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3369939-72f7-46c6-81c8-560c7921f23e\', \'multiverseId\': 337526}, \'multiverseid\': 337526}, {\'name\': \'전장묘지 대장\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 좀비 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 좀비 생물이 죽을 때마다, 상대 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 병사\', \'flavor\': \'그것의 정신은 오래 전에 썩어 없어졌지만, 현란한 검술은 여전하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3993e76-e964-43f8-91ce-5403591402eb\', \'multiverseId\': 336158}, \'multiverseid\': 336158}, {\'name\': \'Capitão do Cemitério do Terror\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Zumbi que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\nToda vez que outro Zumbi que você controla morre, o oponente alvo perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Embora sua mente tenha apodrecido há muito tempo, sua habilidade com a espada continua sendo fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77081409-bb5d-4e5c-9825-86d302e89986\', \'multiverseId\': 336500}, \'multiverseid\': 336500}, {\'name\': \'Капитан с Места Резни\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nДругие существа-Зомби под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз когда другой Зомби под вашим контролем умирает, целевой оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Хотя разум его уже давно сгнил, он владеет мечом с опасной сноровкой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'043a0619-7bb2-4a88-ba03-d835ac6ab46d\', \'multiverseId\': 336842}, \'multiverseid\': 336842}, {\'name\': \'战墓队长\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他灵俑生物得+1/+1。每当由你操控的另一个灵俑死去时，目标对手失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'虽然其心智早已腐烂消失，它使剑功夫依旧致命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bea0e36-90b7-42b7-8fbd-a00b5ec6d1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 335987}, \'multiverseid\': 335987}, {\'name\': \'戰墓隊長\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他殭屍生物得+1/+1。每當由你操控的另一個殭屍死去時，目標對手失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'雖然其心智早已腐爛消失，它使劍功夫依舊致命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73788d2b-0063-4073-af72-050aa06bee63\', \'multiverseId\': 336329}, \'multiverseid\': 336329}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einsiedler im Hinterland // Geißel des Hinterlands\', \'text\': \'Die Geißel des Hinterlands muss geblockt werden, falls möglich.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments die Geißel des Hinterlands, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'. . . ... aber das Monster in ihm war ein nimmermüder Jäger.\', \'faceName\': \'Geißel des Hinterlands\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d25143c-2d86-4aa0-84c1-311674022f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 336990}, \'multiverseid\': 336990}, {\'name\': \'Ermitaño del interior // Azote del interior\', \'text\': \'El Azote del interior debe ser bloqueado si se puede.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Azote del interior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': \'. . . pero el monstruo en su interior era un cazador incansable.\', \'faceName\': \'Azote del interior\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6368553f-1cdd-49e3-b07e-f035648423fd\', \'multiverseId\': 337161}, \'multiverseid\': 337161}, {\'name\': "Ermite de l\'arrière-pays // Fléau de l\'arrière-pays", \'text\': "Le Fléau de l\'arrière-pays doit être bloqué si possible.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez le Fléau de l\'arrière-pays.", \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': \'. . . mais le monstre en lui était un chasseur infatigable.\', \'faceName\': "Fléau de l\'arrière-pays", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097ac0ca-8314-4de0-aa07-b7e6c2a1a468\', \'multiverseId\': 336648}, \'multiverseid\': 336648}, {\'name\': "Eremita dell\'Entroterra // Flagello dell\'Entroterra", \'text\': "Il Flagello dell\'Entroterra deve essere bloccato, se può esserlo.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma il Flagello dell\'Entroterra.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': \'. . . ma il mostro dentro di lui era un cacciatore instancabile.\', \'faceName\': "Flagello dell\'Entroterra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ed40cc-d446-4460-a32b-37cbde51e35e\', \'multiverseId\': 337332}, \'multiverseid\': 337332}, {\'name\': \'内陸の隠遁者 // 内陸の災い魔\', \'text\': \'内陸の災い魔は、可能ならブロックされなければならない。 各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、内陸の災い魔を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': \'. . . ……が、その内なる怪物は疲れを知らぬ狩人だった。\', \'faceName\': \'内陸の災い魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b89dbb-de73-444e-b5ab-4ea8a41b4e48\', \'multiverseId\': 337503}, \'multiverseid\': 337503}, {\'name\': \'내륙지 은둔자 // 내륙지의 재앙\', \'text\': \'내륙지의 재앙은 가능하면 방어되어야 한다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 내륙지의 재앙을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'. . . . . . 그의 내면에 있는 괴물은 지치지 않는 사냥꾼이었다.\', \'faceName\': \'내륙지의 재앙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00288486-be7c-460b-97c9-1a6b5a95b207\', \'multiverseId\': 336135}, \'multiverseid\': 336135}, {\'name\': \'Eremita do Interior // Flagelo do Interior\', \'text\': \'Flagelo do Interior deve ser bloqueado se estiver apto.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Flagelo do Interior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'... mas o seu monstro interior era um caçador incansável.\', \'faceName\': \'Flagelo do Interior\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76950e0f-abef-4cee-bbac-3e6e0909cdd7\', \'multiverseId\': 336477}, \'multiverseid\': 336477}, {\'name\': \'Отшельник из Глубинки // Бич Глубинки\', \'text\': \'Бич Глубинки должен быть заблокирован, если это возможно.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Бич Глубинки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'... но скрывающийся внутри монстр был неустанным охотником.\', \'faceName\': \'Бич Глубинки\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2facd5e4-ac85-4852-827c-175d30c501ce\', \'multiverseId\': 336819}, \'multiverseid\': 336819}, {\'name\': \'内陆隐者 // 内陆祸害\', \'text\': \'若能阻挡内陆祸害，则必须阻挡之。在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化内陆祸害。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'. . . ...但体内的怪物却是个不倦猎者。\', \'faceName\': \'内陆祸害\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d8dfae-91cc-4d76-982a-5c2822dfe346\', \'multiverseId\': 335964}, \'multiverseid\': 335964}, {\'name\': \'內陸隱者 // 內陸禍害\', \'text\': \'若能阻擋內陸禍害，則必須阻擋之。在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化內陸禍害。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': \'. . . ...但體內的怪物卻是個不倦獵者。\', \'faceName\': \'內陸禍害\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24c8f375-a903-4d39-ba0d-f30215c2e1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 336306}, \'multiverseid\': 336306}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einsiedler im Hinterland // Geißel des Hinterlands\', \'text\': \'Transformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Einsiedler im Hinterland, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': \'Er versuchte, fern von allen zu leben, die er verletzen könnte...\', \'faceName\': \'Einsiedler im Hinterland\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d25143c-2d86-4aa0-84c1-311674022f6a\', \'multiverseId\': 336990}, \'multiverseid\': 336990}, {\'name\': \'Ermitaño del interior // Azote del interior\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Ermitaño del interior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Intentaba vivir lejos de aquellos a los que podía herir...\', \'faceName\': \'Ermitaño del interior\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6368553f-1cdd-49e3-b07e-f035648423fd\', \'multiverseId\': 337161}, \'multiverseid\': 337161}, {\'name\': "Ermite de l\'arrière-pays // Fléau de l\'arrière-pays", \'text\': "Au début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez l\'Ermite de l\'arrière-pays.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': "Il essaya de vivre le plus loin possible de ceux qu\'il aurait pu blesser . . .", \'faceName\': "Ermite de l\'arrière-pays", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336648&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097ac0ca-8314-4de0-aa07-b7e6c2a1a468\', \'multiverseId\': 336648}, \'multiverseid\': 336648}, {\'name\': "Eremita dell\'Entroterra // Flagello dell\'Entroterra", \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma l\'Eremita dell\'Entroterra.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Ha cercato di vivere lontano da coloro che poteva ferire. . .\', \'faceName\': "Eremita dell\'Entroterra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ed40cc-d446-4460-a32b-37cbde51e35e\', \'multiverseId\': 337332}, \'multiverseid\': 337332}, {\'name\': \'内陸の隠遁者 // 内陸の災い魔\', \'text\': \'各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、内陸の隠遁者を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狼男\', \'flavor\': \'彼は傷つけてしまう可能性のあるものからできるだけ離れて生きようとしていた……\', \'faceName\': \'内陸の隠遁者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b89dbb-de73-444e-b5ab-4ea8a41b4e48\', \'multiverseId\': 337503}, \'multiverseid\': 337503}, {\'name\': \'내륙지 은둔자 // 내륙지의 재앙\', \'text\': \'각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 내륙지 은둔자를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': \'그는 그가 해칠 수 있는 자들로부터 멀리 떨어져 살려고 했지만 . . .\', \'faceName\': \'내륙지 은둔자\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00288486-be7c-460b-97c9-1a6b5a95b207\', \'multiverseId\': 336135}, \'multiverseid\': 336135}, {\'name\': \'Eremita do Interior // Flagelo do Interior\', \'text\': \'No início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Eremita do Interior.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': \'Ele tentou viver longe de todos que pudesse machucar...\', \'faceName\': \'Eremita do Interior\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76950e0f-abef-4cee-bbac-3e6e0909cdd7\', \'multiverseId\': 336477}, \'multiverseid\': 336477}, {\'name\': \'Отшельник из Глубинки // Бич Глубинки\', \'text\': \'В начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Отшельника из Глубинки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Вервольф\', \'flavor\': \'Он пытался жить вдали от тех, кому мог навредить...\', \'faceName\': \'Отшельник из Глубинки\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2facd5e4-ac85-4852-827c-175d30c501ce\', \'multiverseId\': 336819}, \'multiverseid\': 336819}, {\'name\': \'内陆隐者 // 内陆祸害\', \'text\': \'在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化内陆隐者。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'他试图远离可能受其伤害者...\', \'faceName\': \'内陆隐者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d8dfae-91cc-4d76-982a-5c2822dfe346\', \'multiverseId\': 335964}, \'multiverseid\': 335964}, {\'name\': \'內陸隱者 // 內陸禍害\', \'text\': \'在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化內陸隱者。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狼人\', \'flavor\': \'他試圖遠離可能受其傷害者...\', \'faceName\': \'內陸隱者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24c8f375-a903-4d39-ba0d-f30215c2e1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 336306}, \'multiverseid\': 336306}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einsiedlerspinne aus Kessig\', \'text\': \'Reichweite (Diese Kreatur kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\\nTodesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Seide ist ungefähr genauso viel wert wie dein Leben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2642d3ff-77b7-4274-9bfc-ee2b54f72267\', \'multiverseId\': 336957}, \'multiverseid\': 336957}, {\'name\': \'Reclusa de Kessig\', \'text\': \'Alcance. (Esta criatura puede bloquear criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\\nToque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Su seda tiene un alto valor, pero también tu vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c2a7f89-16b4-49cf-ae55-1034280b98c4\', \'multiverseId\': 337128}, \'multiverseid\': 337128}, {\'name\': \'Recluse de Kessig\', \'text\': "Portée (Cette créature peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\\nContact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Sa soie n\'a pas de prix, un peu comme votre vie, d\'ailleurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336615&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b171eb-8faf-455e-9540-74f5cccbe995\', \'multiverseId\': 336615}, \'multiverseid\': 336615}, {\'name\': \'Eremita di Kessig\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere (Questa creatura può bloccare le creature con volare.)\\nTocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'La sua seta ha un notevole valore, ma allora, anche la tua vita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e2722c-cc9d-4def-8a44-6ea279360ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 337299}, \'multiverseid\': 337299}, {\'name\': \'ケッシグの出家蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'到達（このクリーチャーは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\\n接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えた場合、それだけで破壊される。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'その糸は極めて高価だが、お前の命だってそうだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66b7f87e-6458-46cc-a304-af45c81ba18a\', \'multiverseId\': 337470}, \'multiverseid\': 337470}, {\'name\': \'케시그 은둔거미\', \'text\': \'대공 (이 생물은 비행 능력을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\\n치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': \'그 거미줄은 매우 귀중하지만, 당신의 목숨도 귀중하긴 마찬가지다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74559661-5923-4569-8a36-1e89aebc846c\', \'multiverseId\': 336102}, \'multiverseid\': 336102}, {\'name\': \'Solitário de Kessig\', \'text\': \'Alcance (Esta criatura pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\\nToque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'A seda dela é muito preciosa, mas a sua vida também é.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cbf2ae3-80ce-4c33-a8ec-4259561f36a7\', \'multiverseId\': 336444}, \'multiverseid\': 336444}, {\'name\': \'Кессигский Отшельник\', \'text\': \'Захват (Это существо может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\\nСмертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Его шелк высоко ценится. Впрочем, ваша жизнь тоже.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e277deb1-797a-4107-81f0-cd1dc7f1e4ee\', \'multiverseId\': 336786}, \'multiverseid\': 336786}, {\'name\': \'凯锡革隐士\', \'text\': \'延势（此生物能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\\n死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'其丝线价值不斐，但话说回来，您的生命亦同。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'197d678c-973d-4b03-8619-90a68db3ba63\', \'multiverseId\': 335931}, \'multiverseid\': 335931}, {\'name\': \'凱錫革隱士\', \'text\': \'延勢（此生物能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\\n死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'其絲線價值不斐，但話說回來，您的生命亦同。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa5376a-da31-4195-8224-28b8f94c182f\', \'multiverseId\': 336273}, \'multiverseid\': 336273}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eisenhauerin aus Gaven\', \'text\': \'Schicksalsstunde — Solange du 5 Lebenspunkte oder weniger hast, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+4.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich wünschte, meine Arbeit könnte alle beschützen, doch ich bete, dass wir nie nur noch so wenige sein werden, dass es zutrifft."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337029&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce31b00e-0a34-44de-aff9-c32fbc51b39c\', \'multiverseId\': 337029}, \'multiverseid\': 337029}, {\'name\': \'Herradora de Gavony\', \'text\': \'Hora fatídica — Mientras tengas 5 vidas o menos, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Me gustaría que mi trabajo pudiera proteger a todos, pero rezo que nunca seamos tan pocos como para que alcance."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ea1b7f-9d91-4f8d-baf1-70c46f038ffd\', \'multiverseId\': 337200}, \'multiverseid\': 337200}, {\'name\': \'Forgefer de Gavonie\', \'text\': \'Heure fatidique — Tant que vous avez 5 points de vie ou moins, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+4.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Je souhaiterais que mon travail puisse protéger tout le monde, mais je prie pour que nous ne devenions pas si peu nombreux que cela devienne possible. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336687&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66903e05-5031-4fb1-825a-848343b23297\', \'multiverseId\': 336687}, \'multiverseid\': 336687}, {\'name\': \'Forgiaferro di Gavony\', \'text\': \'Ora fatidica — Fintanto che hai 5 o meno punti vita, le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+4.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vorrei che il mio lavoro potesse proteggere tutti, ma prego che non siamo mai così pochi che ci riesca."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6552bf5-ba64-4aa1-b844-330330cbe0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 337371}, \'multiverseid\': 337371}, {\'name\': \'ガヴォニーの鉄大工\', \'text\': \'窮地 ― あなたのライフが５点以下であるかぎり、あなたがコントロールする他のクリーチャーは＋１/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「あたしの仕事でみんなが守れればいいとは思うけど、実際にそこまで少なくならないように祈ってるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8be52f77-dcfa-405a-8678-f817602d2ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 337542}, \'multiverseid\': 337542}, {\'name\': \'가보니의 대장장이\', \'text\': \'운명의 시간 —당신의 생명이 5점 이하인 한, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 +1/+4를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"내 갑옷들이 모두를 보호해줄 수 있었으면 좋겠지만, 그럴 수 있을 만큼 우리의 숫자가 줄어들지 않기를 바란다네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ea4bdd-0d05-4b9c-87fb-9a14c5ecf8e1\', \'multiverseId\': 336174}, \'multiverseid\': 336174}, {\'name\': \'Ferreiro de Gavony\', \'text\': \'Hora fatal — Enquanto você tiver 5 ou menos pontos de vida, as outras criaturas que você controla receberão +1/+4.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu gostaria que meu trabalho pudesse proteger todos, mas rezo para que jamais sejamos tão poucos para permitir isso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98e69187-af06-4fee-a09e-b8186190e166\', \'multiverseId\': 336516}, \'multiverseid\': 336516}, {\'name\': \'Гевонская Ковательница\', \'text\': \'Роковой час — Пока количество ваших жизней меньше или равно 5, другие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+4.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Я хотела бы, чтобы плоды моего труда защитили каждого, но я молюсь о том, чтобы нас никогда не осталось так мало».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99dbb1fa-e3e1-47fb-b80a-0652e9ef2cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 336858}, \'multiverseid\': 336858}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼修铁匠\', \'text\': \'命悬一刻～只要你的生命为5或更少，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+4。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我希望自己的心血足以庇护众人，更祈祷吾众数量能超我负荷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7ea230-dfb6-4354-a4b0-5227fe634d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 336003}, \'multiverseid\': 336003}, {\'name\': \'加渥尼修鐵匠\', \'text\': \'命懸一刻～只要你的生命為5或更少，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+4。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我希望自己的心血足以庇護眾人，更祈禱吾眾數量能超我負荷。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a74b5319-1bc0-4f2d-9f6e-2da650912b95\', \'multiverseId\': 336345}, \'multiverseid\': 336345}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elbrus, die bindende Klinge // Withengar der Entfesselte\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+0.\\nWenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, löse Elbrus, die bindende Klinge, und transformiere sie dann.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Wer das Heft ergreift, vernimmt schon bald den Ruf des Dämons.\', \'faceName\': \'Elbrus, die bindende Klinge\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a265c7f-6286-4844-ab22-138eba793bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 336972}, \'multiverseid\': 336972}, {\'name\': \'Elbrus, la espada vinculante // Withengar liberado\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+0.\\nCuando la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, desanexa a Elbrus, la espada vinculante, y luego transfórmala.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que toman su empuñadura escuchan la invitación del demonio.\', \'faceName\': \'Elbrus, la espada vinculante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac01ac5c-1730-4e80-b144-2656792c50d4\', \'multiverseId\': 337143}, \'multiverseid\': 337143}, {\'name\': "Elbrus, la Lame d\'emprisonnement // Withengar déchaîné", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +1/+0.\\nQuand la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, détachez Elbrus, la Lame d\'emprisonnement, puis transformez-la.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Quiconque empoigne sa garde entend aussitôt l\'appel du démon.", \'faceName\': "Elbrus, la Lame d\'emprisonnement", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92ffedb-c854-4196-baa5-06437a7064d6\', \'multiverseId\': 336630}, \'multiverseid\': 336630}, {\'name\': \'Elbrus, la Lama Vincolante // Withengar in Libertà\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+0.\\nQuando la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, Elbrus, la Lama Vincolante non è più assegnata, poi la trasformi.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Coloro che ne stringono l\'impugnatura sentono subito il richiamo del demone.", \'faceName\': \'Elbrus, la Lama Vincolante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9dcadee-d057-404a-8e9b-3152ce8208b7\', \'multiverseId\': 337314}, \'multiverseid\': 337314}, {\'name\': \'束縛の刃、エルブラス // 解き放たれたウィゼンガー\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは+1/+0の修整を受ける。装備しているクリーチャーがいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、束縛の刃、エルブラスをはずし、その後それを変身させる。装備 {1}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'その柄を握る者は、すぐに悪魔の呼び声を聞く。\', \'faceName\': \'束縛の刃、エルブラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038f5f57-45e1-4863-8836-0f553ede4eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 337485}, \'multiverseid\': 337485}, {\'name\': \'구속의 검 엘브러스 // 해방된 위텐가르\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +1/+0을 받는다.\\n장착된 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때, 구속의 검 엘브러스를 그 생물로부터 분리한 후 변신시킨다.\\n장착 {1}\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'그 칼자루를 쥐는 자는 머지 않아 악마의 목소리를 듣게 된다.\', \'faceName\': \'구속의 검 엘브러스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e8b5158-4a97-45e0-9ed0-8f44c3308ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 336117}, \'multiverseid\': 336117}, {\'name\': \'Elbrus, a Lâmina da União // Withengar Livre\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+0.\\nQuando a criatura equipada causar dano de combate a um jogador, solte Elbrus, a Lâmina da União, e depois a transforme.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Aqueles que agarram seu punho logo ouvem o chamado do demônio.\', \'faceName\': \'Elbrus, a Lâmina da União\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3411c567-d01b-4564-9727-27b14e9b2952\', \'multiverseId\': 336459}, \'multiverseid\': 336459}, {\'name\': \'Элбрус, Связующий Клинок // Уитенгар Раскрепощенный\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/+0.\\nКогда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, открепите Элбрус, Связующий Клинок, затем трансформируйте его.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Тот, кто хватается за его эфес, вскоре слышит призыв демона.\', \'faceName\': \'Элбрус, Связующий Клинок\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89be9f4-fba4-469c-b34e-5e5875696ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 336801}, \'multiverseid\': 336801}, {\'name\': \'镇魔刃埃布斯 // 解缚威森格\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+0。当佩带此武具的生物对一位牌手造成战斗伤害时，将镇魔刃埃布斯卸装，然后转化它。佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'握住刀柄者很快就会听见恶魔呼唤。\', \'faceName\': \'镇魔刃埃布斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62226dba-6e1b-4e6d-8930-4a9b9279109d\', \'multiverseId\': 335946}, \'multiverseid\': 335946}, {\'name\': \'鎮魔刃埃布斯 // 解縛威森格\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+1/+0。當佩帶此武具的生物對一位玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，將鎮魔刃埃布斯卸裝，然後轉化它。佩帶{1}\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'握住刀柄者很快就會聽見惡魔呼喚。\', \'faceName\': \'鎮魔刃埃布斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d99529f3-d0b2-4d8a-b65a-de691d6b54aa\', \'multiverseId\': 336288}, \'multiverseid\': 336288}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elbrus, die bindende Klinge // Withengar der Entfesselte\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler das Spiel verliert, lege dreizehn +1/+1-Marken auf Withengar den Entfesselten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt nicht genügend Leben auf Innistrad, um seine Rachsucht zu stillen.\', \'faceName\': \'Withengar der Entfesselte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a265c7f-6286-4844-ab22-138eba793bdf\', \'multiverseId\': 336972}, \'multiverseid\': 336972}, {\'name\': \'Elbrus, la espada vinculante // Withengar liberado\', \'text\': \'Vuela, intimidar, arrolla.\\nSiempre que un jugador pierda el juego, pon trece contadores +1/+1 sobre Withengar liberado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'No hay suficientes vidas en Innistrad para satisfacer su sed de venganza.\', \'faceName\': \'Withengar liberado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac01ac5c-1730-4e80-b144-2656792c50d4\', \'multiverseId\': 337143}, \'multiverseid\': 337143}, {\'name\': "Elbrus, la Lame d\'emprisonnement // Withengar déchaîné", \'text\': "Vol, intimidation, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur perd la partie, mettez treize marqueurs +1/+1 sur Withengar déchaîné.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : - démon\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y a pas suffisamment de vies sur Innistrad pour étancher sa soif de rétribution.", \'faceName\': \'Withengar déchaîné\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92ffedb-c854-4196-baa5-06437a7064d6\', \'multiverseId\': 336630}, \'multiverseid\': 336630}, {\'name\': \'Elbrus, la Lama Vincolante // Withengar in Libertà\', \'text\': \'Volare, intimidire, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore perde la partita, metti tredici segnalini +1/+1 su Withengar in Libertà.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'In Innistrad non ci sono vite sufficienti a soddisfare la sua brama di punizione.\', \'faceName\': \'Withengar in Libertà\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9dcadee-d057-404a-8e9b-3152ce8208b7\', \'multiverseId\': 337314}, \'multiverseid\': 337314}, {\'name\': \'束縛の刃、エルブラス // 解き放たれたウィゼンガー\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーが１人ゲームに敗北するたび、解き放たれたウィゼンガーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを13個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー ― - デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'彼の報復への渇きを満たすほどの数の生命は、イニストラードには存在しない。\', \'faceName\': \'解き放たれたウィゼンガー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038f5f57-45e1-4863-8836-0f553ede4eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 337485}, \'multiverseid\': 337485}, {\'name\': \'구속의 검 엘브러스 // 해방된 위텐가르\', \'text\': \'어느 플레이어가 게임에서 패배할 때마다, 해방된 위텐가르에 +1/+1 카운터 열세 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'이니스트라드의 모든 생명을 그에게 바쳐도 그의 복수심을 충족하기에는 부족하다.\', \'faceName\': \'해방된 위텐가르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e8b5158-4a97-45e0-9ed0-8f44c3308ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 336117}, \'multiverseid\': 336117}, {\'name\': \'Elbrus, a Lâmina da União // Withengar Livre\', \'text\': \'Voar, intimidar, atropelar\\nToda vez que um jogador perder o jogo, coloque treze marcadores +1/+1 sobre Withengar Livre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Não há vidas o suficiente em Innistrad para satisfazer sua sede de retribuição.\', \'faceName\': \'Withengar Livre\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3411c567-d01b-4564-9727-27b14e9b2952\', \'multiverseId\': 336459}, \'multiverseid\': 336459}, {\'name\': \'Элбрус, Связующий Клинок // Уитенгар Раскрепощенный\', \'text\': \'Полет, Устрашение, Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз когда игрок проигрывает партию, положите тринадцать жетонов +1/+1 на Уитенгара Раскрепощенного.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'В Иннистраде нет стольких жизней, чтобы утолить его жажду расплаты.\', \'faceName\': \'Уитенгар Раскрепощенный\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89be9f4-fba4-469c-b34e-5e5875696ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 336801}, \'multiverseid\': 336801}, {\'name\': \'镇魔刃埃布斯 // 解缚威森格\', \'text\': \'每当一位牌手输掉这盘游戏时，在解缚威森格上放置十三个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～ - 恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'依尼翠的生灵数量无法满足其复仇渴望。\', \'faceName\': \'解缚威森格\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62226dba-6e1b-4e6d-8930-4a9b9279109d\', \'multiverseId\': 335946}, \'multiverseid\': 335946}, {\'name\': \'鎮魔刃埃布斯 // 解縛威森格\', \'text\': \'每當一位玩家輸掉這盤遊戲時，在解縛威森格上放置十三個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～ - 惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'依尼翠的生靈數量無法滿足其復仇渴望。\', \'faceName\': \'解縛威森格\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d99529f3-d0b2-4d8a-b65a-de691d6b54aa\', \'multiverseId\': 336288}, \'multiverseid\': 336288}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entsetzliche Reise\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht drei Karten und verliert 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt immer Dummköpfe, die versuchen, den Kruinpass vor Sonnenuntergang zu überqueren, und jedes Mal müssen sie um ihr Leben rennen." —Rutstein der Alte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e56f3325-4162-4520-b5cc-7a898a16134f\', \'multiverseId\': 337033}, \'multiverseid\': 337033}, {\'name\': \'Viaje horrendo\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba tres cartas y pierde 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Siempre hay tontos que intentan cruzar el Paso Kruin al atardecer, y siempre terminan corriendo por sus vidas." —Viejo Rutstein\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a4b24d-e19e-4f8f-96d6-e030900d322e\', \'multiverseId\': 337204}, \'multiverseid\': 337204}, {\'name\': \'Atroce voyage\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé pioche trois cartes et perd 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Il y a toujours des inconscients qui tentent de traverser le Col de Kruin avant le coucher du soleil et ils ont de la chance s\'ils en sortent en vie. » —Le Vieux Rutstein", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336691&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74f87925-23f7-4520-9148-4004373271f1\', \'multiverseId\': 336691}, \'multiverseid\': 336691}, {\'name\': \'Viaggio Straziante\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio pesca tre carte e perde 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sono sempre dei folli che tentano di attraversare Passo Kruin prima del tramonto e ogni volta finiscono in una corsa per la loro vita." —Vecchio Rutstein\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17df834-7a7c-44f7-9002-e3a8a30aacf4\', \'multiverseId\': 337375}, \'multiverseid\': 337375}, {\'name\': \'悲惨な旅\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを３枚引き、３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「陽の落ちる前にクルイーン峡を抜けようなどと言う愚か者は後を絶たんが、結局は命を賭けた競走になるのが落ちじゃ。」――ラトスタイン翁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94af751-4ea0-4f8b-b780-c69d94fff0da\', \'multiverseId\': 337546}, \'multiverseid\': 337546}, {\'name\': \'괴로운 여정\', \'text\': \'플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 세 장을 뽑고 생명 3점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"해가 지기 전에 크루인 고갯길을 통과하려고 하는 멍청이들이 꼭 있어. 그런 놈들은 항상 걸음아 날 살려라 하면서 미친 듯이 도망치곤 하지." —늙은이 루트스틴\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead0d86e-1c84-405b-a2a2-0594a8a9021f\', \'multiverseId\': 336178}, \'multiverseid\': 336178}, {\'name\': \'Jornada Desgastante\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo compra três cards e perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Tem sempre um idiota que tenta atravessar o Passo de Kruin antes do pôr-do-sol e acaba sempre correndo para salvar a própria vida." — Velho Rutstein\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42bd2d26-e098-4d0a-87dd-5df9574a3305\', \'multiverseId\': 336520}, \'multiverseid\': 336520}, {\'name\': \'Изматывающая Поездка\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок берет три карты и теряет 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Всегда находятся глупцы, которые пытаются пересечь Круинский Перевал незадолго до захода солнца, и всякий раз им приходится бежать наперегонки со смертью». — Старый Рутштайн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cd8d3f0-8db6-4253-9e35-105eb22a1a9d\', \'multiverseId\': 336862}, \'multiverseid\': 336862}, {\'name\': \'艰苦旅程\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓三张牌并失去3点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「总是有傻瓜想在日落前穿越克廉峡，而他们都会落到必须奔逃求生的下场。」～老鲁斯登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac103b12-f792-4041-87e0-af8b46910599\', \'multiverseId\': 336007}, \'multiverseid\': 336007}, {\'name\': \'艱苦旅程\', \'text\': \'目標玩家抽三張牌並失去3點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「總是有傻瓜想在日落前穿越克廉峽，而他們都會落到必須奔逃求生的下場。」～老魯斯登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac31d601-928b-4e1a-8760-a0b0136ba010\', \'multiverseId\': 336349}, \'multiverseid\': 336349}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fackelunhold\', \'text\': \'{R}, opfere den Fackelunhold: Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'Teufel dekorieren jeden Raum mit Feuer neu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ac4074-50a8-4528-a6f7-309bcef02efe\', \'multiverseId\': 336962}, \'multiverseid\': 336962}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de la antorcha\', \'text\': \'{R}, sacrificar el Demonio de la antorcha: Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'Los diablos redecoran cada habitación con fuego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21673624-2e81-43d3-9320-6e70a42cf4b4\', \'multiverseId\': 337133}, \'multiverseid\': 337133}, {\'name\': \'Fielleux à la torche\', \'text\': "{R}, sacrifiez le Fielleux à la torche : Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': \'Les diables redécorent chaque pièce par le feu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61472881-a4f4-4e32-ada0-8a0c23559979\', \'multiverseId\': 336620}, \'multiverseid\': 336620}, {\'name\': \'Immondo Torcia\', \'text\': "{R}, Sacrifica l\'Immondo Torcia: Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': \'I diavoli ridipingono ogni stanza col fuoco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fbe791c-3aec-41d6-b955-1380ccd43b5d\', \'multiverseId\': 337304}, \'multiverseid\': 337304}, {\'name\': \'松明の悪鬼\', \'text\': \'{R}, 松明の悪鬼を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'小悪魔はあらゆる部屋を火で飾りなおす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddb0fd4f-881f-4722-b77a-79b7cace8d10\', \'multiverseId\': 337475}, \'multiverseid\': 337475}, {\'name\': \'횃불 마귀\', \'text\': \'{R}, 횃불 마귀를 희생한다: 마법물체 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악령\', \'flavor\': \'악령들은 모든 방을 불길로 장식한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1b7baf-c95e-4636-a126-ae7f10119425\', \'multiverseId\': 336107}, \'multiverseid\': 336107}, {\'name\': \'Diabo da Tocha\', \'text\': \'{R}, Sacrifique Diabo da Tocha: Destrua o artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': \'Os diabos redecoram todos os aposentos com fogo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c582c8-abe2-42bd-ba92-a6f5ba8563f3\', \'multiverseId\': 336449}, \'multiverseid\': 336449}, {\'name\': \'Факельный Демон\', \'text\': \'{R}, пожертвуйте Факельного Демона: уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': \'Дьяволы по-новому отделывают каждую комнату — огнем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a65045-98c2-4522-b611-0b2ee2bcbd76\', \'multiverseId\': 336791}, \'multiverseid\': 336791}, {\'name\': \'火炬邪鬼\', \'text\': \'{R}，牺牲火炬邪鬼：消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼用火焰重新装饰每个房间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91ad84c6-8752-4dfe-b380-65b967dd2304\', \'multiverseId\': 335936}, \'multiverseid\': 335936}, {\'name\': \'火炬邪鬼\', \'text\': \'{R}，犧牲火炬邪鬼：消滅目標神器。\', \'type\': \'生物～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼用火焰重新裝飾每個房間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c30105c-cf00-4a58-bd23-fe04269b778c\', \'multiverseId\': 336278}, \'multiverseid\': 336278}]', '[{\'name\': \'Falkenrath-Folterer\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Der Falkenrath-Folterer erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Flugfähigkeit. Falls die geopferte Kreatur ein Mensch ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Falkenrath-Folterer.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Einst hörte man immer Gejammer aus unseren Käfigen. Jetzt sind nur noch wenige dieser winselnden Dummköpfe da."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337041&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b522e742-15ea-4cac-a1e8-e49e55fc07f2\', \'multiverseId\': 337041}, \'multiverseid\': 337041}, {\'name\': \'Torturador Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: El Torturador Falkenrath gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno. Si la criatura sacrificada era un Humano, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Torturador Falkenrath.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hubo un tiempo en el que los lamentos eran el sonido de nuestras celdas. Ahora solo queda un manojo de estos inútiles lloriqueos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e9c3c5-8583-4263-b108-d6505d195165\', \'multiverseId\': 337212}, \'multiverseid\': 337212}, {\'name\': \'Tortionnaire Falkenrath\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une créature : Le Tortionnaire Falkenrath acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Si la créature sacrifiée était un humain, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Tortionnaire Falkenrath.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Il était un temps où une symphonie de pleurs résonnait dans nos cages. Aujourd\'hui il ne reste qu\'une poignée de ces idiots sanglotants. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b822c57-7de2-4a0a-83e1-0fbebefaaadf\', \'multiverseId\': 336699}, \'multiverseid\': 336699}, {\'name\': \'Tormentatore Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Il Tormentatore Falkenrath ha volare fino alla fine del turno. Se la creatura sacrificata era un Umano, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Tormentatore Falkenrath.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è stato un tempo in cui le nostre gabbie risuonavano di gemiti. Ora rimane solo una manciata di questi sciocchi piagnucolosi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c602d59f-3b85-4c05-90b0-f375575ba4a9\', \'multiverseId\': 337383}, \'multiverseid\': 337383}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの拷問者\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：ファルケンラスの拷問者はターン終了時まで飛行を得る。その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーが人間だった場合、ファルケンラスの拷問者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「檻が嘆きの声に響いていたこともあった。今ではぐずり続ける愚か者は片手で数えるほどだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6f67b4-0835-4d8a-bf2e-f2e921b752cc\', \'multiverseId\': 337554}, \'multiverseid\': 337554}, {\'name\': \'팔켄라스가의 고문관\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 희생한다: 팔켄라스가의 고문관은 턴종료까지 비행 능력을 얻는다. 만약 희생된 생물이 인간이었다면, 팔켄라스가의 고문관에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"한 때 우리의 감옥은 비명 소리로 가득 찼었지. 이제 이 하찮은 것들도 몇 명 안 남았군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39267e46-1e7b-49e2-b3ea-853db4b0f240\', \'multiverseId\': 336186}, \'multiverseid\': 336186}, {\'name\': \'Torturador Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Torturador Falkenrath ganha voar até o final do turno. Se a criatura sacrificada era um Humano, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre Torturador Falkenrath.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Houve um tempo em que nossas jaulas soavam com gemidos. Agora, restam apenas alguns poucos desses tolos lamuriantes."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0cbb6cc-5284-4a2f-b1c6-950eb4bbcd05\', \'multiverseId\': 336528}, \'multiverseid\': 336528}, {\'name\': \'Фалькенратский Мучитель\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте существо: Фалькенратский Мучитель получает Полет до конца хода. Если пожертвованное существо было Человеком, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Фалькенратского Мучителя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«В прежние времена наши клетки звенели от стонов и причитаний. Теперь же осталась лишь горстка этих хнычущих глупцов».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd1e5c4-5de7-4c0d-9ec9-25362e88a66f\', \'multiverseId\': 336870}, \'multiverseid\': 336870}, {\'name\': \'伐肯纳刑吏\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：伐肯纳刑吏获得飞行异能直到回合结束。如果牺牲的生物是人类，在伐肯纳刑吏上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的牢房有段时间充满惨叫。现在只剩下些哭个不停的傻瓜。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f9a595-2483-49c0-8ab0-8f99635e9a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 336015}, \'multiverseid\': 336015}, {\'name\': \'伐肯納刑吏\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物：伐肯納刑吏獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。如果犧牲的生物是人類，在伐肯納刑吏上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的牢房有段時間充滿慘叫。現在只剩下些哭個不停的傻瓜。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85be21fb-1548-457e-a9d7-48f0ae6dadc8\', \'multiverseId\': 336357}, \'multiverseid\': 336357}]', '[{\'name\': \'Falkenrath-Klauen\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)Die verzauberte Kreatur hat „{1}{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +2/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337074&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d378f044-9683-4694-a2a1-5e37fceaaced\', \'multiverseId\': 337074}, \'multiverseid\': 337074}, {\'name\': \'Garras Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene: "{1}{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +2/+0 hasta el final del turno".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941ea0ce-66e8-4ab3-b011-070500789047\', \'multiverseId\': 337245}, \'multiverseid\': 337245}, {\'name\': \'Serres de Falkenrath\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a « {1}{R} : Cette créature gagne +2/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336732&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21e3d406-43aa-47cd-a078-ec066c9f1072\', \'multiverseId\': 336732}, \'multiverseid\': 336732}, {\'name\': \'Artigli di Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha "{1}{R}: Questa creatura prende +2/+0 fino alla fine del turno".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73e6587-6c68-4bba-ba59-c193fc2ab96c\', \'multiverseId\': 337416}, \'multiverseid\': 337416}, {\'name\': \'ファルケンラスの鉤爪\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは「{1}{R}：このクリーチャーはターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8070b2ef-3adc-4240-b603-d46a19705b84\', \'multiverseId\': 337587}, \'multiverseid\': 337587}, {\'name\': \'팔켄라스의 손톱\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)부여된 생물은 "{1}{R}: 이 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받는다."라는 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d86b2477-eb81-4dbd-be92-7e8f57b814e6\', \'multiverseId\': 336219}, \'multiverseid\': 336219}, {\'name\': \'Garras de Falkenrath\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nEncantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada tem "{1}{R}: Esta criatura recebe +2/+0 até o final do turno".\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6447015-ef76-463c-b1b5-b7f71cc8fa23\', \'multiverseId\': 336561}, \'multiverseid\': 336561}, {\'name\': \'Когти Фалькенратов\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nЗачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо имеет способность «{1}{R}: это существо получает +2/+0 до конца хода».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ec1e9e-c543-451e-adce-86fd663c2722\', \'multiverseId\': 336903}, \'multiverseid\': 336903}, {\'name\': \'伐肯纳之爪\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）所结附的生物具有「{1}{R}：此生物得+2/+0直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3fcc08c-0043-467c-b2f5-520d5f436a59\', \'multiverseId\': 336048}, \'multiverseid\': 336048}, {\'name\': \'伐肯納之爪\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）所結附的生物具有「{1}{R}：此生物得+2/+0直到回合結束。」\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6805c6e-0473-45ac-8f2b-a893350fc21f\', \'multiverseId\': 336390}, \'multiverseid\': 336390}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuer der Untoten\', \'text\': \'Das Feuer der Untoten fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {5}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sauge die aus, die meines Gaumens würdig sind. Die anderen verbrenne ich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb3caed-7c78-4b6f-ac4c-dd6b016ca514\', \'multiverseId\': 337053}, \'multiverseid\': 337053}, {\'name\': \'Fuegos de muerte viviente\', \'text\': \'Los Fuegos de muerte viviente hacen 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nRetrospectiva {5}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Bebo de aquellos dignos de mi paladar. Al resto los quemo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d48b4f-7a17-4620-94f5-2394f52b922f\', \'multiverseId\': 337224}, \'multiverseid\': 337224}, {\'name\': \'Feux de la morte-vie\', \'text\': \'Les Feux de la morte-vie infligent 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nFlashback {5}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je bois ceux qui sont dignes de mon palais. Les autres, je les brûle. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336711&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95b6510-b7a3-4000-a841-ac81153639ab\', \'multiverseId\': 336711}, \'multiverseid\': 336711}, {\'name\': \'Fuochi della Non Morte\', \'text\': \'I Fuochi della Non Morte infliggono 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nFlashback {5}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Bevo da quanti sono degni del mio palato. Gli altri li brucio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09f7826-d7a0-43d7-9acd-08da0f975d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 337395}, \'multiverseid\': 337395}, {\'name\': \'不死の火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。不死の火はそれに２点のダメージを与える。フラッシュバック {5}{B} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私の舌に適う者からだけ飲みたいのよ。残りは焼き尽くすわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132e632c-f48a-4164-8ae3-5392b1bf8a63\', \'multiverseId\': 337566}, \'multiverseid\': 337566}, {\'name\': \'불사의 불길\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 불사의 불길은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n회상 {5}{B} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"난 내 고귀한 입맛을 충족할 수 있는 자들의 피만 마시고 나머지 놈들은 불태워버리지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d3fe908-576a-4645-a67b-50c33e14590d\', \'multiverseId\': 336198}, \'multiverseid\': 336198}, {\'name\': \'Fogos da Morte-Vida\', \'text\': \'Fogos da Morte-Vida causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\nRecapitular {5}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu bebo somente daqueles que são dignos do meu paladar. O restante eu queimo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f870f424-093f-4b07-b2d7-cfa660eafbe4\', \'multiverseId\': 336540}, \'multiverseid\': 336540}, {\'name\': \'Пламя Нежизни\', \'text\': \'Пламя Нежизни наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\\nВоспоминание {5}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я пью кровь тех, кто достоин моего вкуса. Остальных я сжигаю».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846f1d9d-a788-40af-819d-b88b8ac5075f\', \'multiverseId\': 336882}, \'multiverseid\': 336882}, {\'name\': \'未死火焰\', \'text\': \'未死火焰对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。\\n返照{5}{B} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我只喝合我口味者。其他全烧掉。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6633b721-12f2-4498-aa5c-08f4f5e0a75e\', \'multiverseId\': 336027}, \'multiverseid\': 336027}, {\'name\': \'未死火焰\', \'text\': \'未死火焰對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害。\\n返照{5}{B}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我只喝合我口味者。其他全燒掉。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cca070-9ef7-49b8-9c2d-2d52fddb8f34\', \'multiverseId\': 336369}, \'multiverseid\': 336369}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch der Erschöpfung\', \'text\': \'Der verzauberte Spieler kann nicht mehr als einen Zauberspruch in jedem Zug wirken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich vermute, dass du jetzt andere Sorgen als deine Ketzerei hast." —Bischof Argust\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d28ae7-bb75-4faf-8b07-ec553079990c\', \'multiverseId\': 336937}, \'multiverseid\': 336937}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de agotamiento\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nEl jugador encantado no puede lanzar más de un hechizo cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'"Creo que tu herejía será más complicada ahora que tienes otras cosas en mente." —Obispo Argust\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'046a75d1-1687-44e2-98b6-cd18c0d7938e\', \'multiverseId\': 337108}, \'multiverseid\': 337108}, {\'name\': "Malédiction de l\'épuisement", \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nLe joueur enchanté ne peut pas lancer plus d\'un sort par tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': \'« Je crains que des préoccupations plus urgentes ne viennent faire obstacle à votre hérésie. » —Evêque Argust\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ae312a3-a2ce-4876-a0ae-ea5cc7d3d0fd\', \'multiverseId\': 336595}, \'multiverseid\': 336595}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione dello Sfinimento\', \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nIl giocatore incantato non può lanciare più di una magia per turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'"Credo che la tua eresia si dimostrerà più difficile ora che hai problemi più urgenti." —Vescovo Argust\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380b7ea2-19ee-4e6a-acff-00637b6ae8b3\', \'multiverseId\': 337279}, \'multiverseid\': 337279}, {\'name\': \'疲労の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントされているプレイヤーは、毎ターン１つしか呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'「差し迫った問題を抱えてる状況では、異端に向かうのも難しいと思うのだがな。」――アーガスト司教\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83685052-9cb5-4d1f-a39e-768de3cf099a\', \'multiverseId\': 337450}, \'multiverseid\': 337450}, {\'name\': \'기진맥진의 저주\', \'text\': \'부여된 플레이어는 한 턴에 주문을 한 개밖에 발동할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': \'"이 정도면 네놈이 예전처럼 이단 행위를 하고 다니기는 어려울 것 같군." —아르구스트 주교\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9fdfa8-1ee0-4a56-9af4-610b252cd109\', \'multiverseId\': 336082}, \'multiverseid\': 336082}, {\'name\': \'Maldição da Exaustão\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nO jogador encantado não pode conjurar mais do que uma mágica a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'"Acredito que será mais difícil manter sua heresia agora que você tem preocupações mais urgentes." — Bispo Argust\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c93d42f-dbb4-4dfe-9e22-9bb93b7e72a6\', \'multiverseId\': 336424}, \'multiverseid\': 336424}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Изнеможения\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nЗачарованный игрок не может разыгрывать более одного заклинания за ход.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'«Уверен, что вам будет не до ереси теперь, когда у вас возникли более насущные проблемы». — Епископ Аргуст\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b9e280-44fd-429e-bae8-8ae7ccaf0a24\', \'multiverseId\': 336766}, \'multiverseid\': 336766}, {\'name\': \'疲竭诅咒\', \'text\': \'所结附的牌手每回合不能施放一个以上的咒语。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'「既然你有了更多顾忌，我确信你的异端邪说将更窒碍难行。」～主教亚固斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9260bce-fa94-48eb-892c-71e6a536d4b5\', \'multiverseId\': 335911}, \'multiverseid\': 335911}, {\'name\': \'疲竭詛咒\', \'text\': \'所結附的玩家每回合不能施放一個以上的咒語。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'「既然你有了更多顧忌，我確信你的異端邪說將更窒礙難行。」～主教亞固斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50834f5-735a-40e0-b7cd-494bbd924756\', \'multiverseId\': 336253}, \'multiverseid\': 336253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des Blutvergießens\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Quelle dem verzauberten Spieler Schadenspunkte zufügen würde, fügt sie diesem Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist das Zeichen des Dämons, ein höllischer Anspruch auf das Fleisch der Sünder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8fb531-99f5-4c6c-aa7d-44c96b88836b\', \'multiverseId\': 336941}, \'multiverseid\': 336941}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de sangrado\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nSi una fuente fuera a hacer daño al jugador encantado, en vez de eso, le hace el doble de ese daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'Es la marca del demonio, un reclamo infernal sobre la carne del culpable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'065776e1-b6b1-4f6b-8699-ff7c42a0473b\', \'multiverseId\': 337112}, \'multiverseid\': 337112}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de saignée\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : joueur\\nSi une source devait infliger des blessures au joueur enchanté, elle inflige le double de ces blessures à ce joueur à la place.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': "C\'est la marque du démon, une emprise infernale sur la chair des coupables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336599&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2b3fde9-3961-4daa-bffe-4900b6ea330a\', \'multiverseId\': 336599}, \'multiverseid\': 336599}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione del Salasso\', \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nSe una fonte sta per infliggere danno al giocatore incantato, infligge invece il doppio di quel danno a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'È il marchio del demone, una pretesa infernale sulla carne del colpevole.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6dd1e4b-aea7-4138-9b58-28046496b70a\', \'multiverseId\': 337283}, \'multiverseid\': 337283}, {\'name\': \'流血の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nいずれかの発生源がエンチャントされているプレイヤーにダメージを与える場合、代わりにそれはそのプレイヤーにその点数の２倍のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'それは悪魔が罪深き者の肉体に刻んだ、地獄からの要求の印だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6c39118-f49e-4533-b321-da2bd4349fea\', \'multiverseId\': 337454}, \'multiverseid\': 337454}, {\'name\': \'방혈의 저주\', \'text\': \'어느 원천이 부여된 플레이어에게 피해를 입히려 한다면, 대신에 그 원천은 그 피해를 두 배로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 죄지은 자에게 찍힌 악마의 표식이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d21a2f7c-6a50-4e5b-8913-f2ea7bd47073\', \'multiverseId\': 336086}, \'multiverseid\': 336086}, {\'name\': \'Maldição da Sangria\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nSe uma fonte for causar dano ao jogador encantado, em vez disso, ela causará o dobro daquele dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'Esta é a marca do demônio, um sinal infernal na carne dos culpados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e9482f9-7e94-4181-9cac-2c44f86c33ef\', \'multiverseId\': 336428}, \'multiverseid\': 336428}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Кровопускания\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nЕсли источник должен нанести повреждения зачарованному игроку, вместо этого он наносит те повреждения тому игроку в двойном размере.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'Это знак демона — адская претензия на плоть виновного.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c9bfef-8592-40b3-a2ee-bc2e939bcf9c\', \'multiverseId\': 336770}, \'multiverseid\': 336770}, {\'name\': \'流血诅咒\', \'text\': \'若某来源将对所结附的牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该牌手造成两倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'这是恶魔的记号，烙印于罪人肉体来宣告地狱主权。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'873f059a-0b6c-4fc9-869c-1f235b30adcb\', \'multiverseId\': 335915}, \'multiverseid\': 335915}, {\'name\': \'流血詛咒\', \'text\': \'若某來源將對所結附的玩家造成傷害，則改為它對該玩家造成兩倍的傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'這是惡魔的記號，烙印於罪人肉體來宣告地獄主權。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82a3d3b0-1ec1-478d-9f76-933b58b8c717\', \'multiverseId\': 336257}, \'multiverseid\': 336257}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des Dursts\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des verzauberten Spielers fügt der Fluch des Dursts diesem Spieler so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie Flüche an ihn angelegt sind.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'„Mögest du trinken, bis du ertrinkst, aber dein Durst nie gestillt sein." —Odila, Hexe aus dem Morkrutsumpf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e0cd95-57dd-43c1-b7c8-82e9a1c4a3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 336929}, \'multiverseid\': 336929}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de sed\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento del jugador encantado, la Maldición de sed hace daño a ese jugador igual a la cantidad de Maldiciones anexadas a él.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'"Ojalá bebas hasta ahogarte, pero nunca se sacie tu sed." —Odila, bruja de Morkrut\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a155b9f-9423-4903-92cb-83e87441f1a7\', \'multiverseId\': 337100}, \'multiverseid\': 337100}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de soif\', \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nAu début de l\'entretien du joueur enchanté, la Malédiction de soif inflige à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de malédictions qui lui sont attachées.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': \'« Puissiez-vous boire à vous noyer sans que jamais votre soif soit étanchée. » —Odila, envoûteuse de Morkrut\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f172f148-5c50-402d-afdf-c28c04ef7bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 336587}, \'multiverseid\': 336587}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione della Sete\', \'text\': "Incanta giocatore\\nAll\'inizio del mantenimento del giocatore incantato, la Maledizione della Sete infligge a quel giocatore danno pari al numero di Anatemi a lui assegnati.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'"Possa tu bere fino ad annegare ma senza mai dissetarti." —Odila, strega di Morkrut\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'893ed6c2-1064-4d6e-9ef3-3fd4d3e97456\', \'multiverseId\': 337271}, \'multiverseid\': 337271}, {\'name\': \'渇きの呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントされているプレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、渇きの呪いはそのプレイヤーに、そのプレイヤーにつけられている呪いの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'「溺れると言えども満たされること無く飲み続けよ。」――モークラットの魔女、オディラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a60f5885-0514-4819-a7a7-a9c08893642a\', \'multiverseId\': 337442}, \'multiverseid\': 337442}, {\'name\': \'갈증의 저주\', \'text\': \'부여된 플레이어의 유지단 시작에, 갈증의 저주는 그 플레이어에게 부착된 저주의 개수만큼의 피해를 그 플레이어에게 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': \'"네놈이 익사할 때까지 마셔도 갈증을 해소할 수 없기를." —모르크루트의 마녀 오딜라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ebce39-a7b2-4d04-adf3-c3a36aadf110\', \'multiverseId\': 336074}, \'multiverseid\': 336074}, {\'name\': \'Maldição da Sede\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nNo início da manutenção do jogador encantado, Maldição da Sede causa dano àquele jogador igual ao número de Maldições anexadas a ele.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'"Que você beba até se afogar, porém, sem jamais se saciar." — Odila, bruxa de Morkrut\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546e768d-c18d-4851-8513-1a8b2a2f859f\', \'multiverseId\': 336416}, \'multiverseid\': 336416}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Жажды\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nВ начале шага поддержки зачарованного игрока Проклятие Жажды наносит тому игроку повреждения, равные количеству прикрепленных к нему Проклятий.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'«Пей же, пока не захлебнешься, так и не утолив жажду!» — Одила, ведьма из Моркрутского болота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3da279b-6a7c-4e78-91cd-9d968274c4b6\', \'multiverseId\': 336758}, \'multiverseid\': 336758}, {\'name\': \'干渴诅咒\', \'text\': \'在所结附之牌手的维持开始时，每有一个诅咒结附于该牌手，干渴诅咒便对该牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'「祝你喝水直到淹死，却还无法解渴。」～穆坎巫师欧狄拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'671f112e-c23a-42fe-8705-03de95c21380\', \'multiverseId\': 335903}, \'multiverseid\': 335903}, {\'name\': \'乾渴詛咒\', \'text\': \'在所結附之玩家的維持開始時，每有一個詛咒結附於該玩家，乾渴詛咒便對該玩家造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'「祝你喝水直到淹死，卻還無法解渴。」～穆坎巫師歐狄拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1708bbb-930d-4a10-aeda-76a20c96fe36\', \'multiverseId\': 336245}, \'multiverseid\': 336245}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des Echos\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, kann jeder andere Spieler diesen Zauberspruch kopieren und kann für die Kopie, die er selbst kontrolliert, neue Ziele bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337062&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ba3685e-a4ae-45b4-8df1-87993741c435\', \'multiverseId\': 337062}, \'multiverseid\': 337062}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de ecos\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, cada otro jugador puede copiar ese hechizo y puede elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia que controle.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89849d12-3390-4921-a2fd-7cc30ad092ba\', \'multiverseId\': 337233}, \'multiverseid\': 337233}, {\'name\': "Malédiction d\'échos", \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, chaque autre joueur peut copier ce sort et choisir de nouvelles cibles pour la copie qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56125e81-bd5c-4bc8-afbb-740baaa0d841\', \'multiverseId\': 336720}, \'multiverseid\': 336720}, {\'name\': "Maledizione dell\'Eco", \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, ogni altro giocatore può copiare quella magia e può scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bed8860-effa-4437-81be-aec7f6924d98\', \'multiverseId\': 337404}, \'multiverseid\': 337404}, {\'name\': \'こだまの呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントされているプレイヤーがインスタント呪文かソーサリー呪文を１つ唱えるたび、他の各プレイヤーは、その呪文をコピーしてもよく、自分がコントロールするそのコピーの新たな対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bae743e-d7ba-4699-b174-752118980953\', \'multiverseId\': 337575}, \'multiverseid\': 337575}, {\'name\': \'메아리의 저주\', \'text\': \'부여된 플레이어가 순간마법이나 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 그를 제외한 모든 플레이어는 그 주문을 복사할 수 있다. 그렇게 한 모든 플레이어는 자신이 조종하는 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0cf1f15-fbcf-43bc-ac37-af72f18b28e3\', \'multiverseId\': 336207}, \'multiverseid\': 336207}, {\'name\': \'Maldição dos Ecos\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, cada um dos outros jogadores pode copiar aquela mágica e escolher novos alvos para a cópia que controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a03080-af7a-44ad-9363-a3b85195f5e1\', \'multiverseId\': 336549}, \'multiverseid\': 336549}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Эха\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nКаждый раз когда зачарованный игрок разыгрывает мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, каждый другой игрок может скопировать то заклинание и может выбрать новые цели для копии под своим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9636da9-9e16-4a19-bc2a-9825d385478c\', \'multiverseId\': 336891}, \'multiverseid\': 336891}, {\'name\': \'回响诅咒\', \'text\': \'每当所结附的牌手施放一个瞬间或法术咒语时，每位其他牌手可以复制该咒语，且可以为自己所操控的复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4637fe1c-db36-4f52-8c71-f5d3b5a0ecb0\', \'multiverseId\': 336036}, \'multiverseid\': 336036}, {\'name\': \'迴響詛咒\', \'text\': \'每當所結附的玩家施放一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，每位其他玩家可以複製該咒語，且可以為自己所操控的複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa77fde-ff9b-453f-9fd5-b83b9555ffe9\', \'multiverseId\': 336378}, \'multiverseid\': 336378}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluch des Missgeschicks\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Fluch-Karte durchsuchen, die nicht den gleichen Namen wie ein an den verzauberten Spieler angelegter Fluch hat, sie an diesen Spieler angelegt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337091&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47aa9005-3d03-45af-a1cd-c03170d69df8\', \'multiverseId\': 337091}, \'multiverseid\': 337091}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de desgracias\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Maldición que no tenga el mismo nombre que una Maldición anexada al jugador encantado, ponerla en el campo de batalla anexada a ese jugador y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee30b27-b64e-4a93-b6ed-d636220a8ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 337262}, \'multiverseid\': 337262}, {\'name\': "Malédiction d\'infortunes", \'text\': "Enchanter : joueur\\nAu début de votre entretien, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de malédiction qui n\'a pas le même nom qu\'une malédiction attachée au joueur enchanté, la mettre sur le champ de bataille attachée à ce joueur, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aa132a9-e1e2-4fff-a7d6-763dcce14939\', \'multiverseId\': 336749}, \'multiverseid\': 336749}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione delle Disgrazie\', \'text\': "Incanta giocatore\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Anatema che non ha lo stesso nome di un Anatema assegnato al giocatore incantato, metterla sul campo di battaglia assegnata a quel giocatore, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0066ef03-c8d4-469a-a023-bb29f75b4f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 337433}, \'multiverseid\': 337433}, {\'name\': \'不幸の呪い\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはエンチャントされているプレイヤーにつけられているどの呪いとも同じ名前を持たない呪いカードを１枚探してもよい。そうしたなら、それをそのプレイヤーにつけられた状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ca6d0a6-b6a9-48ae-870f-da4fb3899784\', \'multiverseId\': 337604}, \'multiverseid\': 337604}, {\'name\': \'불행의 저주\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신은 부여된 플레이어에게 부착되어있는 저주와 카드명이 다른 저주 카드 한 장을 당신의 서고에서 찾아 그 플레이어에게 부착된 채로 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진 저주\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a742db-3ed5-4c0d-a6eb-9d766f5f0b97\', \'multiverseId\': 336236}, \'multiverseid\': 336236}, {\'name\': \'Maldição dos Infortúnios\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nNo início de sua manutenção, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de Maldição que não tenha o mesmo nome que uma Maldição anexada ao jogador encantado, colocá-lo no campo de batalha anexado àquele jogador e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d58fe6d-7364-4e87-8134-7846683732f9\', \'multiverseId\': 336578}, \'multiverseid\': 336578}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Невзгод\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Проклятия, имя которой отличается от Проклятия, прикрепленного к зачарованному игроку, положить ее на поле битвы прикрепленной к тому игроку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e03a8a-c589-4b1c-b6e4-fd0573f1f3d2\', \'multiverseId\': 336920}, \'multiverseid\': 336920}, {\'name\': \'厄运诅咒\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张诅咒牌，且不能与已结附于该牌手的任一诅咒同名，将之放进战场并结附于该牌手，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'504e9254-eb05-4f0d-82d9-b4bab2b63cda\', \'multiverseId\': 336065}, \'multiverseid\': 336065}, {\'name\': \'厄運詛咒\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張詛咒牌，且不能與已結附於該玩家的任一詛咒同名，將之放進戰場並結附於該玩家，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf87a648-6ac5-4aed-a7be-2fb72412375e\', \'multiverseId\': 336407}, \'multiverseid\': 336407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flugstunde\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um Flugstunde zu wirken.\\nDie Flugstunde fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Schwertmeister wissen, dass die Klinge nicht ihre einzige Waffe ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c0e44c-e1c1-4a95-a0a9-adf0092d1c50\', \'multiverseId\': 337088}, \'multiverseid\': 337088}, {\'name\': \'Arrojar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar Arrojar, sacrifica una criatura.\\nArrojar hace daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los maestros de espadas saben que la hoja no es la única arma a su disposición.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e37d42c3-9c61-4e31-b5a6-b5745c128219\', \'multiverseId\': 337259}, \'multiverseid\': 337259}, {\'name\': \'Jet\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer le Jet, sacrifiez une créature.\\nLe Jet inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les maîtres de l\'épée savent que la lame n\'est pas la seule arme à leur disposition.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336746&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2fbd50-469a-4879-b531-9ce663cd6fd1\', \'multiverseId\': 336746}, \'multiverseid\': 336746}, {\'name\': \'Scagliare\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare Scagliare, sacrifica una creatura.\\nScagliare infligge danno pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I maestri della spada sanno che la lama non è l\'unica arma che hanno a disposizione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c1adcb-56d2-4a85-8db4-8321af572f1b\', \'multiverseId\': 337430}, \'multiverseid\': 337430}, {\'name\': \'投げ飛ばし\', \'text\': \'投げ飛ばしを唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。投げ飛ばしはそれに、その生け贄に捧げられたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'剣の達人は、刃のみが武器でない事を知っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'075f7198-be83-45fe-83c6-eab474ed94a2\', \'multiverseId\': 337601}, \'multiverseid\': 337601}, {\'name\': \'특공\', \'text\': \'특공을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 특공은 그 목표에게 희생된 생물의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'검술의 달인이라고 해서 검만 무기로 사용할 줄 아는 건 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19663f36-ad38-4341-a01b-eb8325d7a179\', \'multiverseId\': 336233}, \'multiverseid\': 336233}, {\'name\': \'Arremessar\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Arremessar, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nArremessar causa à criatura ou ao jogador alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os mestres da espada sabem que a lâmina não é a única arma à sua disposição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41eae30c-34a4-4908-aa79-ef619480a402\', \'multiverseId\': 336575}, \'multiverseid\': 336575}, {\'name\': \'Швырок\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Швырка пожертвуйте существо.\\nШвырок наносит целевому существу или игроку количество повреждений, равное силе пожертвованного существа.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Мастера мечей знают, что клинок — не единственное оружие в их распоряжении.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8aa6fea-94f4-4e47-9bfb-21b0d44213c5\', \'multiverseId\': 336917}, \'multiverseid\': 336917}, {\'name\': \'投掷\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放投掷的额外费用。投掷对目标生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'使剑大师能运用的武器不只是剑锋而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9eb21f3-c676-48fb-aa6c-229118400ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 336062}, \'multiverseid\': 336062}, {\'name\': \'投擲\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放投擲的額外費用。投擲對目標生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於所犧牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'使劍大師能運用的武器不只是劍鋒而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d9dba6e-937d-4bef-b20a-ce74abbff86b\', \'multiverseId\': 336404}, \'multiverseid\': 336404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frösteln der Vorahnung\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler legt die obersten fünf Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\\nRückblende {7}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wartet mal, Kumpel... habt ihr etwas gehört?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f939a5b-623e-4e48-b519-e3fa741da128\', \'multiverseId\': 336949}, \'multiverseid\': 336949}, {\'name\': \'Presentimiento escalofriante\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador pone las primeras cinco cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Un momento… ¿escucharon algo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d366fc70-8931-4bd7-bab6-a6b4b4f29685\', \'multiverseId\': 337120}, \'multiverseid\': 337120}, {\'name\': "Frisson d\'angoisse", \'text\': \'Chaque joueur met les cinq cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\nFlashback {7}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Attendez . . . vous n\'avez rien entendu ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336607&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c2d63ab-c332-4690-b4ee-b1b41ac74449\', \'multiverseId\': 336607}, \'multiverseid\': 336607}, {\'name\': \'Brivido di Presagio\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore mette nel proprio cimitero le prime cinque carte del proprio grimorio.\\nFlashback {7}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Aspettate. . . avete sentito qualcosa?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f45fb2-cab1-426e-8a7a-ef7eec2f593d\', \'multiverseId\': 337291}, \'multiverseid\': 337291}, {\'name\': \'予言の寒気\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。フラッシュバック {7}{U} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ちょっ……誰か何か聞こえたか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b81ea870-fcb6-4868-a304-ff8fa0565f57\', \'multiverseId\': 337462}, \'multiverseid\': 337462}, {\'name\': \'불길한 음산함\', \'text\': \'각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 다섯 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n회상 {7}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"잠깐 . . . 당신들 혹시 뭔가 못 들었소?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c81621a8-b0f6-4b9e-8f24-8324c88c3155\', \'multiverseId\': 336094}, \'multiverseid\': 336094}, {\'name\': \'Calafrio Premonitório\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador coloca os cinco cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.\\nRecapitular {7}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Espere... vocês ouviram algo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07bb1034-aa0d-4cf5-8402-e8c65a027573\', \'multiverseId\': 336436}, \'multiverseid\': 336436}, {\'name\': \'Холодок Дурного Предчувствия\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок кладет пять верхних карт своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\\nВоспоминание {7}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Постойте...вам ничего не послышалось?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e033566f-5ba1-4207-a1de-f421cc86518a\', \'multiverseId\': 336778}, \'multiverseid\': 336778}, {\'name\': \'不寒而栗\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各将其牌库顶的五张牌置入其坟墓场。\\n返照{7}{U} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「等等...各位伙伴有没有听到什么？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2f5799-4f08-4f63-9d3b-1a4ff831c83b\', \'multiverseId\': 335923}, \'multiverseid\': 335923}, {\'name\': \'不寒而慄\', \'text\': \'每位玩家各將其牌庫頂的五張牌置入其墳墓場。\\n返照{7}{U}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「等等...各位伙伴有沒有聽到什麼？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86a7acf3-c4d8-436e-a618-81f0d93bcd5c\', \'multiverseId\': 336265}, \'multiverseid\': 336265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedanken ausradieren\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du den viscus vitae in das Stammhirn spritzt, lass dich nicht vom krampfartigen Stöhnen ablenken. Es wird bald schon Musik in deinen Ohren sein." —Geralf der Näher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337059&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcd9c3b-e42c-4cb2-9a64-773cc3dce104\', \'multiverseId\': 337059}, \'multiverseid\': 337059}, {\'name\': \'Depuración de pensamientos\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo pone las primeras dos cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Conforme inyectes el viscus vitae en el bulbo raquídeo, que no te molesten los gemidos espásticos. Pronto serán música para tus oídos." —Suturador Geralf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f86d0c-ce45-4388-b2c0-c0e8153164c4\', \'multiverseId\': 337230}, \'multiverseid\': 337230}, {\'name\': \'Écurage de pensée\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé met les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand vous injectez le viscus vitae dans le cervelet, ne vous laissez pas impressionner par les gémissements incontrôlés. Vous les percevrez rapidement comme une mélodie. » —Raccommodeur Geralf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a357db-3365-4534-bcc0-9b5858123937\', \'multiverseId\': 336717}, \'multiverseid\': 336717}, {\'name\': \'Rovistapensieri\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero le prime due carte del suo grimorio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando inietti il viscus vitae nello stelo del cervello, non ti far distrarre dal lamento spastico. Ben presto sarà musica per le tue orecchie." —Cucitore Geralf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f011a9-f34f-479c-9cbe-95bf2697a96e\', \'multiverseId\': 337401}, \'multiverseid\': 337401}, {\'name\': \'思考掃き\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「脳幹に臓器剤を注入すれば、痙攣性のうめき声など気にならなくなる。すぐに音楽のように聞こえるだろう。」――縫い師、ゲラルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c23a046-761d-4dae-a6bf-e641995da265\', \'multiverseId\': 337572}, \'multiverseid\': 337572}, {\'name\': \'생각의 박멸\', \'text\': \'플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"뇌간에 \\\'생명내장\\\'을 주입할 때 신음 소리가 날 수도 있는데, 신경 쓰지 마. 얼마 안 가서 넌 그 소리를 즐기게 될 거야." —봉합술사 게랄프\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a4837c-008f-4cf6-ac0d-350a07c8f239\', \'multiverseId\': 336204}, \'multiverseid\': 336204}, {\'name\': \'Purgar Pensamento\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo coloca os dois cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando injetar o viscus vitae no tronco cerebral, não se incomode com os gemidos espasmódicos. Logo serão música para os seus ouvidos." — Suturador Geralf\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e574524a-2f70-4dd8-8722-4e4241c3e104\', \'multiverseId\': 336546}, \'multiverseid\': 336546}, {\'name\': \'Промывка Мыслей\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок кладет две верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Вкалывая жизненные флюиды в мозг, не расстраивайтесь, услышав судорожные стоны. Вскоре они начнут звучать для вас как музыка». — сшиватель Геральф\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b3e1c5-36f5-4ced-a4a1-8b689d7cba8a\', \'multiverseId\': 336888}, \'multiverseid\': 336888}, {\'name\': \'洗清思想\', \'text\': \'目标牌手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「将生命精华注入脑干时，别让那些断续呻吟分了心。它很快就会化作耳中美妙乐章。」～拼接师基拉夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f793b3-35f7-4d8b-9e97-e2e8e88eeb30\', \'multiverseId\': 336033}, \'multiverseid\': 336033}, {\'name\': \'洗清思想\', \'text\': \'目標玩家將其牌庫頂的兩張牌置入其墳墓場。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「將生命精華注入腦幹時，別讓那些斷續呻吟分了心。它很快就會化作耳中美妙樂章。」～拼接師基拉夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a97599-9927-4e53-831b-e489b4e9de27\', \'multiverseId\': 336375}, \'multiverseid\': 336375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiger Dämon // Erzdämon der Gier\', \'text\': \'Opfere einen Menschen: Transformiere den Gefräßigen Dämon. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Seine verdrehten Worte gefallen den Schwachen.\', \'faceName\': \'Gefräßiger Dämon\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146faa4f-f1a1-4733-9d73-75d09a58e5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 336943}, \'multiverseid\': 336943}, {\'name\': \'Demonio rapaz // Archidemonio de la avaricia\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar un Humano: Transforma al Demonio rapaz. Activa esta habilidad sólo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Sus palabras retorcidas atraen a los débiles.\', \'faceName\': \'Demonio rapaz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64df0754-a542-4db7-a81f-2e5b84aeacc0\', \'multiverseId\': 337114}, \'multiverseid\': 337114}, {\'name\': "Démon vorace // Archidémon d\'avidité", \'text\': "Sacrifiez un humain : Transformez le Démon vorace. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': \'Sa langue fourchue séduit les faibles.\', \'faceName\': \'Démon vorace\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336601&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e8be7b-9cb7-4c05-9b10-c32364f80210\', \'multiverseId\': 336601}, \'multiverseid\': 336601}, {\'name\': "Demone Famelico // Arcidemone dell\'Ingordigia", \'text\': \'Sacrifica un Umano: Trasforma il Demone Famelico. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue parole contorte attraggono i deboli.\', \'faceName\': \'Demone Famelico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325a26ed-ec79-452f-9409-47bc08fa1539\', \'multiverseId\': 337285}, \'multiverseid\': 337285}, {\'name\': \'貪欲なる悪魔 // 強欲の大悪魔\', \'text\': \'人間を１体生け贄に捧げる：貪欲なる悪魔を変身させる。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'そのねじくれた言葉は弱き者を魅了する。\', \'faceName\': \'貪欲なる悪魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82297464-bf05-42c3-a7d6-172106d17d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 337456}, \'multiverseid\': 337456}, {\'name\': \'굶주린 악마 // 탐욕의 대악마\', \'text\': \'인간 지속물 한 개를 희생한다: 굶주린 악마를 변신시킨다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'그는 뒤틀린 언변으로 약한 자들을 꼬드긴다.\', \'faceName\': \'굶주린 악마\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d665fc6-3762-4bf8-91c8-bb6259272aee\', \'multiverseId\': 336088}, \'multiverseid\': 336088}, {\'name\': \'Demônio Voraz // Arquidemônio da Ganância\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique um Humano: Transforme Demônio Voraz. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Suas palavras distorcidas atraem os fracos.\', \'faceName\': \'Demônio Voraz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7462a43a-d5d6-45e9-adb4-e59c9d154c45\', \'multiverseId\': 336430}, \'multiverseid\': 336430}, {\'name\': \'Изголодавшийся Демон // Архидемон Алчности\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Человека: трансформируйте Изголодавшегося Демона. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'Его запутанные речи соблазняют слабых.\', \'faceName\': \'Изголодавшийся Демон\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf110515-f78b-4465-9062-958f0d442e49\', \'multiverseId\': 336772}, \'multiverseid\': 336772}, {\'name\': \'暴食恶魔 // 贪婪大恶魔\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个人类：转化暴食恶魔。你只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'他的邪恶话语能吸引弱者。\', \'faceName\': \'暴食恶魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c3540f-d480-470e-adac-057bf7cc791c\', \'multiverseId\': 335917}, \'multiverseid\': 335917}, {\'name\': \'暴食惡魔 // 貪婪大惡魔\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個人類：轉化暴食惡魔。你只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'他的邪惡話語能吸引弱者。\', \'faceName\': \'暴食惡魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb7d1847-e020-43d0-8475-c22396672b7b\', \'multiverseId\': 336259}, \'multiverseid\': 336259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiger Dämon // Erzdämon der Gier\', \'text\': \'Opfere zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments einen Menschen. Falls du dies nicht kannst, tappe den Erzdämon der Gier und er fügt dir 9 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'„Bezahlt ist bezahlt! Jetzt gehört die Macht mir!"\', \'faceName\': \'Erzdämon der Gier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146faa4f-f1a1-4733-9d73-75d09a58e5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 336943}, \'multiverseid\': 336943}, {\'name\': \'Demonio rapaz // Archidemonio de la avaricia\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, sacrifica un Humano. Si no puedes, gira al Archidemonio de la avaricia y te hace 9 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'"He pagado el precio. ¡El poder es mío!"\', \'faceName\': \'Archidemonio de la avaricia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64df0754-a542-4db7-a81f-2e5b84aeacc0\', \'multiverseId\': 337114}, \'multiverseid\': 337114}, {\'name\': "Démon vorace // Archidémon d\'avidité", \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nAu début de votre entretien, sacrifiez un humain. Si vous ne pouvez pas le faire, engagez l\'Archidémon d\'avidité et il vous inflige 9 blessures.", \'type\': \'Créature : - démon\', \'flavor\': "« Le prix est payé. Le pouvoir m\'appartient ! »", \'faceName\': "Archidémon d\'avidité", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336601&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e8be7b-9cb7-4c05-9b10-c32364f80210\', \'multiverseId\': 336601}, \'multiverseid\': 336601}, {\'name\': "Demone Famelico // Arcidemone dell\'Ingordigia", \'text\': "Volare, travolgere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, sacrifica un Umano. Se non puoi farlo, TAPpa l\'Arcidemone dell\'Ingordigia ed esso ti infligge 9 danni.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'"Il prezzo è stato pagato. Il potere è mio!"\', \'faceName\': "Arcidemone dell\'Ingordigia", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325a26ed-ec79-452f-9409-47bc08fa1539\', \'multiverseId\': 337285}, \'multiverseid\': 337285}, {\'name\': \'貪欲なる悪魔 // 強欲の大悪魔\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、人間を１体生け贄に捧げる。そうできない場合、強欲の大悪魔をタップし、それはあなたに９点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'「代償は支払われた。力は我のものだ！」\', \'faceName\': \'強欲の大悪魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82297464-bf05-42c3-a7d6-172106d17d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 337456}, \'multiverseid\': 337456}, {\'name\': \'굶주린 악마 // 탐욕의 대악마\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 인간 지속물 한 개를 희생한다. 그럴 수 없다면 탐욕의 대악마는 탭되며, 그것은 당신에게 피해 9점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'"대가를 치뤘으니 그 힘은 이제 내 것이다!"\', \'faceName\': \'탐욕의 대악마\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d665fc6-3762-4bf8-91c8-bb6259272aee\', \'multiverseId\': 336088}, \'multiverseid\': 336088}, {\'name\': \'Demônio Voraz // Arquidemônio da Ganância\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nNo início de sua manutenção, sacrifique um Humano. Se não puder, vire Arquidemônio da Ganância e ele causará 9 pontos de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'"O preço foi pago. O poder é meu!"\', \'faceName\': \'Arquidemônio da Ganância\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7462a43a-d5d6-45e9-adb4-e59c9d154c45\', \'multiverseId\': 336430}, \'multiverseid\': 336430}, {\'name\': \'Изголодавшийся Демон // Архидемон Алчности\', \'text\': \'Полет, Пробивной удар\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки пожертвуйте Человека. Если вы не можете это сделать, поверните Архидемона Алчности и он наносит вам 9 повреждений.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'«Цена заплачена. Власть — моя!»\', \'faceName\': \'Архидемон Алчности\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf110515-f78b-4465-9062-958f0d442e49\', \'multiverseId\': 336772}, \'multiverseid\': 336772}, {\'name\': \'暴食恶魔 // 贪婪大恶魔\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，牺牲一个人类。若你无法如此作，则横置贪婪大恶魔且它对你造成9点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「代价已偿。赋我力量！」\', \'faceName\': \'贪婪大恶魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c3540f-d480-470e-adac-057bf7cc791c\', \'multiverseId\': 335917}, \'multiverseid\': 335917}, {\'name\': \'暴食惡魔 // 貪婪大惡魔\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，犧牲一個人類。若你無法如此作，則橫置貪婪大惡魔且它對你造成9點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'「代價已償。賦我力量！」\', \'faceName\': \'貪婪大惡魔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb7d1847-e020-43d0-8475-c22396672b7b\', \'multiverseId\': 336259}, \'multiverseid\': 336259}]', "[{'name': 'Gefälligkeit der Wälder', 'text': 'Immer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur blockt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Weil sie sich von Avacyn verlassen glaubten, kehrten manche in Kessig zu den heidnischen Ritualen ihrer Vorfahren zurück.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337031&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '707decaa-9a30-4ed1-9a41-68f043788fc8', 'multiverseId': 337031}, 'multiverseid': 337031}, {'name': 'Favor de los bosques', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada bloquee, ganas 3 vidas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Abandonados por Avacyn, algunos habitantes de Kessig volvieron a los rituales paganos de sus ancestros.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337202&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db7e4c72-c1a3-40a2-afbf-41cbbcc636ea', 'multiverseId': 337202}, 'multiverseid': 337202}, {'name': 'Faveur des bois', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée bloque, vous gagnez 3 points de vie.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'Se sentant abandonnés par Avacyn, certains Kessigiens se réfugièrent dans les rites païens de leurs ancêtres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336689&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe17b7b7-e6d0-4ee9-902d-2dd9f041ec24', 'multiverseId': 336689}, 'multiverseid': 336689}, {'name': 'Favore dei Boschi', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata blocca, guadagni 3 punti vita.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': 'Sentendosi abbandonati da Avacyn, alcuni Kessiger si affidarono ai rituali pagani dei loro antenati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337373&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c160e5c7-0da1-4597-a97e-07c10dfee390', 'multiverseId': 337373}, 'multiverseid': 337373}, {'name': '森林の好意', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーがブロックするたび、あなたは３点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': 'アヴァシンに見捨てられたと感じたケッシグの人々の中には、先祖の異教の儀式に走る者もいた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337544&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25a6577a-6afd-4c14-a8f1-02b6bf57ef18', 'multiverseId': 337544}, 'multiverseid': 337544}, {'name': '숲의 은혜', 'text': '부여된 생물이 방어할 때마다, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': '아바신이 그들을 버렸다고 여긴 케시그의 일부 주민들은 조상들의 토속 신앙으로 돌아섰다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336176&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7efe637d-9a0a-4fc1-bfda-ea82ce778af1', 'multiverseId': 336176}, 'multiverseid': 336176}, {'name': 'Proteção do Bosque', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada bloqueia, você ganha 3 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': 'Sentindo-se abandonados por Avacyn, alguns kessigianos retomaram os rituais pagãos de seus antepassados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336518&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '545c98ce-39ff-4ae9-a7ff-0892d65c13a0', 'multiverseId': 336518}, 'multiverseid': 336518}, {'name': 'Покровительство Леса', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nКаждый раз когда зачарованное существо блокирует, вы получаете 3 жизни.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': 'Чувствуя, что Авацина покинула их, некоторые кессигцы вернулись к языческим ритуалам своих предков.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336860&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ab86a22-b602-461f-bf0a-27cb384be1fb', 'multiverseId': 336860}, 'multiverseid': 336860}, {'name': '林木眷恩', 'text': '每当所结附的生物进行阻挡时，你获得3点生命。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '有些凯锡革人民觉得遭艾维欣遗弃，开始转而行使先祖的异教仪式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336005&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db5e093a-cadc-4856-8ae8-4cc4f9f05f6f', 'multiverseId': 336005}, 'multiverseid': 336005}, {'name': '林木眷恩', 'text': '每當所結附的生物進行阻擋時，你獲得3點生命。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': '有些凱錫革人民覺得遭艾維欣遺棄，開始轉而行使先祖的異教儀式。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336347&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e7ce823-500e-4fa8-bae4-e8f08cdab6c3', 'multiverseId': 336347}, 'multiverseid': 336347}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geheimnisse der Toten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch aus deinem Friedhof wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schleier zwischen den Lebenden und den Toten ist so dünn, dass wir das Geflüster der Vorfahren endlich hören können." —Amalric von Midvasthall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93d6c013-77ed-449d-9aa0-03019017f4c0\', \'multiverseId\': 336944}, \'multiverseid\': 336944}, {\'name\': \'Secretos de los muertos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo desde tu cementerio, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La cortina que separa los vivos de los muertos es tan fina que los susurros de los antiguos finalmente pueden oírse." —Amalric del Salón Midvast\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02553d5d-424e-4618-9464-52d608a5f407\', \'multiverseId\': 337115}, \'multiverseid\': 337115}, {\'name\': \'Secrets des morts\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort depuis votre cimetière, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Le voile séparant les vivants et les morts est si fin que les murmures des anciens se font finalement entendre. » —Amalric de la Salle de Midvast\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336602&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0829256e-b276-45f9-a068-2a53faacd1b8\', \'multiverseId\': 336602}, \'multiverseid\': 336602}, {\'name\': \'Segreti dei Morti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia dal tuo cimitero, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il velo tra i vivi e i morti è così sottile che si può finalmente sentire il bisbiglio degli antenati." —Amalric di Midvast Hall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307d7032-56fa-46d0-a972-55e75c16b938\', \'multiverseId\': 337286}, \'multiverseid\': 337286}, {\'name\': \'死者の秘密\', \'text\': \'あなたがあなたの墓地から呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「生者と死者を隔てる帳は極めて薄く、古えの囁きが聞こえるほどです。」――ミッドヴァストの間のアマルリク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5508c4-1488-400c-80a6-d3ae0ab36f76\', \'multiverseId\': 337457}, \'multiverseid\': 337457}, {\'name\': \'망자의 비밀\', \'text\': \'당신이 당신의 무덤에서 주문을 발동할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"드디어 고대인들의 속삭임이 들릴 만큼 산 자와 죽은 자의 경계가 얇아졌다." —미드배스트 회관의 아말릭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0384407a-8e17-4cd7-834b-b43c70d4c96e\', \'multiverseId\': 336089}, \'multiverseid\': 336089}, {\'name\': \'Segredos dos Mortos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de seu cemitério, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O véu que separa os vivos dos mortos é tão sutil que os antepassados finalmente podem ser ouvidos." — Amalric, de Midvast Hall\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d797d228-dc64-4d2b-9e84-7bfe00252558\', \'multiverseId\': 336431}, \'multiverseid\': 336431}, {\'name\': \'Тайны Мертвецов\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда вы разыгрываете заклинание из вашего кладбища, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Завеса, разделяющая живых и мертвых, настолько тонкая, что наконец-то стал слышен шепот древних». — Амальрик из Среднего Зала\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2046503-ab78-4c79-a6fd-740497f80e49\', \'multiverseId\': 336773}, \'multiverseid\': 336773}, {\'name\': \'亡者秘密\', \'text\': \'每当你从你的坟墓场施放一个咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「生灵与亡者间的帘幕是如此薄，让我们终将听闻先祖细语。」～米威厅的艾马力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e92e02-7b78-453a-8778-b6e937cc1a77\', \'multiverseId\': 335918}, \'multiverseid\': 335918}, {\'name\': \'亡者秘密\', \'text\': \'每當你從你的墳墓場施放一個咒語時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「生靈與亡者間的簾幕是如此薄，讓我們終將聽聞先祖細語。」～米威廳的艾馬力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c252d3-a116-48a7-b8d4-b75cf4153f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 336260}, \'multiverseid\': 336260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geist aus Hohlhengel\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)Wenn der Geist aus Hohlhengel ins Spiel kommt, entferne eine angreifende oder blockende Kreatur deiner Wahl aus dem Kampf.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Geister klagen. Andere terrorisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e89abbf1-70b0-4e62-ab5d-43329a5647d9\', \'multiverseId\': 336932}, \'multiverseid\': 336932}, {\'name\': \'Espíritu de Hollowhenge\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Espíritu de Hollowhenge entre al campo de batalla, remueve del combate la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos espíritus velan. Otros aterrorizan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca14a25-ec87-41fd-ae61-f2f7378ffc56\', \'multiverseId\': 337103}, \'multiverseid\': 337103}, {\'name\': \'Esprit de Cerclecreux\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Esprit de Cerclecreux arrive sur le champ de bataille, retirez du combat une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "Certains esprits se lamentent. D\'autres terrorisent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5262b8-ac98-4b90-ba69-2db066878d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 336590}, \'multiverseid\': 336590}, {\'name\': \'Spirito di Fossocavo\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nVolare\\nQuando lo Spirito di Fossocavo entra nel campo di battaglia, rimuovi dal combattimento una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni spiriti si lamentano. Altri terrorizzano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0f5495-2317-4202-94cb-31d075dc6b89\', \'multiverseId\': 337274}, \'multiverseid\': 337274}, {\'name\': \'ホロウヘンジの霊魂\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n飛行\\nホロウヘンジの霊魂が戦場に出たとき、攻撃かブロックしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを戦闘から取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'霊魂は嘆き悲しむ。さもなくば恐れおののかせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f0c5e60-d039-41b3-82b6-a11de54a4880\', \'multiverseId\': 337445}, \'multiverseid\': 337445}, {\'name\': \'할로우헨지 신령\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)할로우헨지 신령이 전장에 들어올 때, 공격생물이나 방어생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 전투에서 제거한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'애도하는 영혼이 있는가 하면, 위협하는 영혼도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc4c28de-31b3-41cb-9dd8-3ea54cbcc910\', \'multiverseId\': 336077}, \'multiverseid\': 336077}, {\'name\': \'Espírito de Vale Seco\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nVoar\\nQuando Espírito de Vale Seco entrar no campo de batalha, remova a criatura alvo atacante ou bloqueadora do combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns espíritos guardam luto. Outros aterrorizam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5aaabb2-e893-4122-8535-736f51940350\', \'multiverseId\': 336419}, \'multiverseid\': 336419}, {\'name\': \'Дух из Холлоухенджа\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nПолет\\nКогда Дух из Холлоухенджа выходит на поле битвы, удалите из боя целевое атакующее или блокирующее существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Одни духи скорбят, а другие — терроризируют.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8702a1b-3dae-47ef-9850-b31f9185befd\', \'multiverseId\': 336761}, \'multiverseid\': 336761}, {\'name\': \'空圆地精怪\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）当空圆地精怪进战场时，将目标进行攻击或阻挡的生物移出战斗。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'有些灵魂满怀哀痛。其他的则令人胆寒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8975597-1806-4e36-b0c5-615a0126ecf0\', \'multiverseId\': 335906}, \'multiverseid\': 335906}, {\'name\': \'空圓地精靈\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）當空圓地精靈進戰場時，將目標進行攻擊或阻擋的生物移出戰鬥。\', \'type\': \'生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'有些靈魂滿懷哀痛。其他的則令人膽寒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21d40616-9c82-4276-a33f-1dfe915281a2\', \'multiverseId\': 336248}, \'multiverseid\': 336248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gekonnter Überraschungsangriff\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +2/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Tapferkeit ist eine Tugend der Lebenden, die uns hilft." —Kaspar Lau von der Wache von Silberig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337094&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe2277b1-e277-4ea1-8ddf-96950aae1d10\', \'multiverseId\': 337094}, \'multiverseid\': 337094}, {\'name\': \'Embestida hábil\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El coraje es una moneda de los vivos que nos sirve bien." —Cosper Lowe de la Guardia de Silbern\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcc122ea-c966-42ba-bea9-b1037ade8bc3\', \'multiverseId\': 337265}, \'multiverseid\': 337265}, {\'name\': \'Frappe habile\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Le courage est une valeur des vivants qui nous est fort utile. » —Cosper Lowe de la garde de Silbern\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336752&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f32cdbf-accb-4f5a-acb5-f7c0a241b9a2\', \'multiverseId\': 336752}, \'multiverseid\': 336752}, {\'name\': \'Abile Affondo\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il valore è una moneta dei viventi che ci è molto utile." —Cosper Lowe della Guardia Silbern\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbb15acc-fb8b-457d-b75e-ccf0941e27da\', \'multiverseId\': 337436}, \'multiverseid\': 337436}, {\'name\': \'熟練の突き\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「勇猛さは、生きる者にとって有能な通貨だ。」――シルバーン守護隊のコスパー・ロウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03256fad-b393-4be1-9390-c943b6433aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 337607}, \'multiverseid\': 337607}, {\'name\': \'능숙한 돌진\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받고 선제공격 능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"용기는 살아있는 자들만이 갖고 있는 유용한 특징이지." —실베른 수호대의 코스퍼 로우\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a385393c-5bf4-46bd-92e0-4cf429622203\', \'multiverseId\': 336239}, \'multiverseid\': 336239}, {\'name\': \'Investida Habilidosa\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O heroísmo é uma moeda dos vivos muito útil para nós." — Cosper Lowe, da Guarda de Silbern\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e9b0471-6c6d-4c9d-82a2-2ec45b7a9bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 336581}, \'multiverseid\': 336581}, {\'name\': \'Умелый Выпад\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +2/+0 и Первый удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Доблесть — это ценное качество живых, которое всегда с нами». — Коспер Лоу из Сильбернской Гвардии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9aff038-7633-4619-ab61-3acf58a05cf4\', \'multiverseId\': 336923}, \'multiverseid\': 336923}, {\'name\': \'老练刺击\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+2/+0且获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「勇气这生灵价值对我们很有用。」～席尔本卫队的考伯洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdde3a3-44e9-431b-97ab-aa41d20df79f\', \'multiverseId\': 336068}, \'multiverseid\': 336068}, {\'name\': \'老練刺擊\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+2/+0且獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「勇氣這生靈價值對我們很有用。」～席爾本衛隊的考伯洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b898996-e6be-41f7-b203-114b3d222fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 336410}, \'multiverseid\': 336410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geralfs Bote\', \'text\': \'Geralfs Bote kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn Geralfs Bote ins Spiel kommt, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl 2 Lebenspunkte.\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a97c74-5da6-4b57-a92c-139d430ebbf3\', \'multiverseId\': 336958}, \'multiverseid\': 336958}, {\'name\': \'Mensajero de Geralf\', \'text\': \'El Mensajero de Geralf entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Mensajero de Geralf entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pierde 2 vidas.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c6638b-c2b6-4cc5-9e57-0022135f26a6\', \'multiverseId\': 337129}, \'multiverseid\': 337129}, {\'name\': \'Messager de Geralf\', \'text\': "Le Messager de Geralf arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Messager de Geralf arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'adversaire ciblé perd 2 points de vie.\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336616&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61dac85b-22e0-4734-a68f-0f12d0b572f5\', \'multiverseId\': 336616}, \'multiverseid\': 336616}, {\'name\': \'Messaggero di Geralf\', \'text\': \'Il Messaggero di Geralf entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Messaggero di Geralf entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio perde 2 punti vita.\\nImmortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b8e19f0-cadd-47eb-913b-2f9fe1661f92\', \'multiverseId\': 337300}, \'multiverseid\': 337300}, {\'name\': \'ゲラルフの伝書使\', \'text\': \'ゲラルフの伝書使はタップ状態で戦場に出る。ゲラルフの伝書使が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89de55be-00fb-4e1b-9281-26f96ba5955d\', \'multiverseId\': 337471}, \'multiverseid\': 337471}, {\'name\': \'게랄프의 전령\', \'text\': \'게랄프의 전령은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n게랄프의 전령이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\\n불사 (이 생물이 죽을 때, 만약 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 올라가있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 +1/+1 카운터 한 개가 올라간 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd282936-1c3d-4d87-bc5f-2a1a430ecb1c\', \'multiverseId\': 336103}, \'multiverseid\': 336103}, {\'name\': \'Mensageiro de Geralf\', \'text\': \'Mensageiro de Geralf entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Mensageiro de Geralf entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo perde 2 pontos de vida.\\nImortal (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef32141f-b6ac-4406-ad92-cdc6e0efbebf\', \'multiverseId\': 336445}, \'multiverseid\': 336445}, {\'name\': \'Посыльный Геральфа\', \'text\': \'Посыльный Геральфа выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Посыльный Геральфа выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент теряет 2 жизни.\\nНетленность (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'459d9f29-0210-4d68-b22e-0664caa99b32\', \'multiverseId\': 336787}, \'multiverseid\': 336787}, {\'name\': \'基拉夫信差\', \'text\': \'基拉夫信差须横置进战场。当基拉夫信差进战场时，目标对手失去2点生命。不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下返回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2308eb4-9a54-42ee-aead-156f328f92a8\', \'multiverseId\': 335932}, \'multiverseid\': 335932}, {\'name\': \'基拉夫信差\', \'text\': \'基拉夫信差須橫置進戰場。當基拉夫信差進戰場時，目標對手失去2點生命。不息（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有+1/+1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下返回戰場，且其上有一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53914aef-c859-496e-88b4-058073f6d234\', \'multiverseId\': 336274}, \'multiverseid\': 336274}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geralfs Gedankenbrecher\', \'text\': \'Wenn Geralfs Gedankenbrecher ins Spiel kommt, legt ein Spieler deiner Wahl die obersten fünf Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e3982b-9aea-42f6-90ca-68c4780a74cd\', \'multiverseId\': 337060}, \'multiverseid\': 337060}, {\'name\': \'Aplastamentes de Geralf\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Aplastamentes de Geralf entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo pone las primeras cinco cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfb7516-1108-4d58-b558-612b61d41fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 337231}, \'multiverseid\': 337231}, {\'name\': "Écrabouilleur d\'esprit de Geralf", \'text\': "Quand l\'Écrabouilleur d\'esprit de Geralf arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé met les cinq cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336718&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e0baf0-d0cf-4b2f-816e-32dd67bd9f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 336718}, \'multiverseid\': 336718}, {\'name\': \'Fracassamente di Geralf\', \'text\': \'Quando il Fracassamente di Geralf entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero le prime cinque carte del suo grimorio.\\nImmortale(Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7fbba94-718b-4fd2-ab5c-e2ee77e7eb05\', \'multiverseId\': 337402}, \'multiverseid\': 337402}, {\'name\': \'ゲラルフの精神壊し\', \'text\': \'ゲラルフの精神壊しが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上から５枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16608ecf-147a-420d-8d1e-3d8531633241\', \'multiverseId\': 337573}, \'multiverseid\': 337573}, {\'name\': \'게랄프의 정신붕괴수\', \'text\': \'게랄프의 정신붕괴수가 전장에 들어올 때, 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 다섯 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n불사 (이 생물이 죽을 때, 만약 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 올라가있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 +1/+1 카운터 한 개가 올라간 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 괴수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d9752f6-9835-4868-82e5-06bdcbcdb5c1\', \'multiverseId\': 336205}, \'multiverseid\': 336205}, {\'name\': \'Esmagador de Mente de Geralf\', \'text\': \'Quando Esmagador de Mente de Geralf entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo coloca os cinco cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\\nImortal (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd54723-4264-4979-bf92-5c3a5a907c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 336547}, \'multiverseid\': 336547}, {\'name\': \'Мозгодав Геральфа\', \'text\': \'Когда Мозгодав Геральфа выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок кладет пять верхних карт своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\\nНетленность (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09dc655a-fe97-40f4-84be-5458e1d885b0\', \'multiverseId\': 336889}, \'multiverseid\': 336889}, {\'name\': \'基拉夫撼灵妖\', \'text\': \'当基拉夫撼灵妖进战场时，目标牌手将其牌库顶的五张牌置入其坟墓场。不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下返回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3831eed-8ce1-4a9b-b285-b9357493aa73\', \'multiverseId\': 336034}, \'multiverseid\': 336034}, {\'name\': \'基拉夫撼靈妖\', \'text\': \'當基拉夫撼靈妖進戰場時，目標玩家將其牌庫頂的五張牌置入其墳墓場。不息（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有+1/+1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下返回戰場，且其上有一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6784d48-8ddc-423d-b025-e7acea81f754\', \'multiverseId\': 336376}, \'multiverseid\': 336376}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesang der Skiffsänger\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -13/-0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die Skiffsänger von Nefalen weben Zaubersprüche wie andere Seefahrer Netze: stark genug, um selbst den tödlichsten Fang einzuschnüren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbf8daca-bc35-4854-bff3-5c85ec8a5f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 337051}, \'multiverseid\': 337051}, {\'name\': \'Canto de los skifsang\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene -13/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Los skifsang, navegantes de Nephalia, tejen hechizos como otros marinos tejen redes: suficientemente fuertes como para retener a la presa más mortífera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535e408c-45ae-4721-a1b4-f047c95171cc\', \'multiverseId\': 337222}, \'multiverseid\': 337222}, {\'name\': \'Chant du skifsang\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne -13/-0.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Les skifsangs, marins de Néphalie, tissent leurs sorts comme d\'autres marins tissent leurs filets : assez résistants pour attraper les poissons les plus dangereux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336709&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea05c2b-5ea3-4c9e-8550-7957a0471c27\', \'multiverseId\': 336709}, \'multiverseid\': 336709}, {\'name\': \'Canto degli Skifsang\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende -13/-0.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Gli skifsang, i navigatori di Nephalia, creano magie come gli altri marinai intrecciano reti: rendendole abbastanza forti da intrappolare anche la preda più letale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87f258b8-3011-43ee-83bd-d455fd1c7061\', \'multiverseId\': 337393}, \'multiverseid\': 337393}, {\'name\': \'スキフサングの詠唱\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは－13/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'ネファリアの船員達の集まりであるスキフサングは、他の船乗りが網を編むかの如くに呪文を編む――それは最も危険な獲物ですら捕えるのに十分な強さだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25c256a0-4e64-41bb-932a-2b1d9a13b100\', \'multiverseId\': 337564}, \'multiverseid\': 337564}, {\'name\': \'스키프상의 구호\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 -13/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"스키프상"이라 불리는 네팔리아의 항해사들은 다른 선원들이 그물을 다루듯 마법을 다룬다. 따라서 그들은 굉장히 위험한 것도 낚을 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ffc62f8-4428-40f8-a526-0cc4a3363837\', \'multiverseId\': 336196}, \'multiverseid\': 336196}, {\'name\': \'Cântico dos Skifsang\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe -13/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Os skifsang, marinheiros de Nefália, tecem mágicas do mesmo modo que outros marinheiros tecem redes — fortes o suficiente para capturar até a presa mais letal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25c53673-c919-42f0-b695-2c26ee607e01\', \'multiverseId\': 336538}, \'multiverseid\': 336538}, {\'name\': \'Напев Скифсангов\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает -13/-0.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Скифсанги, мореплаватели из Нефалии, плетут заклинания, как другие моряки плетут сети, делая их достаточно прочными, чтобы удержать даже самый опасный улов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'449793cb-58d4-47d2-96e1-70c88178db66\', \'multiverseId\': 336880}, \'multiverseid\': 336880}, {\'name\': \'航歌员吟诵\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得-13/-0。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'涅非利亚有批称为航歌员的水手，能如同其他水手织出强韧网一般地造出咒语，足以困住最可怕的获物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faa10887-ad78-44de-b27b-800fb17f2c41\', \'multiverseId\': 336025}, \'multiverseid\': 336025}, {\'name\': \'航歌員吟誦\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得-13/-0。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'涅非利亞有批稱為航歌員的水手，能如同其他水手織出強韌網一般地造出咒語，足以困住最可怕的獲物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42080c9e-5503-4ef8-b41b-a9000d3ea129\', \'multiverseId\': 336367}, \'multiverseid\': 336367}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ghulbaum\', \'text\': \'Den Ghulbaum zu wirken kostet für jede Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': \'Er plündert Sumpfgräber, um die Wurzeln seinen eigenen hinzuzufügen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3462a410-96ca-48c4-b251-bb0c90475eea\', \'multiverseId\': 337012}, \'multiverseid\': 337012}, {\'name\': \'Árbol necrófago\', \'text\': \'Cuesta {1} menos lanzar al Árbol necrófago por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pueblo-arbóreo zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Levanta tumbanegadas enteras para injertarlas en su enramada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc405b9-7597-419f-a1cc-ae42d8588b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 337183}, \'multiverseid\': 337183}, {\'name\': \'Arbre-goule\', \'text\': "L\'Arbre-goule coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et sylvin\', \'flavor\': \'Il déracine des paludgrafs entiers pour les ajouter à sa carcasse tordue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336670&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1fd848-7a93-47cd-8e62-b8359474252a\', \'multiverseId\': 336670}, \'multiverseid\': 336670}, {\'name\': \'Alberoghoul\', \'text\': "L\'Alberoghoul costa {1} in meno per essere lanciato per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Silvantropo Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Sradica interi cimiteri palustri da aggiungere al suo fusto contorto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbe0b79-4dbb-428f-8678-ea23a4f65f9d\', \'multiverseId\': 337354}, \'multiverseid\': 337354}, {\'name\': \'グール樹\', \'text\': \'グール樹を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': \'それは沼墓全体を根こそぎにし、ねじくれた身体に加えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acc73de0-a183-43e4-8949-565f79ebf7d7\', \'multiverseId\': 337525}, \'multiverseid\': 337525}, {\'name\': \'악귀나무\', \'text\': \'악귀나무는 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장당 발동하는데 {1}가 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 인목\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 늪지의 묘지들을 모조리 뒤엎어 자신의 덩치를 불린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a432d641-37b2-4b46-8af3-c75247219f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 336157}, \'multiverseid\': 336157}, {\'name\': \'Árvore Carniçal\', \'text\': \'Árvore Carniçal custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada card de criatura no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Ent\', \'flavor\': \'Ele desarraigou cemitérios pantanosos inteiros para aumentar sua força sombria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6369769-c7f1-4135-9f83-97701c4fdf6a\', \'multiverseId\': 336499}, \'multiverseid\': 336499}, {\'name\': \'Древоупырь\', \'text\': \'Стоимость разыгрывания Древоупыря уменьшается на {1} за каждую карту существа на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Лесовик\', \'flavor\': \'Он вырывает из земли целые могильники, укрепляя свой переплетенный ствол.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ffd0a1b-69d7-4a7c-8c5c-ac7024c28b84\', \'multiverseId\': 336841}, \'multiverseid\': 336841}, {\'name\': \'食尸树\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，食尸树便减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／树妖\', \'flavor\': \'它将整座沼墓连根拔起，纳入自身枝架。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62af9878-8e91-4290-91ff-bd5ec5bd7511\', \'multiverseId\': 335986}, \'multiverseid\': 335986}, {\'name\': \'食屍樹\', \'text\': \'你墳墓場中每有一張生物牌，食屍樹便減少{1}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／樹妖\', \'flavor\': \'它將整座沼墓連根拔起，納入自身枝架。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34dd5fb6-278e-4804-a4b7-65ccc9a37157\', \'multiverseId\': 336328}, \'multiverseid\': 336328}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glas mit Augäpfeln\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt, die du kontrollierst, lege zwei Augapfelmarken auf das Glas mit Augäpfeln.\\n{3}, {T}, entferne alle Augapfelmarken vom Glas mit Augäpfeln: Schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X die Anzahl der auf diese Weise entfernten Augapfelmarken ist. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cadaeed-308d-4c8e-9541-bbd4a4d51647\', \'multiverseId\': 336961}, \'multiverseid\': 336961}, {\'name\': \'Jarra de ojos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controles muera, pon dos contadores de globo ocular sobre la Jarra de ojos.\\n{3}, {T}, remover todos los contadores de globo ocular de la Jarra de ojos: Mira las primeras X cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de globo ocular removidos de esta manera. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51cf31f8-f335-42f3-b513-c2a9d23dbfe5\', \'multiverseId\': 337132}, \'multiverseid\': 337132}, {\'name\': \'Pot de globes oculaires\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, mettez deux marqueurs « globe oculaire » sur le Pot de globes oculaires.\\n{3}, {T}, retirez tous les marqueurs « globe oculaire » du Pot de globes oculaires : Regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « globe oculaire » retirés de cette manière. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336619&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fb19907-0eb1-4797-9890-9adcd260c4ca\', \'multiverseId\': 336619}, \'multiverseid\': 336619}, {\'name\': \'Vaso dei Bulbi Oculari\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta muore una creatura che controlli, metti due segnalini occhio sul Vaso dei Bulbi Oculari.\\n{3}, {T}, Rimuovi tutti i segnalini occhio dal Vaso dei Bulbi Oculari: Guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è il numero di segnalini occhio rimossi in questo modo. Aggiungi una di quelle carte alla tua mano e metti tutte le altre carte in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c323a4-ef57-4aa2-a012-45f45d2550b0\', \'multiverseId\': 337303}, \'multiverseid\': 337303}, {\'name\': \'目玉の壺\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、目玉の壺の上に目玉カウンターを２個置く。{3}, {T}, 目玉の壺からすべての目玉カウンターを取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを見る。Ｘはこれにより取り除かれた目玉カウンターの数に等しい。それらのうちの１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a947dd-967b-4429-9706-97c1a9aeb97d\', \'multiverseId\': 337474}, \'multiverseid\': 337474}, {\'name\': \'눈알 항아리\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 눈알 항아리에 눈알 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\\n{3}, {T}, 눈알 항아리로부터 모든 눈알 카운터를 제거한다: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 X장을 본다. X는 당신이 이렇게 제거한 눈알 카운터의 개수다. 그 중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8bd35b1-4021-4165-bfc8-3606e8e462e4\', \'multiverseId\': 336106}, \'multiverseid\': 336106}, {\'name\': \'Jarra de Globos Oculares\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla morrer, coloque dois marcadores de globo ocular sobre Jarra de Globos Oculares.\\n{3}, {T}, Remova todos os marcadores de globo ocular de Jarra de Globos Oculares: Olhe os X cards do topo de seu grimório, sendo X igual ao número de marcadores de globo ocular removidos desse modo. Coloque um deles em sua mão e os restantes no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d57a9582-edfc-4636-9933-1e11b383c2b9\', \'multiverseId\': 336448}, \'multiverseid\': 336448}, {\'name\': \'Банка с Зеницами\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда существо под вашим контролем умирает, положите два жетона зеницы на Банку с Зеницами.\\n{3}, {T}, удалите все жетоны зеницы с Банки с Зеницами: посмотрите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, где X — количество жетонов зеницы, удаленных таким образом. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3265b0-fcdb-4b31-961c-518ab05a6ca4\', \'multiverseId\': 336790}, \'multiverseid\': 336790}, {\'name\': \'眼珠瓶\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，在眼珠瓶上放置两个眼珠指示物。{3}，{T}，移除眼珠瓶上所有的眼珠指示物：检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为以此法移去的眼珠指示物数量。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5631013-d76d-4de9-adba-6b57bbe16781\', \'multiverseId\': 335935}, \'multiverseid\': 335935}, {\'name\': \'眼珠瓶\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物死去時，在眼珠瓶上放置兩個眼珠指示物。{3}，{T}，移除眼珠瓶上所有的眼珠指示物：檢視你牌庫頂的X張牌，X為以此法移去的眼珠指示物數量。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df1e06c3-15f0-4387-859c-ebcae43e0784\', \'multiverseId\': 336277}, \'multiverseid\': 336277}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabbelung\', \'text\': \'Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Vorsicht vor den Seegräbern am Ufer. Dort am Wasser gibt es viele hungrige Geister, die nur auf die nächste Mahlzeit warten." —Kapitän Eberhart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6142208-5709-4e15-8535-fd84ce1d57b6\', \'multiverseId\': 336954}, \'multiverseid\': 336954}, {\'name\': \'Sujetamarea\', \'text\': \'Pon la criatura objetivo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuidado con las tumbamarinas cerca de la costa. Estas aguas están llenas de geists hambrientos que buscan una cena fácil." —Capitán Eberhart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bc14559-90f3-488a-9fc9-75a64b508506\', \'multiverseId\': 337125}, \'multiverseid\': 337125}, {\'name\': \'Turbulences\', \'text\': \'Mettez la créature ciblée au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Prenez garde aux seegrafs au large. Ces eaux regorgent de geists affamés en quête de proies faciles. » —Capitaine Eberhart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336612&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499e0961-1f04-48f1-a024-1b91ee666658\', \'multiverseId\': 336612}, \'multiverseid\': 336612}, {\'name\': \'Presa della Corrente\', \'text\': \'Metti una creatura bersaglio in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Attento ai cimiteri marini al largo. Queste acque sono piene di geist affamati in cerca di un pasto facile." —Capitano Eberhart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf83cb0f-f6ef-4834-a5bb-95341caf13da\', \'multiverseId\': 337296}, \'multiverseid\': 337296}, {\'name\': \'捕海\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「岸のすぐ先の海墓に注意しな。水の中にゃ、お手軽な飯を探してる腹を減らした霊がうようよしてんだ。」――エバハート船長\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e6061d1-c8cc-4b45-8775-e0d7cf527932\', \'multiverseId\': 337467}, \'multiverseid\': 337467}, {\'name\': \'파도의 손아귀\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 서고 맨 위에 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"해변가에서 약간 떨어져있는 수중묘지들을 조심하게. 그 주변 바다에는 손쉬운 먹잇감을 노리는 굶주린 심령들이 많다네." —에버하트 선장\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50bc17de-3e3c-4073-930d-0c8f1c5ad391\', \'multiverseId\': 336099}, \'multiverseid\': 336099}, {\'name\': \'Corrente de Refluxo\', \'text\': \'Coloque a criatura alvo no topo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuidado com os cemitérios marinhos nas proximidades da costa. As águas nessa área são infestadas de geists famintos, ávidos por uma refeição fácil." — Capitão Eberhart\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2579d9c6-6d1b-473e-9467-ca62f1f4ed2a\', \'multiverseId\': 336441}, \'multiverseid\': 336441}, {\'name\': \'Хваткое Течение\', \'text\': \'Положите целевое существо на верх библиотеки его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Опасайтесь морских могильников неподалеку от побережья. Эти воды кишат голодными привидениями, рыщущими в поисках легкой добычи». — капитан Эберхарт\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3ec0672-5fe3-4233-9b4e-1c68e510929d\', \'multiverseId\': 336783}, \'multiverseid\': 336783}, {\'name\': \'攫流\', \'text\': \'将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「当心离海岸不远的海墓。水域中充满想随便解决一餐的饥饿游魂。」～队长艾博汉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f7cd11f-0139-4052-bf8c-134f20bc73ee\', \'multiverseId\': 335928}, \'multiverseid\': 335928}, {\'name\': \'攫流\', \'text\': \'將目標生物置於其擁有者的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「當心離海岸不遠的海墓。水域中充滿想隨便解決一餐的飢餓遊魂。」～隊長艾博漢\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0be71dd4-c0f3-4fa4-abcb-561ab9244824\', \'multiverseId\': 336270}, \'multiverseid\': 336270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabkriecher\', \'text\': \'Der Grabkriecher kann nicht blocken.\\nDu kannst den Grabkriecher aus deinem Friedhof wirken, solange du einen Zombie kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ghulrufer von Innistrad sind schon äußerst talentiert, aber ich zeige dir gerne, was jemand mit richtiger Macht alles erzeugen kann." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30068dd9-85d9-4546-a100-25ecd951bfa9\', \'multiverseId\': 336934}, \'multiverseid\': 336934}, {\'name\': \'Acechatumbas\', \'text\': \'El Acechatumbas no puede bloquear.\\nPuedes lanzar el Acechatumbas desde tu cementerio mientras controles un Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Los llamamuertos de Innistrad tienen talento, pero déjame mostrarte lo que alguien con verdadero poder puede crear." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a69063fa-32a9-43c9-a0e6-4fdcaf7bc8d1\', \'multiverseId\': 337105}, \'multiverseid\': 337105}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur des tombes\', \'text\': \'Le Rampeur des tombes ne peut pas bloquer.\\nVous pouvez lancer le Rampeur des tombes depuis votre cimetière tant que vous contrôlez un zombie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "« Les meneurs de goules d\'Innistrad sont certes doués, mais laissez-moi vous montrer ce que quelqu\'un de vraiment puissant peut créer. » —Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a54772f9-a626-4d82-964f-6cd7e14a8523\', \'multiverseId\': 336592}, \'multiverseid\': 336592}, {\'name\': \'Strisciante del Sepolcro\', \'text\': \'Lo Strisciante del Sepolcro non può bloccare.\\nPuoi lanciare lo Strisciante del Sepolcro dal tuo cimitero fintanto che controlli uno Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli evocaghoul di Innistrad possiedono un certo talento, ma permettimi di mostrarti cosa può creare chi ha un vero potere." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fbc92ba-5c89-4359-bcef-7c20f95ae62f\', \'multiverseId\': 337276}, \'multiverseid\': 337276}, {\'name\': \'墓所這い\', \'text\': \'墓所這いではブロックできない。あなたは、あなたがゾンビをコントロールしているかぎり、墓所這いをあなたの墓地から唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「イニストラードのグール呼びにも才能はあるけど、本当の力を持った者が生み出すものを見せてやるよ。」――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75a2511d-87c4-47ec-9f6a-2331a1383f98\', \'multiverseId\': 337447}, \'multiverseid\': 337447}, {\'name\': \'무덤을 기어다니는 좀비\', \'text\': \'무덤을 기어다니는 좀비는 방어할 수 없다.\\n당신이 좀비 지속물을 조종하는 한, 당신은 무덤 위를 기어다니는 좀비를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"이니스트라드의 악귀소환술사들이 재능이 없는 건 아니야. 하지만 진정한 힘을 가진 자가 만들어내는 건 수준이 다르지. 잘 봐라." —릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65d797bb-a434-40f5-85c8-8e359b64b735\', \'multiverseId\': 336079}, \'multiverseid\': 336079}, {\'name\': \'Rastejador de Túmulo\', \'text\': \'Rastejador de Túmulo não pode bloquear.\\nVocê pode conjurar Rastejador de Túmulo de seu cemitério enquanto controlar um Zumbi.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Os invocadores de carniçais de Innistrad são muito habilidosos, mas me permita mostrar o que alguém com poder de verdade pode criar." — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92095a02-857e-4463-bf9e-cf2811b5ebad\', \'multiverseId\': 336421}, \'multiverseid\': 336421}, {\'name\': \'Могильный Выползень\', \'text\': \'Могильный Выползень не может блокировать.\\nВы можете разыграть Могильного Выползня из вашего кладбища, пока вы контролируете Зомби.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Иннистрадские призыватели упырей довольно талантливы, но позвольте показать вам, что может сотворить тот, кто по-настоящему могуществен». — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e414d6a-f68f-4412-a8ea-c15316b6aa75\', \'multiverseId\': 336763}, \'multiverseid\': 336763}, {\'name\': \'墓场匍尸\', \'text\': \'墓场匍尸不能进行阻挡。只要你操控灵俑，你便可以从你的坟墓场中施放墓场匍尸。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「依尼翠的尸鬼牧者算是有点天份，但我要你瞧瞧拥有真正力量者能造出什么来。」～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3698a78-90a8-4adf-a521-0a500f8676a7\', \'multiverseId\': 335908}, \'multiverseid\': 335908}, {\'name\': \'墓場匍屍\', \'text\': \'墓場匍屍不能進行阻擋。只要你操控殭屍，你便可以從你的墳墓場中施放墓場匍屍。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「依尼翠的屍鬼牧者算是有點天份，但我要你瞧瞧擁有真正力量者能造出什麼來。」～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a678be-b578-4011-9812-695693952bc3\', \'multiverseId\': 336250}, \'multiverseid\': 336250}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grableerung\', \'text\': \'Lege eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Heilige Schlaf? Ha! Wacht auf, meine Süßen, es gibt Arbeit für alle!" —Gisa, Ghulruferin aus Gaven\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb663686-fcf2-4492-96ca-a1b1f6907910\', \'multiverseId\': 336930}, \'multiverseid\': 336930}, {\'name\': \'Purgar las tumbas\', \'text\': \'Pon cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿El Sueño Bendito? ¡Ja! En pie, queridos, ¡hay trabajo que hacer!" —Gisa, llamamuertos de Gavony\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae5bc3b-5d81-4bc2-882d-74cf2c4b1848\', \'multiverseId\': 337101}, \'multiverseid\': 337101}, {\'name\': \'Purge de tombe\', \'text\': "Mettez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature ciblées de votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Le Sommeil béni ? Pouah ! On se réveille mes petits, il y a du pain sur la planche ! » —Gisa, meneuse de goule of Gavonie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d9397c-a7d9-4112-956a-7d8c2a6f875d\', \'multiverseId\': 336588}, \'multiverseid\': 336588}, {\'name\': \'Epurazione delle Tombe\', \'text\': \'Metti in cima al tuo grimorio un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il Sonno Benedetto? Ah! Svegliatevi carucci, c\\\'è un sacco di lavoro da fare!" —Gisa, evocaghoul di Gavony\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fefbb55-b9d0-40c1-a2ce-a683c1607001\', \'multiverseId\': 337272}, \'multiverseid\': 337272}, {\'name\': \'墓所粛正\', \'text\': \'望む枚数のあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードを対象とし、それらをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置く。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「祝福された眠りですって？ はっ！ 愛しき者どもよ、目覚めなさい。仕事よ！」――ガヴォニーのグール呼び、ギザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323113b8-eb47-4767-8ccd-4f2aa66d35bd\', \'multiverseId\': 337443}, \'multiverseid\': 337443}, {\'name\': \'무덤 숙청\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 원하는 만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 서고 맨 위에 올려놓는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"축복의 영면? 웃기는군! 일어나거라, 나의 귀염둥이들아. 할 일이 많다!" —가보니의 악귀소환술사 기샤\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b8a95f-387a-4be8-836e-0e4afd942c01\', \'multiverseId\': 336075}, \'multiverseid\': 336075}, {\'name\': \'Expurgar Túmulo\', \'text\': \'Coloque qualquer número de cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O Sono Abençoado? Pois sim! Acordem, bonitinhos, pois há muito trabalho a ser feito!" — Gisa, invocadora de carniçais de Gavony\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8481b19d-d6e3-483f-b202-f356c2b4327d\', \'multiverseId\': 336417}, \'multiverseid\': 336417}, {\'name\': \'Чистка Могил\', \'text\': \'Положите любое количество целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Благословенный Сон? Ха! Вставайте, красавчики, пора за работу!» — Джиза, призывательница упырей из Гевоны\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c1c0df9-9822-4a99-90a1-b696c1321119\', \'multiverseId\': 336759}, \'multiverseid\': 336759}, {\'name\': \'净空坟地\', \'text\': \'将任意数量的目标生物牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「受福安眠？哈！小可爱们快醒来吧，工作来了！」～加渥尼尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b343d19-ea9a-42d3-af75-434436a2f055\', \'multiverseId\': 335904}, \'multiverseid\': 335904}, {\'name\': \'淨空墳地\', \'text\': \'將任意數量的目標生物牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「受福安眠？哈！小可愛們快醒來吧，工作來了！」～加渥尼屍鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64239448-22ac-4da1-ab3d-25ffa09b6bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 336246}, \'multiverseid\': 336246}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grabpflügerwurm\', \'text\': \'Morbide — Der Grabpflügerwurm kommt mit vier +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, falls eine Kreatur in diesem Zug gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Kreaturen der Nacht die Menschen umzingelt hatten, wachten auch die Urkräfte von Innistrad auf, als ob sie dem Gemetzel zuschauen wollten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ab7e15-3f46-4749-9e42-dc3f6ac7db52\', \'multiverseId\': 337020}, \'multiverseid\': 337020}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe labratumba\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nNecrario — La Sierpe labratumba entra al campo de batalla con cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre ella si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras las criaturas de la noche arrinconaban a la humanidad, las fuerzas primitivas de Innistrad se agitaron, como si se despertaran para observar la masacre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c7ef8ef-df47-4478-b6b2-a0bfd8bb18f3\', \'multiverseId\': 337191}, \'multiverseid\': 337191}, {\'name\': \'Guivre laboureuse de tombes\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nMorbidité — La Guivre laboureuse de tombes arrive sur le champ de bataille avec quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que l\'étau des créatures de la nuit se refermait sur l\'humanité, les forces primaires d\'Innistrad s\'ébranlèrent, comme si elles s\'éveillaient pour assister au massacre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0050e0d7-e194-40fa-a35b-fe69675f2eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 336678}, \'multiverseid\': 336678}, {\'name\': \'Wurm Dissodatombe\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nMorboso — Il Wurm Dissodatombe entra nel campo di battaglia con quattro segnalini +1/+1 se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': "Mentre le creature della notte calavano sull\'umanità, le forze primitive di Innistrad si agitavano, come se si risvegliassero per guardare il massacro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9231d54f-d874-463b-9a15-32ca86c5db30\', \'multiverseId\': 337362}, \'multiverseid\': 337362}, {\'name\': \'墓耕しのワーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n陰鬱 ― このターンいずれかのクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、墓耕しのワームは＋１/＋１カウンターが４個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'夜の怪物が人類に迫った時、イニストラードの原初の力は、殺戮者を見張るために目覚めたかのように身を震わせた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7114a782-c536-45ca-89d6-94646896a5a3\', \'multiverseId\': 337533}, \'multiverseid\': 337533}, {\'name\': \'무덤을 갈아버리는 웜\', \'text\': \'사망 — 이 턴에 생물이 죽었다면, 무덤을 갈아버리는 웜은 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': \'밤의 괴수들이 인간들을 위협하자, 마치 그 광경을 구경하고 싶어하는 듯 이니스트라드의 오래된 세력들이 꿈틀거리기 시작했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b989c68-e191-435d-b6bb-d5ac315f90f2\', \'multiverseId\': 336165}, \'multiverseid\': 336165}, {\'name\': \'Vorme Lavrador de Túmulo\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nMórbido — Vorme Lavrador de Túmulo entrará no campo de batalha com quatro marcadores +1/+1 sobre ele se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme as criaturas da noite se aproximaram da humanidade, as forças primitivas de Innistrad se agitaram, como se acordassem para assistir ao massacre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49090824-6ee5-4305-9075-478f7ea5a42e\', \'multiverseId\': 336507}, \'multiverseid\': 336507}, {\'name\': \'Вурм-Рыхлитель Могил\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nБолезненность — Вурм-Рыхлитель Могил выходит на поле битвы с четырьмя жетонами +1/+1 на нем, если в этом ходу умерло существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': \'По мере того как ночные твари наступали на людей, первобытные силы Иннистрада зашевелились, словно пробуждаясь в предвкушении резни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163a0453-5152-4b28-b772-dc1bb39be76a\', \'multiverseId\': 336849}, \'multiverseid\': 336849}, {\'name\': \'翻坟亚龙\', \'text\': \'丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，翻坟亚龙进战场时上面有四个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'暗夜生物对人类的威胁升高，惊醒了依尼翠的太古势力，起身观赏屠杀景象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a0f0ac-3b8e-455e-8ad5-d25a430b7a05\', \'multiverseId\': 335994}, \'multiverseid\': 335994}, {\'name\': \'翻墳亞龍\', \'text\': \'喪心～如果本回合有生物死去，翻墳亞龍進戰場時上面有四個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～亞龍\', \'flavor\': \'暗夜生物對人類的威脅升高，驚醒了依尼翠的太古勢力，起身觀賞屠殺景象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69bc6b3a-1d83-4dce-96e5-31e232eb2bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 336336}, \'multiverseid\': 336336}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grauenhafte Entdeckung\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten aus seiner Hand ab.\\nMorbide — Falls eine Kreatur in diesem Zug gestorben ist, zeigt stattdessen dieser Spieler die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor, du bestimmst zwei davon, und dieser Spieler wirft dann diese Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8750737b-b696-4ac7-9445-f9a7ed0469d5\', \'multiverseId\': 337064}, \'multiverseid\': 337064}, {\'name\': \'Descubrimiento horripilante\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas.\\nNecrario — Si una criatura murió este turno, en vez de eso, ese jugador muestra su mano, tú eliges dos cartas de ahí, luego ese jugador descarta esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'141b1a38-25e1-4b14-a818-0c4a9182983d\', \'multiverseId\': 337235}, \'multiverseid\': 337235}, {\'name\': \'Horrible découverte\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.\\nMorbidité — Si une créature est morte ce tour-ci, à la place ce joueur révèle sa main, vous y choisissez deux cartes et ce joueur s\'en défausse.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336722&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd69649-9785-463d-acfe-509c2aeb32a5\', \'multiverseId\': 336722}, \'multiverseid\': 336722}, {\'name\': \'Scoperta Raccapricciante\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte.\\nMorboso — Se una creatura è morta in questo turno, quel giocatore invece rivela la sua mano, tu scegli due carte da essa, poi quel giocatore scarta quelle carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e31681a-e3b3-4d10-a26a-2a5bde4c5b65\', \'multiverseId\': 337406}, \'multiverseid\': 337406}, {\'name\': \'陰惨な発見\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚捨てる。陰鬱 ― このターンにいずれかのクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、代わりにそのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開し、あなたはその中から２枚のカードを選び、そのプレイヤーはそれらのカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a507131-3fd1-4a79-aff2-c1a705304000\', \'multiverseId\': 337577}, \'multiverseid\': 337577}, {\'name\': \'끔찍한 발견\', \'text\': \'플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 두 장을 버린다.\\n사망 — 만약 이 턴에 생물이 죽었다면, 대신에 그 플레이어는 자신의 손을 공개한다. 당신은 그 중에서 카드 두 장을 선택하고, 그 플레이어는 선택된 카드들을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'956c89f0-c6d7-460f-8666-a2fbf521640c\', \'multiverseId\': 336209}, \'multiverseid\': 336209}, {\'name\': \'Descoberta Horripilante\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo descarta dois cards.\\nMórbido — Se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno, em vez disso, aquele jogador revela sua própria mão, você escolhe dois cards dela e depois, aquele jogador descarta aqueles cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3080df44-80e4-4d05-8ff9-43aaec35ca8e\', \'multiverseId\': 336551}, \'multiverseid\': 336551}, {\'name\': \'Ужасная Находка\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок сбрасывает две карты.\\nБолезненность — Если в этом ходу умерло существо, вместо этого тот игрок показывает свою руку, вы выбираете из нее две карты, затем тот игрок сбрасывает те карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'011ba477-8a48-4a8f-8435-4c3326facfe3\', \'multiverseId\': 336893}, \'multiverseid\': 336893}, {\'name\': \'恶心发现\', \'text\': \'目标牌手弃两张牌。丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，则改为该牌手展示其手牌，你选择其中两张，然后该牌手弃掉这些牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3200dde8-fe1d-4a19-b26b-a9794af6e467\', \'multiverseId\': 336038}, \'multiverseid\': 336038}, {\'name\': \'噁心發現\', \'text\': \'目標玩家棄兩張牌。喪心～如果本回合有生物死去，則改為該玩家展示其手牌，你選擇其中兩張，然後該玩家棄掉這些牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51ed3be-5853-4e42-a51a-6e16fcf4e817\', \'multiverseId\': 336380}, \'multiverseid\': 336380}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmige Blüte\', \'text\': \'Ziehe für jede Kreatur-Karte auf deinem Friedhof eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nichts in der Natur geht verloren, noch nicht einmal der verrottende Körper eines blutsaugenden Tunichtsguts von Vampir." —Halana vom Ulvenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2475388a-cb73-4c37-827e-c91271ae574e\', \'multiverseId\': 337063}, \'multiverseid\': 337063}, {\'name\': \'Floración siniestra\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada carta de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Nada se desperdicia en la naturaleza, ni siquiera el cuerpo putrefacto de un vampiro chupasangre inútil." —Halana de Ulvenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c402129-8162-463e-bc19-0a0bd1fdce39\', \'multiverseId\': 337234}, \'multiverseid\': 337234}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre floraison\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte pour chaque carte de créature dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Dans la nature, rien n\'est jamais gaspillé, pas même le cadavre pourrissant d\'un bon à rien de vampire suceur de sang. » —Halana d\'Ulvenwald", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336721&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a720a7d-af6b-4dc8-a2ec-4fa8ec536e60\', \'multiverseId\': 336721}, \'multiverseid\': 336721}, {\'name\': \'Fioritura Macabra\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni carta creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Nulla in natura viene sprecato, neppure il cadavere putrescente di un vampiro buono-a-nulla e succhia-sangue." —Halana di Ulvenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46c0258d-0549-4291-a072-951a7cb55d48\', \'multiverseId\': 337405}, \'multiverseid\': 337405}, {\'name\': \'不気味な開花\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚につきカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自然には無駄になるものなどありません。何の役にも立たない、血に飢えた吸血鬼の腐った死体であろうと。」――ウルヴェンワルドのハラナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4938dbe6-127b-4f58-95f3-8f3b947140af\', \'multiverseId\': 337576}, \'multiverseid\': 337576}, {\'name\': \'죽음에 피는 꽃\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장당 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자연은 저주받을 흡혈귀의 썩어가는 시체조차도 버리지 않는다네." —울벤왈드의 할라나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'575dac43-f0da-403e-967f-5f458a3ba30b\', \'multiverseId\': 336208}, \'multiverseid\': 336208}, {\'name\': \'Florescência Sombria\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada card de criatura em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nada é desperdiçado na natureza, nem mesmo o cadáver putrescente de um vampiro inútil e sanguessuga." — Halana de Ulvenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5147c4a-506a-4546-8192-10f3f7ba3639\', \'multiverseId\': 336550}, \'multiverseid\': 336550}, {\'name\': \'Зловещее Цветение\', \'text\': \'Возьмите одну карту за каждую карту существа на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ничто в природе не пропадает даром — даже гниющий труп никчемного, кровососущего вампира». — Халана из Уленвальда\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b34022e1-17c1-4833-beba-d647e98f83fd\', \'multiverseId\': 336892}, \'multiverseid\': 336892}, {\'name\': \'阴森花开\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张生物牌，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「在大自然中什么都不会浪费掉，就连这些一无是处的吸血鬼腐尸也是一样。」～沃文森的荷拉娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7332e693-a81c-4d31-8c8a-1abeb9d2aa5d\', \'multiverseId\': 336037}, \'multiverseid\': 336037}, {\'name\': \'陰森花開\', \'text\': \'你墳墓場中每有一張生物牌，便抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「在大自然中什麼都不會浪費掉，就連這些一無是處的吸血鬼腐屍也是一樣。」～沃文森的荷拉娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e9d098-74f7-426c-94db-9159b0238b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 336379}, \'multiverseid\': 336379}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Hinterwald\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich mag, was sie mit dem Ort gemacht haben." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701e6d8b-66d8-4c47-9b48-8a0c10fd2bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 337098}, \'multiverseid\': 337098}, {\'name\': \'Montes siniestros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Me encanta lo que hicieron con el lugar." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d687515-c408-440e-a5a5-f55c70fb24f4\', \'multiverseId\': 337269}, \'multiverseid\': 337269}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre forêt sauvage\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« J\'adore ! Auriez-vous le nom de leur jardinier ? » —Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96ed7d60-c7b6-4529-b949-ba94979741ee\', \'multiverseId\': 336756}, \'multiverseid\': 336756}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Orrenda\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi piace come hanno sistemato questo posto." —Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95b7b609-b46e-4f85-94f3-0e1a125fe483\', \'multiverseId\': 337440}, \'multiverseid\': 337440}, {\'name\': \'不気味な辺境林\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「いいね。奴らがこの地にしでかした事は。」――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11dac49e-1955-4a7b-8234-6865532a20ba\', \'multiverseId\': 337611}, \'multiverseid\': 337611}, {\'name\': \'음산한 산간벽지\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'"이곳 참, 멋지게 해놓았군." —릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9ee8bd-dbcc-4e42-9acf-3cafc98fc697\', \'multiverseId\': 336243}, \'multiverseid\': 336243}, {\'name\': \'Mata Sinistra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifique uma criatura: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Gostei da decoração do lugar." — Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6592825d-074f-4575-9c1a-cd0fc0285dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 336585}, \'multiverseid\': 336585}, {\'name\': \'Мрачная Глухомань\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте существо: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Мне нравится, как они здесь все изменили!». — Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'977c8b50-6a00-4310-b7ef-5a12eed8b5ae\', \'multiverseId\': 336927}, \'multiverseid\': 336927}, {\'name\': \'阴森蛮荒林\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{2}{B}{G}，{T}，牺牲一个生物：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我真爱他们对这地方下的功夫。」～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b57f312-d607-4606-ba89-d7874e826c45\', \'multiverseId\': 336072}, \'multiverseid\': 336072}, {\'name\': \'陰森蠻荒林\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{2}{B}{G}，{T}，犧牲一個生物：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我真愛他們對這地方下的功夫。」～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cbd3cd-ad3e-4adb-a26e-e893397d6e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 336414}, \'multiverseid\': 336414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruft des Erzengels\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten bis zum Ende des Zuges Todesberührung und Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Über Jahrhunderte hinweg hielt meine Kreation diese Welt im Gleichgewicht. Doch jetzt ist nur noch ihr Schatten da." —Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86024f90-9754-4b51-b28f-0ecca07818e3\', \'multiverseId\': 337097}, \'multiverseid\': 337097}, {\'name\': \'Bóveda del arcángel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: Las criaturas que controlas ganan las habilidades de toque mortal y vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Por siglos mi creación mantuvo este mundo en equilibrio. Ahora solo queda su sombra." —Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'263eb0c5-b929-4466-9b6d-264293db4c39\', \'multiverseId\': 337268}, \'multiverseid\': 337268}, {\'name\': "Caveau de l\'archange", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le contact mortel et le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Pendant des siècles, ma création a maintenu l\'équilibre de ce monde. Désormais, seule son ombre subsiste. » —Sorin Markov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336755&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a6a365-46c2-493f-9572-c78dcb1cbfdb\', \'multiverseId\': 336755}, \'multiverseid\': 336755}, {\'name\': "Cripta dell\'Arcangelo", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: Le creature che controlli hanno tocco letale e legame vitale fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Per secoli la mia creazione ha mantenuto in equilibrio questo mondo. Ora rimane solo la sua ombra." —Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96dcd1e4-19a9-4c44-89a4-0687c586ed49\', \'multiverseId\': 337439}, \'multiverseid\': 337439}, {\'name\': \'大天使の霊堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで接死と絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「何世紀もの間、我が造物はこの世界の均衡を保ってきた。今では彼女の影が残るのみだ。」――ソリン・マルコフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f2b19ed-971d-4cdd-89e5-5e0f6efc80cf\', \'multiverseId\': 337610}, \'multiverseid\': 337610}, {\'name\': \'대천사의 지하실\', \'text\': \'{T}: {1}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 치명타와 생명연결 능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'"나의 피조물은 몇 백 년 동안 이 세상의 균형을 유지했지만 이제는 그녀의 그림자만이 남아있군." —소린 마르코프\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea080f73-0f55-4317-a4ef-e28adc005dca\', \'multiverseId\': 336242}, \'multiverseid\': 336242}, {\'name\': \'Câmara do Arcanjo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: As criaturas que você controla ganham toque mortífero e vínculo com a vida até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Durante séculos, minha criação manteve este mundo em equilíbrio. Agora, resta apenas sua sombra." — Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89f54577-f179-49e3-864d-2b0f03fdfff2\', \'multiverseId\': 336584}, \'multiverseid\': 336584}, {\'name\': \'Подземелье Архангела\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: существа под вашим контролем получают Смертельное касание и Цепь жизни до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Веками мое творение держало этот мир в равновесии. Теперь от нее осталась лишь тень». — Сорин Марков\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1667628d-67ee-44b7-a3b2-991edf924f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 336926}, \'multiverseid\': 336926}, {\'name\': \'大天使地窖\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{2}{W}{B}，{T}：由你操控的生物获得死触与系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「数百年来，我的造物让这世界保持平衡。现在只剩下她的阴影。」～索霖马可夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2365d28f-5383-450a-85d7-2f5dbec66051\', \'multiverseId\': 336071}, \'multiverseid\': 336071}, {\'name\': \'大天使地窖\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{2}{W}{B}，{T}：由你操控的生物獲得死觸與繫命異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「數百年來，我的造物讓這世界保持平衡。現在只剩下她的陰影。」～索霖馬可夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09ffc08b-ba69-4887-9586-a9f17b2591ff\', \'multiverseId\': 336413}, \'multiverseid\': 336413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hauptmann von Stromkirch\', \'text\': \'Andere Vampir-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir können es nicht länger zulassen, dass unsere menschliche Bevölkerung gedankenlos von Ghulen ermordet wird. Erschlagt alle, die sich nicht dran halten." —Runo Stromkirch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6670c81-cfc6-4a65-ba22-bdd73537d8e6\', \'multiverseId\': 337022}, \'multiverseid\': 337022}, {\'name\': \'Capitán Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nLas otras criaturas Vampiro que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya no podemos permitir que nuestra población humana sea ciegamente masacrada por los necrófagos. Muerte a cualquier intruso." —Runo Stromkirk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baaf01b4-2525-41b0-9b29-cd138d16f5b9\', \'multiverseId\': 337193}, \'multiverseid\': 337193}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine de Stromkirk\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nLes autres créatures Vampire que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous ne pouvons plus laisser nos populations humaines se faire massacrer sans raison par les goules. Tuez tous les intrus. » —Runo de Stromkirk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336680&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b46499-b4a4-44b9-916a-5e0599a84766\', \'multiverseId\': 336680}, \'multiverseid\': 336680}, {\'name\': \'Capitano di Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nLe altre creature Vampiro che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Non possiamo più permettere che le nostre popolazioni umane siano scioccamente massacrate dai ghoul. Uccidete tutti quelli che sconfinano." —Runo Stromkirk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36068284-b619-4097-a586-e119da9f0671\', \'multiverseId\': 337364}, \'multiverseid\': 337364}, {\'name\': \'流城の隊長\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたがコントロールする他の吸血鬼・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの人間どもが、グールによって無為に殺戮されるのはこれ以上見逃せぬ。行きすぎたもの全てを殺せ。」――流城のルノ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a381314c-8983-4e1f-b43a-cb2e3470fdc2\', \'multiverseId\': 337535}, \'multiverseid\': 337535}, {\'name\': \'스트롬커크가의 대장\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 흡혈귀 생물들은 +1/+1을 받고 선제공격 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"정신나간 악귀들이 우리의 인간 수하들을 도륙하는 것을 더이상 보고만 있을 수는 없다. 침입자는 모조리 죽여라." —루노 스트롬커크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1ec8d0-9f33-4a8d-bb2f-ce0e53e27eec\', \'multiverseId\': 336167}, \'multiverseid\': 336167}, {\'name\': \'Capitão Stromkirk\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Vampiro que você controla recebem +1/+1 e têm iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Não podemos mais permitir que nossos povos humanos sejam assassinados implacavelmente pelos carniçais. Matem todos que ousarem invadir." — Runo Stromkirk\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f3a29c2-830a-465b-9316-d494289e783f\', \'multiverseId\': 336509}, \'multiverseid\': 336509}, {\'name\': \'Стромкиркский Капитан\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nДругие существа-Вампиры под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и имеют Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы больше не можем позволять упырям бездумно вырезать наше поголовье людей. Убейте каждого, кто сюда вторгнется». — Руно Стромкирк\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31ed88c3-4d03-4b44-bfe5-e949b3247b71\', \'multiverseId\': 336851}, \'multiverseid\': 336851}, {\'name\': \'溪堡队长\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他吸血鬼生物得+1/+1并具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的人类族群不能再让无心智的食尸鬼随意杀害。擅闯者死。」～卢诺溪堡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59eb0e61-d8c0-4905-8d43-1808c19c76c6\', \'multiverseId\': 335996}, \'multiverseid\': 335996}, {\'name\': \'溪堡隊長\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他吸血鬼生物得+1/+1並具有先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的人類族群不能再讓無心智的食屍鬼隨意殺害。擅闖者死。」～盧諾溪堡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'014c8ad5-d0ce-4262-9e48-4369ac764b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 336338}, \'multiverseid\': 336338}]', "[{'name': 'Heimgesuchtes Sumpfgrab', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{3}, {T}, opfere das Heimgesuchte Sumpfgrab: Bringe eine zufällig bestimmte Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Der Spielplatz der Ghulrufer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336982&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92968354-217a-491b-b37e-6647c1c79275', 'multiverseId': 336982}, 'multiverseid': 336982}, {'name': 'Tumbanegada embrujada', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrificar la Tumbanegada embrujada: Regresa una carta de criatura al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'El jardín de un llamamuertos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337153&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5edbc50a-f987-410c-b3bd-fa124fcdc37d', 'multiverseId': 337153}, 'multiverseid': 337153}, {'name': 'Paludgraf hanté', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paludgraf hanté : Renvoyez une carte de créature au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Le terrain de jeu du meneur de goule.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336640&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae453603-afe0-421c-8ebf-7b4772b6317a', 'multiverseId': 336640}, 'multiverseid': 336640}, {'name': 'Cimitero Palustre Infestato', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifica il Cimitero Palustre Infestato: Riprendi in mano una carta creatura a caso dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Il parco giochi di un evocaghoul.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337324&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c81adaa-67cc-4d9e-af58-72de75144ed7', 'multiverseId': 337324}, 'multiverseid': 337324}, {'name': '憑依された沼墓', 'text': '{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}, 憑依された沼墓を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードを１枚無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'グール呼びの遊び場。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337495&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '580a8075-8d9e-412d-93d1-b8710e2c40e4', 'multiverseId': 337495}, 'multiverseid': 337495}, {'name': '음산한 늪지대 묘지', 'text': '{T}: {1}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n{3}, {T}, 음산한 늪지대 묘지를 희생한다: 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 무작위로 정해서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '악령소환술사의 놀이터라고나 할까.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336127&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05e244cc-810c-4d15-93cf-bb8d22ce3f03', 'multiverseId': 336127}, 'multiverseid': 336127}, {'name': 'Cemitério Pantanoso Assombrado', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifique Cemitério Pantanoso Assombrado: Devolva um card de criatura aleatoriamente de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'O parque de diversões de um carniçal.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336469&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fba125b2-51ba-480b-bc82-d22a44eb9461', 'multiverseId': 336469}, 'multiverseid': 336469}, {'name': 'Болотный Могильник с Призраками', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{3}, {T}, пожертвуйте Болотный Могильник с Призраками: верните случайно выбранную карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Раздолье для призывателей упырей.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336811&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd19b624-85d6-4445-97d8-37c6d96f4efb', 'multiverseId': 336811}, 'multiverseid': 336811}, {'name': '闹鬼沼墓', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。{3}，{T}，牺牲闹鬼沼墓：随机将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '尸鬼牧者的游乐场。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335956&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66e93bd5-cdcb-49c6-8309-3be7a19d1bce', 'multiverseId': 335956}, 'multiverseid': 335956}, {'name': '鬧鬼沼墓', 'text': '{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。\\n{3}，{T}，犧牲鬧鬼沼墓：隨機將一張生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '屍鬼牧者的遊樂場。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336298&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69843525-636b-4ed2-8f1d-445218c3019f', 'multiverseId': 336298}, 'multiverseid': 336298}]", '[{\'name\': \'Henkersmaske\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Einschüchtern. (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)Ausrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee6c1331-2e46-4df1-b8cf-7b2eeec0ab92\', \'multiverseId\': 336970}, \'multiverseid\': 336970}, {\'name\': \'Capucha del verdugo\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de intimidar. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d375a00-8fa4-4b18-983e-41155dd295f5\', \'multiverseId\': 337141}, \'multiverseid\': 337141}, {\'name\': "Cagoule de l\'exécuteur", \'text\': "La créature équipée a l\'intimidation. (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbaabf27-26ce-4fc2-a7b0-9fd70e0e0f0c\', \'multiverseId\': 336628}, \'multiverseid\': 336628}, {\'name\': \'Cappuccio del Carnefice\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha intimidire. (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0be4c9b4-98b3-40ee-a1cd-d20622d5d16e\', \'multiverseId\': 337312}, \'multiverseid\': 337312}, {\'name\': \'処刑人の頭巾\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは威嚇を持つ。（このクリーチャーはアーティファクト・クリーチャーかそれと共通の色を持つクリーチャー以外にはブロックされない。）\\n装備 {2}({2}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d2a098-eba7-40f5-8a4a-efa7e96e86af\', \'multiverseId\': 337483}, \'multiverseid\': 337483}, {\'name\': \'사형집행인의 복면\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 위협 능력을 가진다. (이 생물은 마법물체 생물 및/또는 자신과 색을 공유하는 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.){2} 장착 ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b505cd-b053-43e1-acaa-60a7ea505a64\', \'multiverseId\': 336115}, \'multiverseid\': 336115}, {\'name\': \'Capuz do Executor\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem intimidar. (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilhem uma cor com ela.)\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente quando puder conjurar um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9505cc7-1ade-4faf-93a1-cbeb77b7fde4\', \'multiverseId\': 336457}, \'multiverseid\': 336457}, {\'name\': \'Колпак Палача\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Устрашение. (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактными существами и (или) существами у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него.)\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba888364-1326-4e6e-b317-f58dd7667fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 336799}, \'multiverseid\': 336799}, {\'name\': \'处刑人斗篷\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有威吓异能。（此生物只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）佩带{2}（{2}：装备在由你操控的目标生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f85375-13fe-4a8a-b669-d77fb148aa38\', \'multiverseId\': 335944}, \'multiverseid\': 335944}, {\'name\': \'處刑人斗篷\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有威嚇異能。（此生物只能被神器生物和／或與它有共通顏色的生物阻擋。）佩帶{2}（{2}：裝備在由你操控的目標生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb2d147-64fc-4c9f-8a71-9642e6d8a2b2\', \'multiverseId\': 336286}, \'multiverseid\': 336286}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hochgeborener Ghul\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle Toten hier haben einen leichten Schlaf, so fein ihre Gräber auch sind." —Wulmer der Totengräber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e38f57d-ba78-4186-a4bc-d79716b2b5f6\', \'multiverseId\': 336947}, \'multiverseid\': 336947}, {\'name\': \'Necrófago aristócrata\', \'text\': \'Intimidar. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"El sueño de los muertos es ligero aquí, sin importar lo delicadas que sean sus camas." —Cavatumbas Wulmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3544b1-8505-4ba7-807e-092a0321d729\', \'multiverseId\': 337118}, \'multiverseid\': 337118}, {\'name\': \'Goule patricienne\', \'text\': \'Intimidation (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Ici, les morts ont le sommeil léger, quel que soit le confort de leur lit. » —Fossoyeur de graf Wulmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336605&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e16b94-e604-4116-be1c-318ad868acca\', \'multiverseId\': 336605}, \'multiverseid\': 336605}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul Nobile\', \'text\': \'Intimidire (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti i morti qui hanno il sonno leggero, indipendentemente da quanto possano essere raffinati i loro letti." —Becchino Wulmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba2d2c0-3ad9-4d6d-b77a-f52ed90b4866\', \'multiverseId\': 337289}, \'multiverseid\': 337289}, {\'name\': \'名門のグール\', \'text\': \'威嚇（このクリーチャーはアーティファクト・クリーチャーかこれと共通の色を持つクリーチャー以外にはブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「ここじゃ死者の眠りは浅いんだ。ベッドの贅沢さに関係なくな。」――墓掘りのワルマー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'549a8f79-2720-4272-ae24-7dae577598e2\', \'multiverseId\': 337460}, \'multiverseid\': 337460}, {\'name\': \'고귀한 악귀\', \'text\': \'위협 (이 생물은 마법물체 생물 및/또는 자신과 색을 공유하는 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"무덤이 화려하던 말던, 이곳의 망자들은 오래 쉬는 경우가 없지." —시체도둑 울메르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3734736-f667-4206-be74-9de66bb67b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 336092}, \'multiverseid\': 336092}, {\'name\': \'Carniçal Fidalgo\', \'text\': \'Intimidar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilhem uma cor com ela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos os mortos aqui têm sono leve, independentemente da sofisticação de suas camas." — Wulmer, escavador de túmulos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02774cc8-a9b8-4bdc-98f1-6e7d4cd9a319\', \'multiverseId\': 336434}, \'multiverseid\': 336434}, {\'name\': \'Высокородный Упырь\', \'text\': \'Устрашение (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактными существами и (или) существами, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«Все покойники спят здесь чутко, независимо от мягкости их постели». — раскопщик могильников Вульмер\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc6821e6-15b8-4f09-bc20-f581785880da\', \'multiverseId\': 336776}, \'multiverseid\': 336776}, {\'name\': \'望族食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'威吓（此生物只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「此处亡者都睡得很浅，不论他们的床有多精致。」～挖坟人渥玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ca1a50-00a7-4d87-b319-fdb571054b71\', \'multiverseId\': 335921}, \'multiverseid\': 335921}, {\'name\': \'望族食屍鬼\', \'text\': \'威嚇（此生物只能被神器生物和／或與它有共通顏色的生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「此處亡者都睡得很淺，不論他們的床有多精緻。」～挖墳人渥瑪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b739e201-442a-49d1-9a96-25438a1a91d9\', \'multiverseId\': 336263}, \'multiverseid\': 336263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hunger der Heulerrudels\', \'text\': \'Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nMorbide — Lege stattdessen drei +1/+1-Marken auf diese Kreatur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Werwölfe sind eine unheilige Mischung aus den Instinkten der Raubtiere und dem Hass der Menschen." —Alena, Fallenstellerin aus Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809e14d0-509a-46af-ba6b-474b89300d6f\', \'multiverseId\': 336959}, \'multiverseid\': 336959}, {\'name\': \'Hambre de la jauría aullante\', \'text\': \'Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\nNecrario — En vez de eso, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre esa criatura si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los licántropos son una mezcla maldita de los instintos de un depredador y el odio de un humano." —Alena, trampera de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3b23062-c977-4437-a1c2-139f40548a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 337130}, \'multiverseid\': 337130}, {\'name\': \'Faim de la hurlemeute\', \'text\': \'Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.\\nMorbidité — Mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur cette créature à la place si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les loups-garous sont un mélange malsain d\'instinct de prédateur et de haine humaine. » —Alena, trappeur de Kessig", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579dc7ca-3359-4769-a3d4-c4b2195ae443\', \'multiverseId\': 336617}, \'multiverseid\': 336617}, {\'name\': "Fame dell\'Ulubranco", \'text\': \'Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\nMorboso — Metti invece tre segnalini +1/+1 su quella creatura se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I lupi mannari sono un miscuglio sacrilego dell\\\'istinto di un predatore e dell\\\'odio di un umano." —Alena, trappolatrice del Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc47262-b54a-4f10-94fc-5e6ae7083301\', \'multiverseId\': 337301}, \'multiverseid\': 337301}, {\'name\': \'吠え群れの飢え\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。陰鬱 ― このターンにいずれかのクリーチャーが死亡していた場合、代わりにそのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「狼男ってのは、捕食者の本能と人間の憎悪の邪悪な合いの子ね。」――ケッシグの罠師、アレイナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a2f7e3-c046-4802-968f-b7871debb8a6\', \'multiverseId\': 337472}, \'multiverseid\': 337472}, {\'name\': \'포효떼의 굶주림\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n사망 — 만약 이 턴에 생물이 죽었다면, 대신에 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"늑대인간은 사냥꾼의 본능과 인간의 증오의 추악한 결합체지." —케시그의 덫사냥꾼 알레나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7253d1-c8c4-422f-847d-09af994a07dd\', \'multiverseId\': 336104}, \'multiverseid\': 336104}, {\'name\': \'Fome da Alcateia Uivante\', \'text\': \'Coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre a criatura alvo.\\nMórbido — Se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno, em vez disso, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 sobre aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os lobisomens são a combinação profana do instinto de predador com o ódio humano." — Alena, armadilheira de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'870d6811-18f6-4162-91b8-455573fae35d\', \'multiverseId\': 336446}, \'multiverseid\': 336446}, {\'name\': \'Голод Воющей Стаи\', \'text\': \'Положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.\\nБолезненность — Вместо этого положите на то существо три жетона +1/+1, если в этом ходу умерло существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Вервольфы — это порочная смесь хищнического инстинкта и человеческой ненависти». — Алена, капканщица из Кессига\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ebb1291-7f13-4f39-90b1-565e04e319d0\', \'multiverseId\': 336788}, \'multiverseid\': 336788}, {\'name\': \'嚎群饥欲\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。丧心～如果本回合有生物死去，则改为在该生物上放置三个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「狼人是掠食者本能与人类恨意的邪恶混合。」～凯锡革布陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b1fedd3-5d06-4af2-bc92-deb2ef162435\', \'multiverseId\': 335933}, \'multiverseid\': 335933}, {\'name\': \'嚎群飢欲\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。喪心～如果本回合有生物死去，則改為在該生物上放置三個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「狼人是掠食者本能與人類恨意的邪惡混合。」～凱錫革佈陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7006780b-00cb-4c83-9afe-03f21901654f\', \'multiverseId\': 336275}, \'multiverseid\': 336275}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höllenkerker\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil.\\n{7}, {T}: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil.\\nWenn der Höllenkerker aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe alle Karten, die durch ihn ins Exil geschickt wurden, unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337025&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce977363-07d7-4f0b-a81f-2df0b130c20a\', \'multiverseId\': 337025}, \'multiverseid\': 337025}, {\'name\': \'Helvault\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n{7}, {T}: Exilia la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\nCuando Helvault vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa todas las cartas exiliadas con él al campo de batalla bajo el control de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ddcb95-fd1c-4189-a4df-261ea7985a87\', \'multiverseId\': 337196}, \'multiverseid\': 337196}, {\'name\': \'Helgruft\', \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n{7}, {T} : Exilez une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\nQuand le Helgruft est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous le contrôle de leurs propriétaires, toutes les cartes qu\'il a exilées.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336683&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83680292-98d9-4247-b15f-198e12f3036b\', \'multiverseId\': 336683}, \'multiverseid\': 336683}, {\'name\': \'Tomba Infernale\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n{7}, {T}: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\nQuando la Tomba Infernale viene messa in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia tutte le carte esiliate da essa sotto il controllo dei rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'338f493e-d37f-4165-be8f-2d71414fa180\', \'multiverseId\': 337367}, \'multiverseid\': 337367}, {\'name\': \'獄庫\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。{7}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。獄庫が戦場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、それにより追放されたすべてのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e7dee3e-4415-4c4e-8f2a-ccddf11644b4\', \'multiverseId\': 337538}, \'multiverseid\': 337538}, {\'name\': \'헬볼트\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n{7}, {T}: 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n헬볼트가 전장에서 무덤에 들어갈 때, 헬볼트가 추방한 모든 카드들을 각자 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f18018-00f3-4a15-8799-33fcc09cef55\', \'multiverseId\': 336170}, \'multiverseid\': 336170}, {\'name\': \'Câmara Infernal\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Exile a criatura alvo que você controla.\\n{7}, {T}: Exile a criatura alvo que você não controla.\\nQuando Câmara Infernal for colocada em um cemitério vinda do campo de batalha, devolva todos os cards exilados com ela ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c38e823-60df-4744-8605-035c2a50a764\', \'multiverseId\': 336512}, \'multiverseid\': 336512}, {\'name\': \'Хелволт\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: изгоните целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\n{7}, {T}: изгоните целевое существо не под вашим контролем.\\nКогда Хелволт попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, верните все изгнанные им карты на поле битвы под контролем их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f610bce-9b89-48cd-a554-ff85f90c595a\', \'multiverseId\': 336854}, \'multiverseid\': 336854}, {\'name\': \'狱窖\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：放逐目标由你操控的生物。{7}，{T}：放逐目标不由你操控的生物。当狱窖从战场进入坟墓场时，将所有被它放逐的牌各在其拥有者之操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc0a95b0-137b-4102-a998-3248d0a7f266\', \'multiverseId\': 335999}, \'multiverseid\': 335999}, {\'name\': \'獄窖\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：放逐目標由你操控的生物。{7}，{T}：放逐目標不由你操控的生物。當獄窖從戰場進入墳墓場時，將所有被它放逐的牌各在其擁有者之操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a3ca33-a6fa-488a-b55c-c214b969235f\', \'multiverseId\': 336341}, \'multiverseid\': 336341}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höllenreiter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, fügt der Höllenreiter dem verteidigenden Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'„Hinter dem Unfug jedes Teufels steckt ein Plan eines Dämons." —Rem Karolus, Klinge der Inquisitoren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbfbc12a-c3df-4f8b-b264-b8909898049c\', \'multiverseId\': 336939}, \'multiverseid\': 336939}, {\'name\': \'Jinete infernal\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controles ataque, el Jinete infernal hace 1 punto de daño al jugador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'"Detrás del caos de todo diablo acecha el plan de un demonio." —Rem Karolus, Espada de los Inquisidores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6874a437-423a-4d48-8bed-f5e3f98ae498\', \'multiverseId\': 337110}, \'multiverseid\': 337110}, {\'name\': \'Chevaucheur infernal\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, le Chevaucheur infernal inflige 1 blessure au joueur défenseur.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': "« Le chaos d\'un diable dissimule toujours une machination de démon. » —Rem Karolus, lame des Inquisiteurs", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336597&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c0411c-4018-4e69-a525-2600c00fea46\', \'multiverseId\': 336597}, \'multiverseid\': 336597}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcainferno\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, il Cavalcainferno infligge 1 danno al giocatore in difesa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dietro al caos di ogni diavolo si cela la macchinazione di un demone." —Rem Karolus, Lama degli Inquisitori\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ed99bd-7f71-447e-a955-c4d94d02d1fa\', \'multiverseId\': 337281}, \'multiverseid\': 337281}, {\'name\': \'地獄乗り\', \'text\': \'速攻\\nあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、地獄乗りは防御プレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'「小悪魔の面倒の影には、常に悪魔の計略がある。」――審問官の刃、レム・カロラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e57e1aba-8477-404b-a334-c443d2abc612\', \'multiverseId\': 337452}, \'multiverseid\': 337452}, {\'name\': \'지옥의 기수\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 공격할 때마다, 지옥의 기수는 수비플레이어에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악령\', \'flavor\': \'"모든 악령의 난동 뒤에는 악마의 계획이 있다." —"칼날의 심문관" 렘 카롤러스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2246d0c-8fae-4737-bad4-1b09711a20bd\', \'multiverseId\': 336084}, \'multiverseid\': 336084}, {\'name\': \'Ginete do Inferno\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca, Ginete do Inferno causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': \'"Por trás de toda diabrura há um plano demoníaco." — Rem Karolus, Espadachim dos Inquisidores\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7db9d91-6427-4840-ac32-e4cb4e7d98a2\', \'multiverseId\': 336426}, \'multiverseid\': 336426}, {\'name\': \'Адский Наездник\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nКаждый раз когда существо под вашим контролем атакует, Адский Наездник наносит 1 повреждение защищающемуся игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': \'«За каждой дьявольской смутой скрывается дьявольский план». — Рем Каролус, Клинок Инквизиторов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52bde802-4425-490f-be05-9fa501e99caf\', \'multiverseId\': 336768}, \'multiverseid\': 336768}, {\'name\': \'地狱骑士\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物攻击时，地狱骑士对防御牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'「魔鬼的每项破坏都藏着恶魔的计谋。」～审判官之刃连卡洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d39bbf29-c0ce-49ee-83e6-1c1b80b9f7c2\', \'multiverseId\': 335913}, \'multiverseid\': 335913}, {\'name\': \'地獄騎士\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物攻擊時，地獄騎士對防禦玩家造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「魔鬼的每項破壞都藏著惡魔的計謀。」～審判官之刃連卡洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c7850cf-e977-4659-ba0d-08385e482e04\', \'multiverseId\': 336255}, \'multiverseid\': 336255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hüter der Mauer\', \'text\': \'Der Hüter der Mauer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\nSolange es nicht dein Zug ist, ist der Hüter der Mauer eine 2/3 Gargoyle-Artefaktkreatur mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b19fde7-ac89-40bc-8420-332030d44815\', \'multiverseId\': 336992}, \'multiverseid\': 336992}, {\'name\': \'Protector del muro\', \'text\': \'El Protector del muro entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\nMientras no sea tu turno, el Protector del muro es una criatura artefacto Gárgola 2/3 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddbf3b78-120d-476b-acf5-4cb23085b1fa\', \'multiverseId\': 337163}, \'multiverseid\': 337163}, {\'name\': \'Garde du mur\', \'text\': "Le Garde du mur arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\nTant que ce n\'est pas votre tour, le Garde du mur est une créature-artefact 2/3 Gargouille avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336650&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431dbf81-2777-42cb-85f4-7624641beb81\', \'multiverseId\': 336650}, \'multiverseid\': 336650}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano del Muro\', \'text\': \'Il Guardiano del Muro entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nFintanto che non è il tuo turno, il Guardiano del Muro è una creatura artefatto Gargoyle 2/3 con volare.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0328e04d-f77d-46fb-a787-5b8cc3a5d701\', \'multiverseId\': 337334}, \'multiverseid\': 337334}, {\'name\': \'壁の守部\', \'text\': \'壁の守部はタップ状態で戦場に出る。{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\nあなたのターンでないかぎり、壁の守部は飛行を持つ２/３のガーゴイル・アーティファクト・クリーチャーである。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1831bed6-31ee-454f-8c01-f88788fab913\', \'multiverseId\': 337505}, \'multiverseid\': 337505}, {\'name\': \'성벽의 수호상\', \'text\': \'성벽의 수호상은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {1}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\\n당신의 턴이 아니라면, 성벽의 수호상은 비행 능력을 가진 2/3 마법물체 생물이다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfe501cd-3982-48b5-82f7-0ae644c089e3\', \'multiverseId\': 336137}, \'multiverseid\': 336137}, {\'name\': \'Guardião da Muralha\', \'text\': \'Guardião da Muralha entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\nContanto que não seja o seu turno, Guardião da Muralha será uma criatura artefato 2/3 do tipo Gárgula com voar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51bc5696-5a96-4722-a6f4-740415728ae2\', \'multiverseId\': 336479}, \'multiverseid\': 336479}, {\'name\': \'Страж Стены\', \'text\': \'Страж Стены выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\nПока длится не ваш ход, Страж Стены является артефактным существом-Горгульей 2/3 с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909db4c4-0b43-47cd-8094-e5fef2b0917d\', \'multiverseId\': 336821}, \'multiverseid\': 336821}, {\'name\': \'墙顶护卫\', \'text\': \'墙顶护卫须横置进战场。{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。只要不是在你的回合中，墙顶护卫为2/3，具飞行异能的石像鬼神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88820169-8214-497c-aa5b-2a32f0a37ed6\', \'multiverseId\': 335966}, \'multiverseid\': 335966}, {\'name\': \'牆頂護衛\', \'text\': \'牆頂護衛須橫置進戰場。{T}：加{1}到你的魔法力池中。\\n只要不是在你的回合中，牆頂護衛為2/3，具飛行異能的石像鬼神器生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c2de5d9-a149-4532-ba0a-84c7c95617be\', \'multiverseId\': 336308}, \'multiverseid\': 336308}]', "[{'name': 'Immerwolf', 'text': 'Einschüchtern (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)Andere Wolf- und Werwolf-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nWerwölfe, die du kontrollierst und die keine Menschen sind, können nicht transformieren.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Wolf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337044&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55b76c8c-d031-4fc9-b8d6-99cd859cb3f7', 'multiverseId': 337044}, 'multiverseid': 337044}, {'name': 'Semperlupus', 'text': 'Intimidar. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\\nLas otras criaturas Licántropo y Lobo que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nLos Licántropos que no sean Humanos que controlas no se pueden transformar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lobo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337215&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49693775-9911-4a69-9df2-b15e0aa70791', 'multiverseId': 337215}, 'multiverseid': 337215}, {'name': 'Immerloup', 'text': 'Intimidation (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)\\nLes autres créatures Loup et Loup-garou que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nLes loups-garous non-Humain que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas se transformer.', 'type': 'Créature : loup', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336702&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1c670a6-1bf2-4b7a-b33f-379e6cca8972', 'multiverseId': 336702}, 'multiverseid': 336702}, {'name': 'Immerwolf', 'text': 'Intimidire (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\\nLe altre creature Mannaro e Lupo che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\nI Mannari non Umano che controlli non possono trasformarsi.', 'type': 'Creatura — Lupo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337386&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16ebd748-1d9c-4483-9d1f-c24d1ba7c8fd', 'multiverseId': 337386}, 'multiverseid': 337386}, {'name': '常なる狼', 'text': '威嚇（このクリーチャーはアーティファクト・クリーチャーかこれと共通の色を持つクリーチャー以外にはブロックされない。）あなたがコントロールする他の狼・クリーチャーと狼男・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。あなたがコントロールする人間でない狼男は変身できない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 狼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337557&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f828e4a9-28ab-4680-b074-91e362fc2b11', 'multiverseId': 337557}, 'multiverseid': 337557}, {'name': '영원의 늑대', 'text': '위협 (이 생물은 마법물체 생물 및/또는 자신과 색을 공유하는 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)당신이 조종하는 다른 늑대 및 늑대인간 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물 중 인간이 아닌 늑대인간 생물들은 변신할 수 없다.', 'type': '생물 — 늑대', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336189&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c969f831-f1ba-47a5-aa69-256f565dd11a', 'multiverseId': 336189}, 'multiverseid': 336189}, {'name': 'Lobo Obstinado', 'text': 'Intimidar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilhem uma cor com ela.)\\nAs outras criaturas dos tipos Lobo e Lobisomem que você controla ganham +1/+1.\\nOs Lobisomens que não sejam do tipo Humano que você controla não podem se transformar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lobo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336531&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ee9151a-bf20-465b-a48d-54def985fa58', 'multiverseId': 336531}, 'multiverseid': 336531}, {'name': 'Иммерволк', 'text': 'Устрашение (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактными существами и (или) существами, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него.)\\nДругие существа-Волки и -Вервольфы под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\nНе являющиеся Человеком Вервольфы под вашим контролем не могут трансформироваться.', 'type': 'Существо — Волк', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336873&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '372d7a8e-6a32-4571-bdb5-feedb02c0c9d', 'multiverseId': 336873}, 'multiverseid': 336873}, {'name': '恒狼', 'text': '威吓（此生物只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）由你操控的其他狼生物与狼人生物得+1/+1。由你操控且非人类的狼人不能转化。', 'type': '生物～狼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336018&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37f5c2fd-255f-4855-a0b2-6fc58b45a2d4', 'multiverseId': 336018}, 'multiverseid': 336018}, {'name': '恆狼', 'text': '威嚇（此生物只能被神器生物和／或與它有共通顏色的生物阻擋。）由你操控的其他狼生物與狼人生物得+1/+1。由你操控且非人類的狼人不能轉化。', 'type': '生物～狼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336360&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4bcc17a-e3f0-4cc8-a757-267a106aa11f', 'multiverseId': 336360}, 'multiverseid': 336360}]", '[{\'name\': \'In den Wäldern verloren\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, zeige die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek offen vor. Falls es eine Wald-Karte ist, entferne diese Kreatur aus dem Kampf. Lege dann die vorgezeigte Karte unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e7e93f-8be9-40fd-bb6e-2c4e35eb9b50\', \'multiverseId\': 336953}, \'multiverseid\': 336953}, {\'name\': \'Perdido en el bosque\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura te ataque a ti o a un planeswalker que controles, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de bosque, remueve esa criatura del combate. Luego pon la carta mostrada en el fondo de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ceca720-a482-4686-a245-4fd7441be214\', \'multiverseId\': 337124}, \'multiverseid\': 337124}, {\'name\': \'Perdus dans les bois\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de forêt, retirez cette créature du combat. Mettez ensuite la carte révélée au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336611&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95caf03-20e2-4c17-be25-968b2b45b7cc\', \'multiverseId\': 336611}, \'multiverseid\': 336611}, {\'name\': \'Perso nei Boschi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta Foresta, rimuovi quella creatura dal combattimento. Poi metti la carta rivelata in fondo al tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'130f7157-e360-44b5-946d-ec761b5a53c2\', \'multiverseId\': 337295}, \'multiverseid\': 337295}, {\'name\': \'森での迷子\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体、あなたかあなたがコントロールするプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それが森カードである場合、そのクリーチャーを戦闘から取り除く。その後、その公開したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e45887-ba92-434e-bbf4-04d51bf734e3\', \'multiverseId\': 337466}, \'multiverseid\': 337466}, {\'name\': \'숲 속에서 길을 잃다\', \'text\': \'생물이 당신이나 당신이 조종하는 플레인즈워커를 공격할 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 만약 그 카드가 숲이라면, 그 생물을 전투에서 제거한 후 공개된 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7bca0cc-b79c-4f62-92e5-b8e2deed7e78\', \'multiverseId\': 336098}, \'multiverseid\': 336098}, {\'name\': \'Perdidos no Bosque\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura atacar você ou um planeswalker que você controla, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de Floresta, remova aquela criatura do combate. Depois, coloque o card revelado no fundo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570f45c1-b0c3-4e28-b490-863b95c97958\', \'multiverseId\': 336440}, \'multiverseid\': 336440}, {\'name\': \'Сгинуть в Лесу\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда существо атакует вас или planeswalker-а под вашим контролем, покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта Леса, удалите то существо из боя. Затем положите показанную карту в низ вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f54efa54-1c87-42c4-a9b9-8b4be56b7179\', \'multiverseId\': 336782}, \'multiverseid\': 336782}, {\'name\': \'林间迷途\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物攻击你或由你操控的某个鹏洛客时，展示你的牌库顶牌。如果该牌是树林牌，将该生物移出战斗。然后将所展示的牌置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58eb9a61-5299-4102-bd9a-50350c103323\', \'multiverseId\': 335927}, \'multiverseid\': 335927}, {\'name\': \'林間迷途\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物攻擊你或由你操控的某個鵬洛客時，展示你的牌庫頂牌。如果該牌是樹林牌，將該生物移出戰鬥。然後將所展示的牌置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e14c359-5bfb-487a-bed7-1e6e2c27976b\', \'multiverseId\': 336269}, \'multiverseid\': 336269}]', '[{\'name\': \'Inquisitor von Ellgau\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung (Schaden, der von dieser Kreatur zugefügt wird, lässt dich ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)Wenn der Inquisitor von Ellgau stirbt, bringe einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Stahl alleine reicht nicht, um die Welt vom Bösen zu befreien."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e966b7-bce9-4f0c-bc88-9e58c5830270\', \'multiverseId\': 336980}, \'multiverseid\': 336980}, {\'name\': \'Inquisidor de Elgaud\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital. (El daño hecho por esta criatura también hace que ganes esa misma cantidad de vidas.)Cuando el Inquisidor de Elgaud muera, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Hace falta algo más que acero para purgar el mal de este mundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6d3c31-18e7-4576-adb8-008fe70821e6\', \'multiverseId\': 337151}, \'multiverseid\': 337151}, {\'name\': "Inquisiteur d\'Elgaud", \'text\': "Lien de vie (Les blessures infligées par cette créature vous font aussi gagner autant de points de vie.)\\nQuand l\'Inquisiteur d\'Elgaud meurt, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« L\'acier à lui-seul ne suffira pas pour purger ce monde du mal. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336638&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'904515fc-c93e-4c64-87b9-a7ad2a1b801c\', \'multiverseId\': 336638}, \'multiverseid\': 336638}, {\'name\': \'Inquisitore di Elgaud\', \'text\': "Legame vitale (Il danno inflitto da questa creatura ti fa anche guadagnare altrettanti punti vita.)\\nQuando l\'Inquisitore di Elgaud muore, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci vorrà ben più del semplice acciaio per liberare questo mondo dal male."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d58db54-a606-447b-bdcc-b2e23dbdee30\', \'multiverseId\': 337322}, \'multiverseid\': 337322}, {\'name\': \'エルゴードの審問官\', \'text\': \'絆魂（このクリーチャーがダメージを与える場合、さらにあなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）エルゴードの審問官が死亡したとき、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界の邪悪を粛正するには、鋼だけでは足りはしない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb321cda-359a-4c88-a25b-4c42011e0bb7\', \'multiverseId\': 337493}, \'multiverseid\': 337493}, {\'name\': \'엘고드 이단심문관\', \'text\': \'생명연결 (이 생물이 피해를 입히면, 이 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)엘고드 이단심문관이 죽을 때, 비행 능력을 가진 1/1 백색 신령 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"창칼만으로 이 세상의 악을 제거할 수는 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6efd604c-c1f8-45f5-8696-fe5a3429cc12\', \'multiverseId\': 336125}, \'multiverseid\': 336125}, {\'name\': \'Inquisidor de Elgaud\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida (O dano causado por esta criatura faz com que você ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)Quando Inquisidor de Elgaud morrer, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Será necessário muito mais do que o poder do aço para expurgar o mal deste mundo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d68f4feb-1576-4690-ab3c-666e6adb9367\', \'multiverseId\': 336467}, \'multiverseid\': 336467}, {\'name\': \'Элгодский Инквизитор\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни (Повреждения, наносимые этим существом, также заставляют вас получить такое же количество жизней.)\\nКогда Элгодский Инквизитор умирает, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Дух с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Одной стали будет недостаточно, чтобы очистить этот мир от зла».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad23908-3dde-4944-bb5b-e243ea8c12fb\', \'multiverseId\': 336809}, \'multiverseid\': 336809}, {\'name\': \'艾尔告审判官\', \'text\': \'系命（此生物所造成的伤害会让你获得等量的生命。）当艾尔告审判官死去时，将一个1/1白色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「要涤净这邪恶世界，光靠钢铁是不够的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ac7c629-a829-43e3-81cb-33cf8e131a93\', \'multiverseId\': 335954}, \'multiverseid\': 335954}, {\'name\': \'艾爾告審判官\', \'text\': \'繫命（此生物所造成的傷害會讓你獲得等量的生命。）當艾爾告審判官死去時，將一個1/1白色，具飛行異能的精靈衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「要滌淨這邪惡世界，光靠鋼鐵是不夠的。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65910048-02ea-4dfe-9b15-b1c119d52523\', \'multiverseId\': 336296}, \'multiverseid\': 336296}]', "[{'name': 'Instinkte des Spurensuchers', 'text': 'Decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm eine Kreaturenkarte davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest der Karten auf deinen Friedhof.\\nRückblende {2}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336987&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8b9aa95-cad8-4308-903c-88026a266df0', 'multiverseId': 336987}, 'multiverseid': 336987}, {'name': 'Instintos del rastreador', 'text': 'Muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon en tu mano una carta de criatura que se encuentre entre ellas y pon el resto en tu cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337158&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92c04323-c292-4f15-9276-06a006a8f740', 'multiverseId': 337158}, 'multiverseid': 337158}, {'name': 'Instincts du traqueur', 'text': 'Révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez une carte de créature parmi elles dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336645&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00cae859-f5d3-4d08-9dde-de4e6ecacb27', 'multiverseId': 336645}, 'multiverseid': 336645}, {'name': 'Istinto del Battipista', 'text': 'Rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano una carta creatura tra quelle rivelate e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337329&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e7825ea-6adc-4488-8bdb-6fee3a5ce8ce', 'multiverseId': 337329}, 'multiverseid': 337329}, {'name': '追跡者の本能', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを公開する。それらの中からクリーチャー・カードを１枚あなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。フラッシュバック {2}{U} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337500&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '471b1e07-e4cc-4b13-85f9-a59f623e0629', 'multiverseId': 337500}, 'multiverseid': 337500}, {'name': '추적꾼의 본능', 'text': '당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 공개한다. 그 중에서 생물 카드 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n회상 {2}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336132&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b2cbfe4-1881-491d-aee1-217dbd29df76', 'multiverseId': 336132}, 'multiverseid': 336132}, {'name': 'Instinto de Rastreador', 'text': 'Revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um card de criatura dentre eles na sua mão e o restante no seu cemitério.\\nRecapitular {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336474&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '608bf5d7-6b95-487a-9f01-aa8525054c83', 'multiverseId': 336474}, 'multiverseid': 336474}, {'name': 'Инстинкты Охотника', 'text': 'Покажите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну находящуюся среди них карту существа в вашу руку, а остальные — на ваше кладбище.\\nВоспоминание {2}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336816&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40e2f9cc-566a-4736-9413-6819bfb44eff', 'multiverseId': 336816}, 'multiverseid': 336816}, {'name': '追猎者直觉', 'text': '展示你牌库顶的四张牌。将其中的一张生物牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。\\n返照{2}{U} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335961&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e47ecb7f-8839-44e7-8a16-1fb28cd0c08d', 'multiverseId': 335961}, 'multiverseid': 335961}, {'name': '追獵者直覺', 'text': '展示你牌庫頂的四張牌。將其中的一張生物牌置於你手上，其餘則置入你的墳墓場。\\n返照{2}{U}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336303&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1d44ab3-8e63-46ab-8c0d-4ff7d91d8c9c', 'multiverseId': 336303}, 'multiverseid': 336303}]", "[{'name': 'Irrer Ausgestoßener', 'text': '{1}{G}, opfere einen Menschen: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber', 'flavor': 'Er wurde aus seinem Dorf ausgeschlossen und nimmt nun grausame Rache an Flüchtlingen, die in seinem Wald Schutz suchen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336999&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e0a794d-3b5c-45bb-bfb5-aedfc46b4d71', 'multiverseId': 336999}, 'multiverseid': 336999}, {'name': 'Paria desquiciado', 'text': '{1}{G}, sacrificar un Humano: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón humano', 'flavor': 'Expulsado de su aldea, ahora se venga de los que buscan refugio en su bosque.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337170&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56879f6f-5053-4fd2-aac5-52ce07cdb728', 'multiverseId': 337170}, 'multiverseid': 337170}, {'name': 'Proscrit dément', 'text': '{1}{G}, sacrifiez un humain : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et gredin', 'flavor': 'Chassé de son village, il se venge sur les réfugiés qui cherchent un abri dans sa forêt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336657&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfc5646d-7e0d-4926-990d-c803114e964c', 'multiverseId': 336657}, 'multiverseid': 336657}, {'name': 'Reietto Impazzito', 'text': '{1}{G}, Sacrifica un Umano: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Farabutto Umano', 'flavor': 'Bandito dal suo villaggio, ora si scatena contro i rifugiati che cercano riparo nella sua foresta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337341&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '417cd6c3-b142-44b0-adbf-6db0fd9a094e', 'multiverseId': 337341}, 'multiverseid': 337341}, {'name': '錯乱したのけ者', 'text': '{1}{G}, 人間を１体生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者', 'flavor': '村から追い出された彼は、森に避難する難民に対して残忍な敵意を向けている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337512&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc479991-005a-417a-bf1a-7d3dab396cc5', 'multiverseId': 337512}, 'multiverseid': 337512}, {'name': '추방된 미치광이', 'text': '{1}{G}, 인간 지속물 한 개를 희생한다: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 도적', 'flavor': '마을에서 쫓겨난 후로 그는 자신의 숲에 몸을 의탁하는 자들을 해치고 산다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336144&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5409a72-d3c7-43cb-93e9-a0c182f4243f', 'multiverseId': 336144}, 'multiverseid': 336144}, {'name': 'Pária Ensandecido', 'text': '{1}{G}, Sacrifique um Humano: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Ladino', 'flavor': 'Expulso pela sua aldeia, ele agora se sente muito ofendido quando um refugiado procura abrigo na sua floresta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336486&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a83ec76-b77f-4f45-83bd-b84a06159463', 'multiverseId': 336486}, 'multiverseid': 336486}, {'name': 'Душевнобольной Изгой', 'text': '{1}{G}, пожертвуйте Человека: положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Бродяга', 'flavor': 'Изгнанный односельчанами, он теперь страшно обижается на беженцев, которые ищут убежища в его лесу.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336828&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3af7c90d-f140-4967-a9bd-82ba5e72e550', 'multiverseId': 336828}, 'multiverseid': 336828}, {'name': '狂乱遭逐人', 'text': '{1}{G}，牺牲一个人类：在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～人类／浪客', 'flavor': '他曾被逐出自己的村子，如今残酷袭击那些到他树林栖身的逃难者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335973&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed89b335-a7a0-455b-b6a8-bf71ae9ba708', 'multiverseId': 335973}, 'multiverseid': 335973}, {'name': '狂亂遭逐人', 'text': '{1}{G}，犧牲一個人類：在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物～人類／浪客', 'flavor': '他曾被逐出自己的村子，如今殘酷襲擊那些到他樹林棲身的逃難者。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336315&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6518fb7-48a0-4a97-84aa-d5d659a748f7', 'multiverseId': 336315}, 'multiverseid': 336315}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jagdmeister vom Kahlenberg // Verwüster vom Kahlenberg\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn diese Kreatur in den Verwüster vom Kahlenberg transformiert, fügt sie einem Gegner deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte und bis zu einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Verwüster vom Kahlenberg, falls ein Spieler im letzten Zug zwei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Werwolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Verwüster vom Kahlenberg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661c5217-6f50-4f72-a772-b2a844686d70\', \'multiverseId\': 337092}, \'multiverseid\': 337092}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de caza de las colinas // Devastador de las colinas\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que esta criatura se transforme en el Devastador de las colinas, le hace 2 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo y 2 puntos de daño a hasta una criatura objetivo que controle ese jugador.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si un jugador lanzó dos o más hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Devastador de las colinas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Devastador de las colinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddb9169-3054-4da6-b69a-a1e923bf2fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 337263}, \'multiverseid\': 337263}, {\'name\': \'Maître-chasseur de la lande // Ravageur de la lande\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que cette créature se transforme en Ravageur de la lande, elle inflige 2 blessures à un adversaire ciblé et 2 blessures à jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si un joueur a lancé au moins deux sorts au tour précédent, transformez le Ravageur de la lande.", \'type\': \'Créature : - loup-garou\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Ravageur de la lande\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da696bb-f8d2-4191-aaf7-168dd055fca1\', \'multiverseId\': 336750}, \'multiverseid\': 336750}, {\'name\': \'Capocaccia delle Colline // Devastatore delle Colline\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta questa creatura si trasforma nel Devastatore delle Colline, infligge 2 danni a un avversario bersaglio e 2 danni a fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno un giocatore ha lanciato due o più magie, trasforma il Devastatore delle Colline.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Devastatore delle Colline\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d36f2b-381c-4d25-9798-a699c1251c45\', \'multiverseId\': 337434}, \'multiverseid\': 337434}, {\'name\': \'高原の狩りの達人 // 高原の荒廃者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nこのクリーチャーが高原の荒廃者に変身するたび、対戦相手１人を対象とし、そのプレイヤーがコントロールするクリーチャーを最大１体まで対象とする。高原の荒廃者はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与え、そのクリーチャーに２点のダメージを与える。各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンにいずれかのプレイヤーが２つ以上の呪文を唱えていた場合、高原の荒廃者を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー ― - 狼男\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'高原の荒廃者\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15eec5d1-6482-4d5e-ad0b-f5a0a78b2d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 337605}, \'multiverseid\': 337605}, {\'name\': \'산지의 사냥꾼 // 산지의 유린자\', \'text\': \'이 생물이 산지의 유린자로 변신할 때마다, 상대 한 명과 그 상대가 조종하는 생물을 최대 한 개까지 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 상대와 그 생물에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 한 플레이어가 지난 턴에 두 개 이상의 주문을 발동했다면, 산지의 유린자를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'산지의 유린자\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf5e0145-f2b3-4411-bf20-57d053baefeb\', \'multiverseId\': 336237}, \'multiverseid\': 336237}, {\'name\': \'Mestre de Caça da Derrubada // Devastador da Derrubada\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que esta criatura se transforma em Devastador da Derrubada, ela causa 2 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo e 2 pontos de dano a até uma criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se um jogador tiver conjurado duas ou mais mágicas no último turno, transforme Devastador da Derrubada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Devastador da Derrubada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847324a5-6cc7-44da-849f-a01305db6aff\', \'multiverseId\': 336579}, \'multiverseid\': 336579}, {\'name\': \'Ловчий Каменистых Холмов // Опустошитель Каменистых Холмов\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз когда это существо трансформируется в Опустошителя Каменистых Холмов, оно наносит 2 повреждения целевому оппоненту и 2 повреждения — не более чем одному целевому существу под контролем того игрока.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу игрок разыграл не менее двух заклинаний, трансформируйте Опустошителя Каменистых Холмов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вервольф\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Опустошитель Каменистых Холмов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d7ba2c-0b79-4a4d-82a3-6268aa87838a\', \'multiverseId\': 336921}, \'multiverseid\': 336921}, {\'name\': \'堕者猎师 // 堕者噬兽\', \'text\': \'每当此生物转化为堕者噬兽时，它向目标对手造成2点伤害，并对至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物造成2点伤害。在每个维持开始时，若某牌手上回合施放了两个或更多咒语，转化堕者噬兽。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'堕者噬兽\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c905db-967b-46ad-a0cf-bb9975ec35a2\', \'multiverseId\': 336066}, \'multiverseid\': 336066}, {\'name\': \'墮者獵師 // 墮者噬獸\', \'text\': \'每當此生物轉化為墮者噬獸時，它向目標對手造成2點傷害，並對至多一個目標由該玩家操控的生物造成2點傷害。在每個維持開始時，若某玩家上回合施放了兩個或更多咒語，轉化墮者噬獸。\', \'type\': \'生物～ - 狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'墮者噬獸\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2c7e825-901c-4de1-9140-2902fe3c0d71\', \'multiverseId\': 336408}, \'multiverseid\': 336408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagdmeister vom Kahlenberg // Verwüster vom Kahlenberg\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt oder in den Jagdmeister vom Kahlenberg transformiert, bringst du einen 2/2 grünen Wolf-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel und erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nTransformiere zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments den Jagdmeister vom Kahlenberg, falls im letzten Zug keine Zaubersprüche gewirkt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Werwolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Jagdmeister vom Kahlenberg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'661c5217-6f50-4f72-a772-b2a844686d70\', \'multiverseId\': 337092}, \'multiverseid\': 337092}, {\'name\': \'Maestro de caza de las colinas // Devastador de las colinas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que esta criatura entre al campo de batalla o se transforme en el Maestro de caza de las colinas, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Lobo verde 2/2 y gana 2 vidas.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, si no se lanzaron hechizos en el último turno, transforma al Maestro de caza de las colinas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Licántropo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Maestro de caza de las colinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddb9169-3054-4da6-b69a-a1e923bf2fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 337263}, \'multiverseid\': 337263}, {\'name\': \'Maître-chasseur de la lande // Ravageur de la lande\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'elle se transforme en Maître-chasseur de la lande, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Loup et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, si aucun sort n\'a été lancé au tour précédent, transformez le Maître-chasseur de la lande.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et loup-garou\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Maître-chasseur de la lande\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336750&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da696bb-f8d2-4191-aaf7-168dd055fca1\', \'multiverseId\': 336750}, \'multiverseid\': 336750}, {\'name\': \'Capocaccia delle Colline // Devastatore delle Colline\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia o si trasforma nel Capocaccia delle Colline, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Lupo 2/2 verde e guadagni 2 punti vita.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, se nell\'ultimo turno non sono state lanciate magie, trasforma il Capocaccia delle Colline.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mannaro Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Capocaccia delle Colline\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d36f2b-381c-4d25-9798-a699c1251c45\', \'multiverseId\': 337434}, \'multiverseid\': 337434}, {\'name\': \'高原の狩りの達人 // 高原の荒廃者\', \'text\': \'このクリーチャーが戦場に出るか高原の狩りの達人に変身するたび、緑の２/２の狼・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出し、あなたは２点のライフを得る。各アップキープの開始時に、直前のターンに呪文が唱えられていなかった場合、高原の狩りの達人を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狼男\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'高原の狩りの達人\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15eec5d1-6482-4d5e-ad0b-f5a0a78b2d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 337605}, \'multiverseid\': 337605}, {\'name\': \'산지의 사냥꾼 // 산지의 유린자\', \'text\': \'이 생물이 전장에 들어오거나 산지의 사냥꾼으로 변신할 때마다, 2/2 녹색 늑대 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는고 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.\\n각 유지단 시작에, 만약 지난 턴에 아무 주문도 발동되지 않았다면, 산지의 사냥꾼을 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 늑대인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'산지의 사냥꾼\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf5e0145-f2b3-4411-bf20-57d053baefeb\', \'multiverseId\': 336237}, \'multiverseid\': 336237}, {\'name\': \'Mestre de Caça da Derrubada // Devastador da Derrubada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que esta criatura entra no campo de batalha ou se transforma em Mestre de Caça da Derrubada, você coloca no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Lobo e ganha 2 pontos de vida.\\nNo início de cada manutenção, se nenhuma mágica tiver sido conjurada no último turno, transforme Mestre de Caça da Derrubada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Lobisomem\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Mestre de Caça da Derrubada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'847324a5-6cc7-44da-849f-a01305db6aff\', \'multiverseId\': 336579}, \'multiverseid\': 336579}, {\'name\': \'Ловчий Каменистых Холмов // Опустошитель Каменистых Холмов\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда это существо выходит на поле битвы или трансформируется в Ловчего Каменистых Холмов, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 2/2 зеленый Волк, и вы получаете 2 жизни.\\nВ начале каждого шага поддержки, если в предыдущем ходу не было разыграно ни одного заклинания, трансформируйте Ловчего Каменистых Холмов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Вервольф\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'Ловчий Каменистых Холмов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d7ba2c-0b79-4a4d-82a3-6268aa87838a\', \'multiverseId\': 336921}, \'multiverseid\': 336921}, {\'name\': \'堕者猎师 // 堕者噬兽\', \'text\': \'每当此生物进战场或转化为堕者猎师时，将一个2/2绿色狼衍生生物放进战场，且你获得2点生命。在每个维持开始时，若上回合没有任一咒语施放过，转化堕者猎师。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'堕者猎师\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c905db-967b-46ad-a0cf-bb9975ec35a2\', \'multiverseId\': 336066}, \'multiverseid\': 336066}, {\'name\': \'墮者獵師 // 墮者噬獸\', \'text\': \'每當此生物進戰場或轉化為墮者獵師時，將一個2/2綠色狼衍生生物放進戰場，且你獲得2點生命。在每個維持開始時，若上回合沒有任一咒語施放過，轉化墮者獵師。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／狼人\', \'flavor\': None, \'faceName\': \'墮者獵師\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2c7e825-901c-4de1-9140-2902fe3c0d71\', \'multiverseId\': 336408}, \'multiverseid\': 336408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jungwolf\', \'text\': \'Unverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'Im Ulvenwald gibt es keine Ausnahmen für Nachwuchs. Entweder bist du bald ein Jäger oder bald ein Gejagter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fbc32d5-76c6-4a30-8515-488b65be59ab\', \'multiverseId\': 337089}, \'multiverseid\': 337089}, {\'name\': \'Lobo joven\', \'text\': \'Resiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'En Ulvenwald no hay concesiones a los jóvenes. Los cachorros de hoy son los cazadores o el almuerzo de mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fbc525e-70ba-47f5-95f5-dc11b25c3ff8\', \'multiverseId\': 337260}, \'multiverseid\': 337260}, {\'name\': \'Louveteau\', \'text\': "Survivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ulvenwald ne fait aucun cas de la jeunesse. Le nouveau-né d\'aujourd\'hui sera le chasseur ou le diner de demain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede927b0-15f5-4a74-831e-e6a4d0d94498\', \'multiverseId\': 336747}, \'multiverseid\': 336747}, {\'name\': \'Giovane Lupo\', \'text\': \'Immortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': "L\'Ulvenwald non si dimostra indulgente con i giovani. Un neonato di oggi è un cacciatore di domani o il pasto di domani.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'970b164a-58ad-4722-a84a-9c05718cbb03\', \'multiverseId\': 337431}, \'multiverseid\': 337431}, {\'name\': \'若き狼\', \'text\': \'不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'ウルヴェンワルドは若者に容赦しない。今日では、新たに生まれたものは、次の日には狩人か昼飯かのどちらかになる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40746f9e-47bb-4d1d-bbd6-b8ee5d0d17cc\', \'multiverseId\': 337602}, \'multiverseid\': 337602}, {\'name\': \'어린 늑대\', \'text\': \'불사 (이 생물이 죽을 때, 만약 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 올라가있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 +1/+1 카운터 한 개가 올라간 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': \'울벤왈드는 젊다고 봐주는 곳이 아니다. 오늘의 신생아는 내일의 사냥꾼이 되거나 내일의 점심 식사가 된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d687660-103e-4d22-8010-da5518486283\', \'multiverseId\': 336234}, \'multiverseid\': 336234}, {\'name\': \'Lobo Jovem\', \'text\': \'Imortal (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'Os Ulvenwald não dão desconto aos jovens. O recém-nascido de hoje é o caçador ou o almoço de amanhã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32b85610-0d86-4934-abeb-7bf4c07654f5\', \'multiverseId\': 336576}, \'multiverseid\': 336576}, {\'name\': \'Молодой Волк\', \'text\': \'Нетленность (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': \'Уленвальд не делает поблажек молодняку. Рожденный сегодня завтра становится либо охотником, либо обедом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bbd2095-6cf6-4bce-96e5-9ef76ad82d5c\', \'multiverseId\': 336918}, \'multiverseid\': 336918}, {\'name\': \'幼狼\', \'text\': \'不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下返回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'沃文森没有幼小者容身之地。今日的新生儿若非明日的猎人，就是明日的午餐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd1393b6-d010-4eb6-a48a-b9db4f83e6fe\', \'multiverseId\': 336063}, \'multiverseid\': 336063}, {\'name\': \'幼狼\', \'text\': \'不息（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有+1/+1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下返回戰場，且其上有一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': \'沃文森沒有幼小者容身之地。今日的新生兒若非明日的獵人，就是明日的午餐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f66e9c-5407-49da-8525-cf9b7efba2e7\', \'multiverseId\': 336405}, \'multiverseid\': 336405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampf der Alphatiere\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, fügt jeder anderen Kreatur, die dieser Spieler kontrolliert, so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie ihre Stärke beträgt, dann fügt jede dieser Kreaturen der gewählten Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alphatiere müssen sich bei jedem Vollmond neu beweisen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d6faf17-73a4-4901-a00e-8041071d8661\', \'multiverseId\': 337008}, \'multiverseid\': 337008}, {\'name\': \'Lucha de alfas\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controla un oponente le hace daño igual a su fuerza a cada otra criatura que controla ese jugador, luego cada una de esas criaturas le hace daño igual a su fuerza a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Ser un alfa significa probarlo cada luna llena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1005b1d7-120c-4a4a-af13-75786e814f97\', \'multiverseId\': 337179}, \'multiverseid\': 337179}, {\'name\': "Combat d\'alphas", \'text\': "Une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à chaque autre créature que ce joueur contrôle, puis chacune de ces créatures inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à cette créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Un alpha doit prouver son statut à chaque pleine lune.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0669d892-d744-4404-a5d5-e10a9bd3f837\', \'multiverseId\': 336666}, \'multiverseid\': 336666}, {\'name\': "Rissa dell\'Alfa", \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario infligge danno pari alla propria forza a ogni altra creatura controllata da quel giocatore, poi ognuna di quelle creature infligge a quella creatura danno pari alla propria forza.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Essere un esemplare alfa significa dimostrarlo ad ogni luna piena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f69987d5-bd59-4632-95c9-bdda6d164a40\', \'multiverseId\': 337350}, \'multiverseid\': 337350}, {\'name\': \'頭目の乱闘\', \'text\': \'いずれかの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それは自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを、そのプレイヤーがコントロールする他の各クリーチャーにそれぞれ与え、その後それらの各クリーチャーは、それぞれのパワーに等しい点数のダメージをそのクリーチャーに与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'頭目であることは、満月のたびにそれを証明しなければいけないことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85c0c0eb-df5c-474d-9075-a2b1e3c08e10\', \'multiverseId\': 337521}, \'multiverseid\': 337521}, {\'name\': \'우두머리의 난투극\', \'text\': \'상대가 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 그 플레이어가 조종하는 다른 생물들에게 자신의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입히고, 이렇게 피해를 입은 생물들은 그 생물에게 각자의 공격력만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'우두머리로 있으려면 보름달이 뜰 때마다 그럴 자격이 있음을 증명해야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'370bd7c9-6c7a-409c-b3f7-f81557f97637\', \'multiverseId\': 336153}, \'multiverseid\': 336153}, {\'name\': \'Disputa de Alfa\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que um oponente controla causa dano igual ao seu poder a cada outra criatura que aquele jogador controla, depois, cada uma daquelas criaturas causa dano igual ao seu poder àquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ser um alfa significa provar isso a cada lua cheia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8add75-4a69-4873-afff-4889c387c4f6\', \'multiverseId\': 336495}, \'multiverseid\': 336495}, {\'name\': \'Схватка Вожаков\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под контролем оппонента наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, каждому другому существу под контролем того игрока, затем каждое из тех существ наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, тому существу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Быть вожаком означает доказывать это в каждое полнолуние.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9d9b9b-93cb-4789-a040-0282262388ec\', \'multiverseId\': 336837}, \'multiverseid\': 336837}, {\'name\': \'首领争斗\', \'text\': \'目标由对手操控的生物对每个由该牌手操控的其他生物各造成等同于前者力量的伤害，然后这些生物各对前者造成等同于后者力量的伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'身为首领，代表着每次满月都要证明自己能耐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'372ba2c0-b38c-45fc-8a46-21e0e50d6e4e\', \'multiverseId\': 335982}, \'multiverseid\': 335982}, {\'name\': \'首領爭鬥\', \'text\': \'目標由對手操控的生物對每個由該玩家操控的其他生物各造成等同於前者力量的傷害，然後這些生物各對前者造成等同於後者力量的傷害。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'身為首領，代表著每次滿月都要證明自己能耐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebc0afab-3de1-4158-92d4-8ae01992c8fe\', \'multiverseId\': 336324}, \'multiverseid\': 336324}]', '[{\'name\': \'Katze des Heiligtums\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'Katzen schleichen durch die Gänge von Avacyns Kirchen und suchen nach Teufeln und den Anzeichen ihrer Untaten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeb73da4-72d3-4f67-860d-b779c37f38b4\', \'multiverseId\': 337082}, \'multiverseid\': 337082}, {\'name\': \'Gato del santuario\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Los gatos rondan los corredores de las iglesias de Avacyn en busca de diablos o señales de sus diabluras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8645188a-7f8e-46d5-8e99-f0f239698b6c\', \'multiverseId\': 337253}, \'multiverseid\': 337253}, {\'name\': \'Chat du sanctuaire\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "Les chats arpentent les corridors des églises d\'Avacyn à la recherche de diables ou de signes de leurs activités néfastes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57677012-da77-40ff-abd5-f5919d696965\', \'multiverseId\': 336740}, \'multiverseid\': 336740}, {\'name\': \'Gatto del Santuario\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'I gatti si aggirano nei corridoi delle chiese di Avacyn in cerca di diavoli o segni dei loro misfatti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aa75531-a21e-4cc7-ace5-7860e2fc8c20\', \'multiverseId\': 337424}, \'multiverseid\': 337424}, {\'name\': \'聖所の猫\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'猫どもは、小悪魔やその悪戯の徴候を探してアヴァシン教会の廊下を行き来する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2f7644-e5b9-4fd1-812e-68ed5d4b60b5\', \'multiverseId\': 337595}, \'multiverseid\': 337595}, {\'name\': \'성소 고양이\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'아바신의 교회에는 악령이나 악령의 흔적을 수색하는 고양이들이 자주 보인다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c267617c-cafb-41ff-af5d-399db0a0fcdc\', \'multiverseId\': 336227}, \'multiverseid\': 336227}, {\'name\': \'Gato de Santuário\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'Os gatos rondam os corredores das igrejas de Avacyn em busca de diabos ou sinais de suas diabruras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892d3175-adf5-4245-b42a-379d4ad314f0\', \'multiverseId\': 336569}, \'multiverseid\': 336569}, {\'name\': \'Кошка из Святилища\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'В церквях Авацины по коридорам бродят кошки — они ищут дьяволов или следы их бесчинств.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd7cef08-214e-4336-8ab3-e2f76b384c00\', \'multiverseId\': 336911}, \'multiverseid\': 336911}, {\'name\': \'圣堂猫\', \'type\': \'生物～猫\', \'flavor\': \'猫在艾维欣教会回廊梭巡，搜寻魔鬼或其胡闹的迹象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de6cde1-aa5d-4fd6-816c-f2e97b4a2787\', \'multiverseId\': 336056}, \'multiverseid\': 336056}, {\'name\': \'聖堂貓\', \'type\': \'生物～貓\', \'flavor\': \'貓在艾維欣教會迴廊梭巡，搜尋魔鬼或其胡鬧的跡象。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129a74a5-b6aa-4384-827e-0cf00b929116\', \'multiverseId\': 336398}, \'multiverseid\': 336398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kelch des Lebens // Kelch des Todes\', \'text\': \'{T}: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Transformiere dann den Kelch des Lebens, falls du mindestens 10 Lebenspunkte mehr als deine Startlebenspunktezahl hast.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der süße Geschmack dessen, was die Hoffnung verspricht.\', \'faceName\': \'Kelch des Lebens\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570e8b47-5995-433b-9430-c9ab025bbb61\', \'multiverseId\': 336938}, \'multiverseid\': 336938}, {\'name\': \'Cáliz de la vida // Cáliz de la muerte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ganas 1 vida. Luego, si tienes al menos 10 o más vidas que tu total de vidas inicial, transforma el Cáliz de la vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El dulce sabor de la esperanza.\', \'faceName\': \'Cáliz de la vida\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76abbe0e-def4-46fc-abf6-cfd10a7115ad\', \'multiverseId\': 337109}, \'multiverseid\': 337109}, {\'name\': \'Calice de la vie // Calice de la mort\', \'text\': \'{T} : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie. Ensuite, si vous avez au moins 10 points de vie de plus que votre total de points de vie de départ, transformez le Calice de la vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La douceur de la promesse de l\'espoir.", \'faceName\': \'Calice de la vie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336596&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af4f8ea-1f48-4ff4-98d6-d71b485d8a57\', \'multiverseId\': 336596}, \'multiverseid\': 336596}, {\'name\': \'Calice della Vita // Calice della Morte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Guadagni 1 punto vita. Poi se hai almeno 10 punti vita in più dei tuoi punti vita iniziali, trasforma il Calice della Vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il dolce sapore delle speranze future.\', \'faceName\': \'Calice della Vita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c970e44-154d-43d0-9e7d-08a75d42b308\', \'multiverseId\': 337280}, \'multiverseid\': 337280}, {\'name\': \'生の杯 // 死の杯\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたは１点のライフを得る。その後、あなたのライフの総量が、ゲーム開始時よりも少なくとも10点多い場合、生の杯を変身させる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'希望が期待させる甘さ。\', \'faceName\': \'生の杯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0385c120-cf2a-4917-843d-7e5590f69323\', \'multiverseId\': 337451}, \'multiverseid\': 337451}, {\'name\': \'생명의 성배 // 죽음의 성배\', \'text\': \'{T}: 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다. 그리고 나서, 당신의 생명 총점이 게임을 시작했을 때의 생명 총점보다 적어도 10점이 높다면, 생명의 성배를 변신시킨다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'이 잔에서는 희망의 달콤한 맛을 느낄 수 있다.\', \'faceName\': \'생명의 성배\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b6b051-57f9-4406-a1fe-f562c3c0292a\', \'multiverseId\': 336083}, \'multiverseid\': 336083}, {\'name\': \'Cálice da Vida // Cálice da Morte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida. Depois, se você tiver ao menos 10 pontos de vida a mais do que seu total inicial, transforme Cálice da Vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O gosto doce da promessa da esperança.\', \'faceName\': \'Cálice da Vida\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea86cf1-3d90-4790-8af6-1d5f75bfa852\', \'multiverseId\': 336425}, \'multiverseid\': 336425}, {\'name\': \'Чаша Жизни // Чаша Смерти\', \'text\': \'{T}: вы получаете 1 жизнь. Затем, если количество ваших жизней превышает ваше начальное количество жизней как минимум на 10, трансформируйте Чашу Жизни.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сладкий вкус обещания надежды.\', \'faceName\': \'Чаша Жизни\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9586963e-3f69-478e-9bf2-23e2594d3067\', \'multiverseId\': 336767}, \'multiverseid\': 336767}, {\'name\': \'生命圣杯 // 死亡圣杯\', \'text\': \'{T}：你获得1点生命。然后如果你的总生命比你的起始总生命至少多10点，转化生命圣杯。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'希望允诺的甜美滋味。\', \'faceName\': \'生命圣杯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c0b3f0-0959-46f5-84d2-9137217ae3db\', \'multiverseId\': 335912}, \'multiverseid\': 335912}, {\'name\': \'生命聖杯 // 死亡聖杯\', \'text\': \'{T}：你獲得1點生命。然後如果你的總生命比你的起始總生命至少多10點，轉化生命聖杯。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'希望允諾的甜美滋味。\', \'faceName\': \'生命聖杯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bfeb2d0-eaf5-4bcd-846b-dcddf0fa8696\', \'multiverseId\': 336254}, \'multiverseid\': 336254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kelch des Lebens // Kelch des Todes\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 5 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Der bittere Geschmack des einzigen, was im Leben sicher ist.\', \'faceName\': \'Kelch des Todes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'570e8b47-5995-433b-9430-c9ab025bbb61\', \'multiverseId\': 336938}, \'multiverseid\': 336938}, {\'name\': \'Cáliz de la vida // Cáliz de la muerte\', \'text\': \'{T}: El jugador objetivo pierde 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El amargo sabor de la única certeza de la vida.\', \'faceName\': \'Cáliz de la muerte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76abbe0e-def4-46fc-abf6-cfd10a7115ad\', \'multiverseId\': 337109}, \'multiverseid\': 337109}, {\'name\': \'Calice de la vie // Calice de la mort\', \'text\': \'{T} : Le joueur ciblé perd 5 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'amertume de l\'unique certitude de la vie.", \'faceName\': \'Calice de la mort\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336596&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af4f8ea-1f48-4ff4-98d6-d71b485d8a57\', \'multiverseId\': 336596}, \'multiverseid\': 336596}, {\'name\': \'Calice della Vita // Calice della Morte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Un giocatore bersaglio perde 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Il sapore amaro dell\'unica certezza della vita.", \'faceName\': \'Calice della Morte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c970e44-154d-43d0-9e7d-08a75d42b308\', \'multiverseId\': 337280}, \'multiverseid\': 337280}, {\'name\': \'生の杯 // 死の杯\', \'text\': \'{T}：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは５点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'人生で唯一確実な苦さ。\', \'faceName\': \'死の杯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0385c120-cf2a-4917-843d-7e5590f69323\', \'multiverseId\': 337451}, \'multiverseid\': 337451}, {\'name\': \'생명의 성배 // 죽음의 성배\', \'text\': \'{T}: 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 5점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'이 잔에서는 삶에서 유일하게 보장된 그것의 쓴 맛을 느낄 수 있다.\', \'faceName\': \'죽음의 성배\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b6b051-57f9-4406-a1fe-f562c3c0292a\', \'multiverseId\': 336083}, \'multiverseid\': 336083}, {\'name\': \'Cálice da Vida // Cálice da Morte\', \'text\': \'{T}: O jogador alvo perde 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O gosto amargo da única certeza da vida.\', \'faceName\': \'Cálice da Morte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bea86cf1-3d90-4790-8af6-1d5f75bfa852\', \'multiverseId\': 336425}, \'multiverseid\': 336425}, {\'name\': \'Чаша Жизни // Чаша Смерти\', \'text\': \'{T}: целевой игрок теряет 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Горький вкус единственного бесспорного факта жизни.\', \'faceName\': \'Чаша Смерти\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9586963e-3f69-478e-9bf2-23e2594d3067\', \'multiverseId\': 336767}, \'multiverseid\': 336767}, {\'name\': \'生命圣杯 // 死亡圣杯\', \'text\': \'{T}：目标牌手失去5点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'生命难逃的末路苦涩。\', \'faceName\': \'死亡圣杯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c0b3f0-0959-46f5-84d2-9137217ae3db\', \'multiverseId\': 335912}, \'multiverseid\': 335912}, {\'name\': \'生命聖杯 // 死亡聖杯\', \'text\': \'{T}：目標玩家失去5點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'生命難逃的末路苦澀。\', \'faceName\': \'死亡聖杯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bfeb2d0-eaf5-4bcd-846b-dcddf0fa8696\', \'multiverseId\': 336254}, \'multiverseid\': 336254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ketzerin aus Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie mögen mich verdammen, weil ich die Toten verbrenne. Aber ich gebe diesen Ghulrufern nicht noch mehr Material für ihren Wahnsinn."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b045a9f2-0bf1-4498-a3a3-177cd9c814db\', \'multiverseId\': 336963}, \'multiverseid\': 336963}, {\'name\': \'Hereje de Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Que me juzguen por quemar a los muertos. No voy a darle a esos llamamuertos más material para su locura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b43d9fb7-86fc-4327-8393-7eda44a70ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 337134}, \'multiverseid\': 337134}, {\'name\': \'Hérétique de Thraben\', \'text\': "{T} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée d\'un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'ils me maudissent pour avoir incinéré les morts. Je ne fournirai pas à ces meneurs de goule de quoi alimenter encore plus leur folie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f0a39b-cec5-43d4-9ac2-134f69bf236b\', \'multiverseId\': 336621}, \'multiverseid\': 336621}, {\'name\': \'Eretica di Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lascia che mi biasimino perché brucio i cadaveri. Non voglio alimentare ulteriormente la follia di quegli evocaghoul."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dccbe800-e33b-4b07-bdb1-296de8606332\', \'multiverseId\': 337305}, \'multiverseid\': 337305}, {\'name\': \'スレイベンの異端者\', \'text\': \'{T}：いずれかの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「死者を焼くことを非難するならさせておけばいい。グール呼びどもに、これ以上奴らの狂気の燃料を与える訳にはいかん。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b90418-7b58-4de9-ad78-6bd0d173ef31\', \'multiverseId\': 337476}, \'multiverseid\': 337476}, {\'name\': \'트레이벤의 이단자\', \'text\': \'{T}: 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 시체를 불태운다고 사람들은 욕하겠지. 하지만 저 정신 나간 악귀소환술사에게 더 이상 재료를 주는 건 용납할 수 없다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20bf337f-00f9-4fef-9346-642d72a6ca2a\', \'multiverseId\': 336108}, \'multiverseid\': 336108}, {\'name\': \'Herege de Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Exile o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Que me condenem por queimar os mortos. Não darei àqueles invocadores de carniçais mais combustível para sua loucura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2bd9be-8504-4d68-aac4-57e68757406e\', \'multiverseId\': 336450}, \'multiverseid\': 336450}, {\'name\': \'Трейбенская Отступница\', \'text\': \'{T}: изгоните целевую карту существа из кладбища.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть меня осуждают за сожжение трупов, но я не позволю призывателям упырей творить еще большие безумства».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde13018-e0b6-4943-a1d8-fe3f01118fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 336792}, \'multiverseid\': 336792}, {\'name\': \'瑟班异教徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我不介意焚烧亡者而招人责难。我不想替那些尸鬼牧者增添狂行助力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd6dc30-8cd8-43f4-a5d9-2f0a424f77fe\', \'multiverseId\': 335937}, \'multiverseid\': 335937}, {\'name\': \'瑟班異教徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：將目標生物牌從墳墓場放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我不介意焚燒亡者而招人責難。我不想替那些屍鬼牧者增添狂行助力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78c6728f-3232-4070-82f6-9470cefb4955\', \'multiverseId\': 336279}, \'multiverseid\': 336279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochen zu Asche\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann mir ein schlimmeres Ende ausmalen. Hmmm, vielleicht doch nicht." —Ludevic, Nekro-Alchemist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90b67713-92be-4f30-af32-0e513e3eae6b\', \'multiverseId\': 337066}, \'multiverseid\': 337066}, {\'name\': \'Huesos en cenizas\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo de criatura.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedo imaginar peores maneras de partir. Ahora que lo pienso, tal vez no." —Ludevic, necro-alquimista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ad1453-ff7d-4315-a988-6e9d81c38ddd\', \'multiverseId\': 337237}, \'multiverseid\': 337237}, {\'name\': \'Os en cendres\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort de créature ciblé.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est pas la pire façon de mourir. Après réflexion, peut-être que si. » —Ludevic, nécro-alchimiste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336724&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d2775c-b853-4d21-8a8b-df8e14eee0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 336724}, \'multiverseid\': 336724}, {\'name\': \'Ossa in Cenere\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia creatura bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi vengono in mente modi peggiori per andarsene. A pensarci bene, forse no." —Ludevic, necro-alchimista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a4455d5-d683-4913-a74b-90069f95b27b\', \'multiverseId\': 337408}, \'multiverseid\': 337408}, {\'name\': \'骨を灰に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「もっと悪い死にようも考え得る。いや待てよ、そうでもないか。」――屍錬金術師、ルーデヴィック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45e7673d-e0fd-4ab0-a45e-7e3c9d90c2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 337579}, \'multiverseid\': 337579}, {\'name\': \'뼈에서 재로\', \'text\': \'생물 주문 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"더 처참하게 죽는 방법이야 많... 은 게 아니라 없군." —사령연금술사 루데비치\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e942256-3f1d-4347-8a63-16d4cd1ea4be\', \'multiverseId\': 336211}, \'multiverseid\': 336211}, {\'name\': \'De Ossos a Cinzas\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica de criatura alvo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso imaginar meios piores de partir. Pensando bem, acho que não." — Ludevic, necroalquimista\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d77cc8-70f2-4cbf-9fe2-f093073917e3\', \'multiverseId\': 336553}, \'multiverseid\': 336553}, {\'name\': \'Из Костей в Прах\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание существа.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть смерти и похуже. Хотя нет, пожалуй, нет». — Людевик, некроалхимик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2bf3b5c-0dba-4d85-b196-4cab4a949b27\', \'multiverseId\': 336895}, \'multiverseid\': 336895}, {\'name\': \'白骨化灰\', \'text\': \'反击目标生物咒语。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我能想到更糟的告别法。不过仔细想想，那也许还算不上。」～死灵炼金术士卢德维\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff237e12-3f92-4508-8159-52ff200d4554\', \'multiverseId\': 336040}, \'multiverseid\': 336040}, {\'name\': \'白骨化灰\', \'text\': \'反擊目標生物咒語。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我能想到更糟的告別法。不過仔細想想，那也許還算不上。」～死靈鍊金術士盧德維\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d533f043-899b-4e54-b2cc-ff230bb0805a\', \'multiverseId\': 336382}, \'multiverseid\': 336382}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kopfloser Skaab\', \'text\': \'Schicke als zusätzliche Kosten, um den Kopflosen Skaab zu wirken, eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\nDer Kopflose Skaab kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Kopf ist unnötiger Ballast, wenn nur Muskeln benötigt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c4eabbd-77fa-48f0-989f-a5fdc57386d8\', \'multiverseId\': 336975}, \'multiverseid\': 336975}, {\'name\': \'Skaab sin cabeza\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar el Skaab sin cabeza, exilia una carta de criatura de tu cementerio.\\nEl Skaab sin cabeza entra al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Una cabeza es un estorbo innecesario cuando todo lo que necesitas es músculo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c03a22-81c9-44f5-a339-280c172ec4c7\', \'multiverseId\': 337146}, \'multiverseid\': 337146}, {\'name\': \'Skaab sans tête\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer le Skaab sans tête, exilez une carte de créature de votre cimetière.\\nLe Skaab sans tête arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "On peut se passer d\'une tête quand le muscle est tout ce qui compte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'233ead1a-1a8f-4488-a8b0-c395559d3ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 336633}, \'multiverseid\': 336633}, {\'name\': \'Skaab Senza Testa\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare lo Skaab Senza Testa, esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero.\\nLo Skaab Senza Testa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Zombie\', \'flavor\': "La testa è un ingombro inutile quando i muscoli sono l\'unica cosa necessaria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc06018-dec5-4bcf-b94a-ebb0b1c5bbb0\', \'multiverseId\': 337317}, \'multiverseid\': 337317}, {\'name\': \'首無しスカーブ\', \'text\': \'首無しスカーブを唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードを１枚追放する。首無しスカーブはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ･戦士\', \'flavor\': \'筋肉のみが必要な時には、頭は無用の長物でしか無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c6fa5e-a94d-408b-8c79-cff49f4f568e\', \'multiverseId\': 337488}, \'multiverseid\': 337488}, {\'name\': \'머리 없는 스캅\', \'text\': \'머리 없는 스캅을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 당신의 무덤에서 생물 카드 한 장을 추방한다.\\n머리 없는 스캅은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 전사\', \'flavor\': \'완력만이 필요하다면 머리는 거추장스러운 짐일 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6223d56e-2bf9-40b4-aa24-89ad9f31cc23\', \'multiverseId\': 336120}, \'multiverseid\': 336120}, {\'name\': \'Skaab Sem Cabeça\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Skaab Sem Cabeça, exile um card de criatura de seu cemitério.\\nSkaab Sem Cabeça entra no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Uma cabeça é um estorvo desnecessário quando tudo de que você precisa são músculos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369b2317-53fb-41c1-9953-db710f163586\', \'multiverseId\': 336462}, \'multiverseid\': 336462}, {\'name\': \'Безголовый Скааб\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Безголового Скааба изгоните карту существа из вашего кладбища.\\nБезголовый Скааб выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Голова — бесполезное излишество, когда требуются только мышцы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c1c7db-3ac1-4783-a5de-a1f507b8940a\', \'multiverseId\': 336804}, \'multiverseid\': 336804}, {\'name\': \'无头尸嵌\', \'text\': \'从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌，以作为施放无头尸嵌的额外费用。无头尸嵌须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／战士\', \'flavor\': \'既然只用到肌肉，头就是个多余累赘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df624240-4289-45cc-8e02-614c09c4a1e4\', \'multiverseId\': 335949}, \'multiverseid\': 335949}, {\'name\': \'無頭屍嵌\', \'text\': \'從你的墳墓場放逐一張生物牌，以作為施放無頭屍嵌的額外費用。無頭屍嵌須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'既然只用到肌肉，頭就是個多餘累贅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c4219b-c985-4246-89ba-c0d6158fb21e\', \'multiverseId\': 336291}, \'multiverseid\': 336291}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kreischender Skaab\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Kreischende Skaab ins Spiel kommt, lege die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Kreischen lässt dich den Verstand verlieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205e2fa5-3768-4139-896e-effa8373dfae\', \'multiverseId\': 336979}, \'multiverseid\': 336979}, {\'name\': \'Skaab chillón\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Skaab chillón entre al campo de batalla, pon las primeras dos cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Su chillido es el sonido que haces cuando pierdes tu cordura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402fd047-f489-483c-8124-1e7db80e4aca\', \'multiverseId\': 337150}, \'multiverseid\': 337150}, {\'name\': \'Skaab grinçant\', \'text\': \'Quand le Skaab grinçant arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Son grincement, c\'est celui de l\'esprit que vous êtes en train de perdre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336637&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b35355d7-00b3-4937-a305-21e2dbaed743\', \'multiverseId\': 336637}, \'multiverseid\': 336637}, {\'name\': \'Skaab Urlante\', \'text\': \'Quando lo Skaab Urlante entra nel campo di battaglia, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue urla sono il suono di quando perdi la testa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1bc5454-7f32-4288-beda-ca8cc973a49d\', \'multiverseId\': 337321}, \'multiverseid\': 337321}, {\'name\': \'金切り声のスカーブ\', \'text\': \'金切り声のスカーブが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'その叫び声は、お前が正気を失う音だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a2b8360-36fb-4a82-bc15-3b7f51899dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 337492}, \'multiverseid\': 337492}, {\'name\': \'울부짖는 스캅\', \'text\': \'울부짖는 스캅이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'그것의 울음소리는 바로 당신이 정신줄을 놓는 소리다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1dc938-e913-4674-8581-96b1e4710f45\', \'multiverseId\': 336124}, \'multiverseid\': 336124}, {\'name\': \'Skaab Guinchante\', \'text\': \'Quando Skaab Guinchante entrar no campo de batalha, coloque os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Seu guinchado é o som de você perdendo a cabeça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7641331a-0cc9-42f0-a657-5ef837ff34fc\', \'multiverseId\': 336466}, \'multiverseid\': 336466}, {\'name\': \'Визжащий Скааб\', \'text\': \'Когда Визжащий Скааб выходит на поле битвы, положите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Его визг — это звук, с которым вы лишаетесь рассудка.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54e29541-a78b-4bfb-864c-c136fcc3e9c7\', \'multiverseId\': 336808}, \'multiverseid\': 336808}, {\'name\': \'尖鸣尸嵌\', \'text\': \'当尖鸣尸嵌进战场时，将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'其尖鸣就是你丧失心智之音。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca0363ae-f1f0-4756-bcb0-51348333124f\', \'multiverseId\': 335953}, \'multiverseid\': 335953}, {\'name\': \'尖鳴屍嵌\', \'text\': \'當尖鳴屍嵌進戰場時，將你牌庫頂的兩張牌置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'其尖鳴就是你喪失心智之音。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f72ed89-31db-414e-ae3f-4bd7eb5d4a66\', \'multiverseId\': 336295}, \'multiverseid\': 336295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kreischgeist\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Kreischgeist einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, legt dieser Spieler die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Fleischwunden können einfach geheilt werden. Hirnschäden sind meistens irreparabel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd87a98e-3c4f-4f99-83fa-2af92abb41b9\', \'multiverseId\': 336950}, \'multiverseid\': 336950}, {\'name\': \'Geist chillante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Geist chillante haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador pone las primeras dos cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Las heridas de la carne son fáciles de curar. Las heridas de la mente pueden no curarse nunca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f28af72-3877-4dbc-ae1c-e1160dccd97c\', \'multiverseId\': 337121}, \'multiverseid\': 337121}, {\'name\': \'Geist glapissant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Geist glapissant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur met les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "Les blessures de la chair guérissent facilement. Les blessures de l\'esprit ne se referment jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5556a39f-a0ee-484f-a9c5-e4642a997814\', \'multiverseId\': 336608}, \'multiverseid\': 336608}, {\'name\': \'Geist Urlante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Geist Urlante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore mette nel suo cimitero le prime due carte del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Le ferite della carne si curano facilmente. Le ferite della mente non possono mai essere cancellate.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'add662bf-565c-4968-af63-d61d28f88294\', \'multiverseId\': 337292}, \'multiverseid\': 337292}, {\'name\': \'叫び霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n叫び霊がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'肉体の傷は容易く癒える。精神の傷は取り返しがつかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'760e0901-f9f8-4b36-957d-595bbbd861c1\', \'multiverseId\': 337463}, \'multiverseid\': 337463}, {\'name\': \'비명소리 심령\', \'text\': \'비명소리 심령이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'상처 입은 육체는 쉽게 고칠 수 있지만, 상처 입은 정신은 영원히 고칠 수 없을 수도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b11cd4d-0c1f-439d-8100-104e4e528e43\', \'multiverseId\': 336095}, \'multiverseid\': 336095}, {\'name\': \'Geist do Grito\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Geist do Grito causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador coloca os dois cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'As feridas da carne são fáceis de curar. As feridas da mente podem não ser desfeitas jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0212309-efb5-44ee-aa18-d39925b55761\', \'multiverseId\': 336437}, \'multiverseid\': 336437}, {\'name\': \'Вопящее Привидение\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз когда Вопящее Привидение наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок кладет две верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Раненое тело легко излечить. Раненый разум же подчас вообще не поддается лечению.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbe2b49-4409-4708-92a8-ec4cab8ab378\', \'multiverseId\': 336779}, \'multiverseid\': 336779}, {\'name\': \'尖鸣游魂\', \'text\': \'每当尖鸣游魂对一位牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'肉体伤口容易愈合。心灵伤口则可能永难平复。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef44781a-ee60-4ad9-9764-d50b3407640b\', \'multiverseId\': 335924}, \'multiverseid\': 335924}, {\'name\': \'尖鳴遊魂\', \'text\': \'每當尖鳴遊魂對一位玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家將其牌庫頂的兩張牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'肉體傷口容易癒合。心靈傷口則可能永難平復。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3dca62-5a4e-4258-a46e-cfc2d5f625f4\', \'multiverseId\': 336266}, \'multiverseid\': 336266}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kunstvolles Ausweichen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ist in diesem Zug unblockbar.\\nRückblende {B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die die Gräben und Kanäle der Erdgänge kennen, können blitzschnell verschwinden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96abf954-b18f-4569-92bc-945ec0a3f547\', \'multiverseId\': 337061}, \'multiverseid\': 337061}, {\'name\': \'Esquivar con maestría\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo es imbloqueable este turno.\\nRetrospectiva {U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los que conocen los callejones y alcantarillas de Erdwal pueden desaparecer como humo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f660616b-5f46-4dc8-8b64-4fe03934be9b\', \'multiverseId\': 337232}, \'multiverseid\': 337232}, {\'name\': \'Esquive rusée\', \'text\': \'La créature ciblée est imblocable ce tour-ci.\\nFlashback {U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quiconque connaît les ruelles et les égouts de l\'Erdwal peut s\'éclipser en un instant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b9371b-f300-4e18-9790-434fafd02452\', \'multiverseId\': 336719}, \'multiverseid\': 336719}, {\'name\': \'Abile Schivata\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\\nFlashback {U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Quanti conoscono i vicoli e le fogne dell\'Erdwal possono svanire nel nulla.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5292207b-2e2f-48b1-b4c2-184de4b2dcdd\', \'multiverseId\': 337403}, \'multiverseid\': 337403}, {\'name\': \'巧みな回避\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。フラッシュバック {U} （あなたはフラッシュバック・コストで、このカードをあなたの墓地からプレイしてもよい。その後、それを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'エルドワルの路地や下水路を知っている者は、煙のように消え失せることができる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcce5c9-f02e-4023-85d1-de5bb3831d01\', \'multiverseId\': 337574}, \'multiverseid\': 337574}, {\'name\': \'교묘한 회피\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어될 수 없다.\\n회상 {U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후, 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'에르드왈의 골목과 하수구의 구조를 파악하고 있는 자들은 그 속에서 연기처럼 모습을 감출 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ecdd5e2-c3c0-4aa4-8c43-0be5fd9a6c08\', \'multiverseId\': 336206}, \'multiverseid\': 336206}, {\'name\': \'Fuga Engenhosa\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\\nRecapitular {U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Aqueles que conhecem os becos e os bueiros de Erdwal podem desaparecer como fumaça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47c954eb-317a-4ea6-977b-eabc8b27ec5c\', \'multiverseId\': 336548}, \'multiverseid\': 336548}, {\'name\': \'Искусное Уклонение\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\\nВоспоминание {U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Те, кому знакомы переулки и сточные сети Эрдваля, умеют исчезать как дым.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7bce7da-6a00-4707-a201-77dcc6d8ef3b\', \'multiverseId\': 336890}, \'multiverseid\': 336890}, {\'name\': \'精巧闪躲\', \'text\': \'目标生物本回合中不能被阻挡。\\n返照{U} （你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'熟知尔卓道的小巷与下水道者，能够如烟雾般消失。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5abc3d6b-fcfb-47d5-aeea-edec3467d725\', \'multiverseId\': 336035}, \'multiverseid\': 336035}, {\'name\': \'精巧閃躲\', \'text\': \'目標生物本回合中不能被阻擋。\\n返照{U}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'熟知爾卓道的小巷與下水道者，能夠如煙霧般消失。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47212aad-86a8-4fdb-a983-6aaf35cf797e\', \'multiverseId\': 336377}, \'multiverseid\': 336377}]', '[{\'name\': \'Käfig des Totengräbers\', \'text\': \'Kreatur-Karten können nicht aus Friedhöfen oder Bibliotheken ins Spiel kommen.\\nSpieler können keine Karten wirken, die in Friedhöfen oder Bibliotheken sind.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du in einem von meinen Gräbern auftauchst, kannst du dein Silber drauf wetten, dass es dein letztes ist." —Wulmer der Totengräber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21c0de7-62ad-43a7-8b23-ecc77ed11101\', \'multiverseId\': 337099}, \'multiverseid\': 337099}, {\'name\': \'Jaula del cavatumbas\', \'text\': \'Las cartas de criatura no pueden entrar al campo de batalla desde cementerios o bibliotecas.\\nLos jugadores no pueden lanzar cartas en cementerios o bibliotecas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si terminas en una de las mías, puedes estar seguro de que será la última." —Cavatumbas Wulmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e70685-e445-41cb-ba1a-cded06c96056\', \'multiverseId\': 337270}, \'multiverseid\': 337270}, {\'name\': \'Cage du fossoyeur de graf\', \'text\': \'Les cartes de créature ne peuvent pas arriver sur le champ de bataille depuis les cimetières ou les bibliothèques.\\nLes joueurs ne peuvent pas lancer de cartes des cimetières ou des bibliothèques.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous finissez dans l\'une des miennes, soyez sûr que ce sera la dernière. » —Fossoyeur de graf Wulmer", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336757&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af5f3a75-298c-4087-9d0b-c267fb74ef5f\', \'multiverseId\': 336757}, \'multiverseid\': 336757}, {\'name\': \'Gabbia del Becchino\', \'text\': \'Le carte creatura non possono entrare nel campo di battaglia dai cimiteri o dai grimori.\\nI giocatori non possono lanciare carte dai cimiteri o dai grimori.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Se finisci in una delle mie, sicuro come l\\\'oro che per te sarà l\\\'ultima." —Becchino Wulmer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd6575b-0680-4b6e-ae12-3eba354b4cba\', \'multiverseId\': 337441}, \'multiverseid\': 337441}, {\'name\': \'墓掘りの檻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・カードは、墓地やライブラリーから戦場に出られない。プレイヤーは、墓地やライブラリーにあるカードを唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「俺のとこに行き着くことになったら、そりゃ確実にあんたの最期だ。」、――墓掘りのワルマー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f3b260-efdb-44ff-bad3-bfeea3373f05\', \'multiverseId\': 337612}, \'multiverseid\': 337612}, {\'name\': \'시체도둑의 철창\', \'text\': \'생물 카드는 무덤이나 서고에서 전장에 들어올 수 없다.\\n플레이어들은 무덤이나 서고에서 카드를 발동할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"내 우리에 갇히면 거기서 나올 생각 따윈 하지 않는 게 좋아." —시체도둑 울메르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a7f9ef-3944-4cd9-92a9-a4adb558a49b\', \'multiverseId\': 336244}, \'multiverseid\': 336244}, {\'name\': \'Jaula do Escavador de Túmulos\', \'text\': \'Os cards de criatura não podem entrar no campo de batalha vindos de cemitérios ou de grimórios.\\nOs jogadores não podem conjurar cards que estejam em cemitérios ou em grimórios.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você acabar numa das minhas, pode ter certeza de que será sua última." — Wulmer, escavador de túmulos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7f1eb7-bd7b-4447-845f-0efe342978ed\', \'multiverseId\': 336586}, \'multiverseid\': 336586}, {\'name\': \'Клетка Раскопщика Могильников\', \'text\': \'Карты существ не могут выходить на поле битвы из кладбищ или библиотек.\\nИгроки не могут разыгрывать не являющиеся землями карты, находящиеся на кладбищах или в библиотеках.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Если вы окажетесь в одной из моих клеток, то можете не сомневаться — она станет вашей последней». — раскопщик могильников Вульмер\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ed2d824-d08f-4918-8556-05184240b6ea\', \'multiverseId\': 336928}, \'multiverseid\': 336928}, {\'name\': \'挖坟人囚笼\', \'text\': \'生物牌不能从坟墓场或牌库进战场。牌手不能从坟墓场或牌库施放牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你最终由我服务，你可以如同信任银一样确定这是你最后一次。」～挖坟人渥玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd19a5a9-5cd3-491d-8bad-461b7521c72e\', \'multiverseId\': 336073}, \'multiverseid\': 336073}, {\'name\': \'挖墳人囚籠\', \'text\': \'生物牌不能從墳墓場或牌庫進戰場。玩家不能從墳墓場或牌庫施放牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你最終由我服務，你可以如同信任銀一樣確定這是你最後一次。」～挖墳人渥瑪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8e6c00-ea84-4fa5-8d42-52f0ba3a6c51\', \'multiverseId\': 336415}, \'multiverseid\': 336415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Köcher des Wolfjägers\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu" und „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einer Werwolf-Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu".\\nAusrüsten {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Stahl im Herzen, Silber im Bogen." —Credo der Wolfjäger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a56446e-e0f8-4612-a80e-24cc365d8635\', \'multiverseId\': 336989}, \'multiverseid\': 336989}, {\'name\': \'Carcaj del cazador de lobos\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene "{T}: Esta criatura hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo" y "{T}: Esta criatura hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura Licántropo objetivo".\\nEquipar {5}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Acero en el corazón, plata en el arco." —Credo del cazador de lobos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ed71aa-33b8-48d4-b0bf-003c01a0c32b\', \'multiverseId\': 337160}, \'multiverseid\': 337160}, {\'name\': \'Carquois du chasseur de loups\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a « {T} : Cette créature inflige 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur » et « {T} : Cette créature inflige 3 blessures à une créature Loup-garou ciblée. »\\nÉquipement {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« De l\'acier dans le cœur, de l\'argent à l\'arc. » —Credo du chasseur de loups", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336647&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8550eaf2-eacd-4260-a9c0-66692de4c78d\', \'multiverseId\': 336647}, \'multiverseid\': 336647}, {\'name\': \'Faretra del Cacciatore di Lupi\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha "{T}: Questa creatura infligge 1 danno a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio" e "{T}: Questa creatura infligge 3 danni a una creatura Mannaro bersaglio".\\nEquipaggiare {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Acciaio nel cuore, argento nell\\\'arco." —Credo del cacciatore di lupi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ca7a4e3-8eaf-4072-a6f2-56b7115f57f0\', \'multiverseId\': 337331}, \'multiverseid\': 337331}, {\'name\': \'狼狩りの矢筒\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、「{T}：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」と「{T}：狼男・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに３点のダメージを与える。」を持つ。装備 {5}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「心に鋼、弓に銀。」――狼狩りの信条\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e293dc3f-1c98-4cec-a1b3-b63acb11dd53\', \'multiverseId\': 337502}, \'multiverseid\': 337502}, {\'name\': \'늑대사냥꾼의 화살통\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 "{T}: 생물 한 개나 플레이어 한 명을 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다"와 "{T}: 늑대인간 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다"라는 능력을 가진다.\\n장착 {5}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'"강철의 심장과 은으로 만든 활." —늑대사냥꾼의 신조\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7288c1bb-0b59-4f21-9ccb-81f7e0e8c736\', \'multiverseId\': 336134}, \'multiverseid\': 336134}, {\'name\': \'Aljava do Caçador de Lobos\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem "{T}: Esta criatura causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo" e "{T}: Esta criatura causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo do tipo Lobisomem."\\nEquipar {5}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Aço no coração, prata no arco." — Crença dos caçadores de lobos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80a5ed02-6e53-47e0-9dc1-80b566a7034c\', \'multiverseId\': 336476}, \'multiverseid\': 336476}, {\'name\': \'Колчан Охотника на Волков\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет способности «{T}: это существо наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку» и «{T}: это существо наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу-Вервольфу».\\nСнарядить {5}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'«Сталь в сердце, серебро в луке». — принцип охотника на волков\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2765807d-66da-4f5c-ac43-8938c869c629\', \'multiverseId\': 336818}, \'multiverseid\': 336818}, {\'name\': \'狼猎手箭筒\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有「{T}：此生物对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害」以及「{T}：此生物对目标狼人生物造成3点伤害」。 佩带{5}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「心硬如钢，弓闪银光。」～狼猎手信条\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d096e8b-6519-4be4-9c33-bf3e7447104c\', \'multiverseId\': 335963}, \'multiverseid\': 335963}, {\'name\': \'狼獵手箭筒\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有「{T}：此生物對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害」以及「{T}：此生物對目標狼人生物造成3點傷害」。 佩帶{5}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「心硬如鋼，弓閃銀光。」～狼獵手信條\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9913f3f8-fa16-491d-9a6e-f8a9d9ed83c7\', \'multiverseId\': 336305}, \'multiverseid\': 336305}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lich aus Pfuhlhaven\', \'text\': \'{1}: Du kannst eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof in diesem Zug wirken. Wenn du diese Karte in diesem Zug wirkst, erhält der Lich aus Pfuhlhaven alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten dieser Karte bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Um Intelligenz und die Macht der Untoten zu verbinden, benötigt man Eingebungen der dunkelsten Art.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337071&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08786a29-15aa-4c01-a0d6-a26a150cee47\', \'multiverseId\': 337071}, \'multiverseid\': 337071}, {\'name\': \'Liche de Havengul\', \'text\': \'{1}: Este turno puedes lanzar la carta de criatura objetivo en un cementerio. Cuando lances esa carta este turno, el Liche de Havengul gana todas las habilidades activadas de esa carta hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Unir la inteligencia con el poder de la muerte viviente requiere de una inspiración de lo más siniestra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c7f6c4-f470-4781-be9e-ebd0ea7f7a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 337242}, \'multiverseid\': 337242}, {\'name\': \'Liche de Havengul\', \'text\': "{1} : Vous pouvez lancer une carte de créature ciblée dans un cimetière ce tour-ci. Quand vous lancez cette carte ce tour-ci, la Liche de Havengul acquiert toutes les capacités activées de cette carte jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : Zombie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Fusionner l\'intelligence et la puissance de la morte-vie nécessite l\'inspiration la plus noire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0799d32e-d308-4a06-862f-b496c87c6eab\', \'multiverseId\': 336729}, \'multiverseid\': 336729}, {\'name\': \'Lich di Havengul\', \'text\': \'{1}: Puoi lanciare una carta creatura bersaglio in un cimitero in questo turno. Quando lanci quella carta in questo turno, il Lich di Havengul ha tutte le abilità attivate di quella carta fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Fondere l\'intelligenza con il potere della non morte richiede un\'ispirazione del tipo più oscuro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed5963ac-5226-4f7f-b938-67d215d53126\', \'multiverseId\': 337413}, \'multiverseid\': 337413}, {\'name\': \'ヘイヴングルの死者\', \'text\': \'{1}：いずれかの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。このターン、あなたはそれを唱えてもよい。これによりこのターンにそのカードを唱えたとき、ヘイヴングルの死者はターン終了時まで、そのカードのすべての起動型能力を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'不死の力に知性を吹き込むには、最も暗黒なる類の発想が必要だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b2c207-768e-4255-ac59-500917f8c63d\', \'multiverseId\': 337584}, \'multiverseid\': 337584}, {\'name\': \'헤이븐굴 리치\', \'text\': \'{1}: 무덤에 있는 생물 카드 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 이 턴에 그 카드를 발동할 때, 헤이븐굴 리치는 턴종료까지 그 생물 카드의 모든 활성화능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'정말 사악한 영감 없이는 지능과 불사의 힘을 융합할 생각을 할 수 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615c4bb3-5840-4c74-a606-998209e3771a\', \'multiverseId\': 336216}, \'multiverseid\': 336216}, {\'name\': \'Lich de Havengul\', \'text\': \'{1}: Você pode conjurar o card de criatura alvo num cemitério neste turno. Quando conjurar aquele card neste turno, Lich de Havengul ganhará todas as habilidades ativadas daquele card até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Unir a inteligência ao poder da morte-vida requer uma inspiração muito sinistra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a576f982-e872-4c8b-99a3-6d1d659698e2\', \'multiverseId\': 336558}, \'multiverseid\': 336558}, {\'name\': \'Хавенгульский Лич\', \'text\': \'{1}: вы можете разыграть находящуюся на кладбище целевую карту существа в этом ходу. Когда вы разыгрываете ту карту в этом ходу, Хавенгульский Лич получает все активируемые способности той карты до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Для соединения ума с силой нежизни требуется самое что ни на есть темное вдохновение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'091f1618-1b59-41a0-9533-39d47822f7d1\', \'multiverseId\': 336900}, \'multiverseid\': 336900}, {\'name\': \'海温古巫妖\', \'text\': \'{1}：你本回合可以从任一坟墓场施放目标生物牌。当你本回合施放该牌时，海温古巫妖获得该牌的所有起动式异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'以不死生物的力量滋养智慧，需要来自最黑暗物种的灵感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21501552-3a5e-4598-a128-232040e0923a\', \'multiverseId\': 336045}, \'multiverseid\': 336045}, {\'name\': \'海溫古巫妖\', \'text\': \'{1}：你本回合可以從任一墳墓場施放目標生物牌。當你本回合施放該牌時，海溫古巫妖獲得該牌的所有起動式異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'以不死生物的力量滋養智慧，需要來自最黑暗物種的靈感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e225194-2717-4a8b-bffe-a6bf726c90de\', \'multiverseId\': 336387}, \'multiverseid\': 336387}]', '[{\'name\': \'Licht des Erzengels\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte für jede Karte in deinem Friedhof dazu, dann mischst du deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Dies ist das Licht von Avacyn. Selbst in ihrer Abwesenheit gibt sie uns Sicherheit." —Radulf, Priester von Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8cc5ecc-ccb8-407d-95b8-51a6d7faa8e5\', \'multiverseId\': 336960}, \'multiverseid\': 336960}, {\'name\': \'Luz del arcángel\', \'text\': \'Gana 2 vidas por cada carta en tu cementerio, luego baraja tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta es la luz de Avacyn. Incluso en su ausencia ella nos ofrece esperanza." —Radulf, sacerdote de Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'749d7c20-c02d-4db9-8a51-688cc62521a8\', \'multiverseId\': 337131}, \'multiverseid\': 337131}, {\'name\': "Lumière de l\'archange", \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 2 points de vie pour chaque carte dans votre cimetière, puis vous mélangez votre cimetière à votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ceci est la lumière d\'Avacyn. Même en son absence, elle nous offre l\'espoir. » —Radulf, prêtre d\'Avacyn", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e8fb4c-dd97-42ff-94ba-5c69fc57e02f\', \'multiverseId\': 336618}, \'multiverseid\': 336618}, {\'name\': "Luce dell\'Arcangelo", \'text\': \'Guadagni 2 punti vita per ogni carta nel tuo cimitero, poi rimescola il tuo cimitero nel tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Questa è la luce di Avacyn. Anche in sua assenza ci offre speranza." —Radulf, sacerdote di Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb75e8a-6283-497f-957f-0b513d0b2b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 337302}, \'multiverseid\': 337302}, {\'name\': \'大天使の光\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたの墓地にあるカード１枚につき２点のライフを得て、その後あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これはアヴァシンの光です。ここにおらずとも、彼女は希望を与えてくれるのです。」――アヴァシンの僧侶、ラダルフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f656c5f0-999b-4727-b120-53d128136c53\', \'multiverseId\': 337473}, \'multiverseid\': 337473}, {\'name\': \'대천사의 광명\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 카드 한 장당 생명 2점을 얻은 후, 당신의 무덤을 당신의 서고에 섞어 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이것은 아바신의 빛이다. 그녀는 이곳에 안 계심에도 불구하고 우리에게 희망을 주시니라." —아바신의 사제 라둘프\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed14142f-d055-4914-84fe-3b130f349a00\', \'multiverseId\': 336105}, \'multiverseid\': 336105}, {\'name\': \'Luz do Arcanjo\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 2 pontos de vida para cada card em seu cemitério e depois embaralha seu cemitério no próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta é a luz de Avacyn. Mesmo na sua ausência, ela nos dá esperança." — Radulf, sacerdote de Avacyn\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38dcd0fe-3a82-453c-919d-6ec0561f18ae\', \'multiverseId\': 336447}, \'multiverseid\': 336447}, {\'name\': \'Свет Архангела\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 2 жизни за каждую карту на вашем кладбище, затем втасуйте ваше кладбище в вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Это свет Авацины. Даже отсутствуя, она дает нам надежду». — Радульф, жрец Авацины\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae264adf-912d-4ec0-aa9e-34338d1cc26f\', \'multiverseId\': 336789}, \'multiverseid\': 336789}, {\'name\': \'大天使恩光\', \'text\': \'你的坟墓场每有一张牌便获得2点生命，然后将你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库中。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这是艾维欣的光芒。即使她不在此处，也替我们带来希望。」～艾维欣僧侣拉多夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6653850a-1024-4696-bb40-1675a644057f\', \'multiverseId\': 335934}, \'multiverseid\': 335934}, {\'name\': \'大天使恩光\', \'text\': \'你的墳墓場每有一張牌便獲得2點生命，然後將你的墳墓場洗入你的牌庫中。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這是艾維欣的光芒。即使她不在此處，也替我們帶來希望。」～艾維欣僧侶拉多夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f941459a-cac6-4021-bdf0-f9c1541762fa\', \'multiverseId\': 336276}, \'multiverseid\': 336276}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loderherz-Wolf\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Loderherz-Wolf angreift, können alle Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3cd821f-1bfe-4efb-9f0b-fe49d34460bb\', \'multiverseId\': 337001}, \'multiverseid\': 337001}, {\'name\': \'Lobo corazón de pira\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Lobo corazón de pira ataque, cada criatura que controles no puede ser bloqueada este turno excepto por dos o más criaturas.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a03dbcb-02b2-4673-bb55-c4c61ce643c9\', \'multiverseId\': 337172}, \'multiverseid\': 337172}, {\'name\': \'Loup brasecœur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Loup brasecœur attaque, chaque créature que vous contrôlez ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci excepté par deux créatures ou plus.\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336659&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'883f965f-89b4-4011-89e1-e5584a126fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 336659}, \'multiverseid\': 336659}, {\'name\': \'Lupo Cuore Infuocato\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Lupo Cuore Infuocato attacca, ogni creatura che controlli non può essere bloccata in questo turno tranne che da due o più creature.\\nImmortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85637e88-020d-4409-a243-05aa16c00360\', \'multiverseId\': 337343}, \'multiverseid\': 337343}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮心の狼\', \'text\': \'紅蓮心の狼が攻撃するたび、このターン、あなたがコントロールする各クリーチャーは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、それを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b9e0e63-ef9b-490d-ad44-c8212334a5d2\', \'multiverseId\': 337514}, \'multiverseid\': 337514}, {\'name\': \'모닥불심장 늑대\', \'text\': \'모닥불심장 늑대가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 각 생물은 이 턴에 두 개 이상의 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.\\n불사 (이 생물이 죽을 때, 만약 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터가 올라가있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 +1/+1 카운터 한 개가 올라간 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aeaf5bc-77f5-4429-9c68-7d7dfab551b1\', \'multiverseId\': 336146}, \'multiverseid\': 336146}, {\'name\': \'Lobo Coração de Pira\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Lobo Coração de Pira ataca, cada criatura que você controla só pode ser bloqueada neste turno por duas ou mais criaturas.\\nImortal (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3f721a-4c29-4a16-ae33-8a4a35d5c6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 336488}, \'multiverseid\': 336488}, {\'name\': \'Волк Огненного Сердца\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз когда Волк Огненного Сердца атакует, каждое существо под вашим контролем не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу менее чем двумя существами.\\nНетленность (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f95e41-5410-4646-afd5-92c1a89fa7ad\', \'multiverseId\': 336830}, \'multiverseid\': 336830}, {\'name\': \'葬火心狼\', \'text\': \'每当葬火心狼攻击时，每个由你操控的生物本回合只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。不息（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下返回战场，且其上有一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d179819d-e835-4e1b-b7f4-ee08072a8ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 335975}, \'multiverseid\': 335975}, {\'name\': \'葬火心狼\', \'text\': \'每當葬火心狼攻擊時，每個由你操控的生物本回合只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。不息（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有+1/+1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下返回戰場，且其上有一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～狼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42d644d0-67fd-4166-bff5-10cd73275f64\', \'multiverseId\': 336317}, \'multiverseid\': 336317}]', '[{\'name\': \'Markov-Klingenmeisterin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Markov-Klingenmeisterin einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Sterbliche üben den Schwertkampf möglicherweise ein paar Jahrzehnte. Wie wollen sie dadurch jemals so gut werden wie wir, die seit einer Ewigkeit dabei sind?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917ff2ac-0c32-4e21-9cad-58dfbf36fd59\', \'multiverseId\': 336993}, \'multiverseid\': 336993}, {\'name\': \'Maestra de filo Markov\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nSiempre que la Maestra de filo Markov haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los mortales practican esgrima por unas pocas décadas como mucho. ¿Cómo podrían alcanzar la maestría que ofrece la inmortalidad?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dff7eeab-f215-4d5b-a830-3164b69afd06\', \'multiverseId\': 337164}, \'multiverseid\': 337164}, {\'name\': "Maître d\'épée Markov", \'text\': "Double initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que le Maître d\'épée Markov inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Les mortels pratiquent l\'épée pendant quelques décennies tout au plus. Comment peuvent-ils espérer atteindre l\'exquise maîtrise que nous offre l\'éternité ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336651&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b047afb-8d71-44be-8eb3-8536f755e5f0\', \'multiverseId\': 336651}, \'multiverseid\': 336651}, {\'name\': \'Maestra di Spada Markov\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco\\nOgniqualvolta la Maestra di Spada Markov infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Maestra di Spada Markov.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"I mortali si addestrano nell\\\'arte della scherma per poche decadi al massimo. Come potrebbero mai raggiungere la raffinata maestria che ha da offrire l\\\'eternità?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f24c131e-9432-426b-9a44-029a137fc016\', \'multiverseId\': 337335}, \'multiverseid\': 337335}, {\'name\': \'マルコフの刃の達人\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\nマルコフの刃の達人がいずれかのプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「定命の者は、剣技を鍛えてせいぜい数十年だ。そんな者が、どうやって永遠の時が与えてくれる高みへと届くというのだ？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f202cd7-b7b9-4ea8-97d1-493d99e8c630\', \'multiverseId\': 337506}, \'multiverseid\': 337506}, {\'name\': \'마르코프가의 검성\', \'text\': \'마르코프가의 검성이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 마르코프가의 검성에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 전사\', \'flavor\': \'"필멸자들이 검술을 배울 수 있는 건 고작 몇 십년인데, 영원토록 검술을 수련한 자와 비교가 가능할 리가 없지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaca8d41-949f-4a59-b2d2-65475077b9a8\', \'multiverseId\': 336138}, \'multiverseid\': 336138}, {\'name\': \'Espadachim-mestre de Markov\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nToda vez que Espadachim-mestre de Markov causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 sobre ele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A prática dos mortais com a espada não passa de algumas décadas. Como eles podem superar a maestria adquirida com a eternidade?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c94d91b-b537-4cb4-85ad-1d89f210a44e\', \'multiverseId\': 336480}, \'multiverseid\': 336480}, {\'name\': \'Мастер Клинка из Рода Марковых\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nКаждый раз когда Мастер Клинка из Рода Марковых наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите на него один жетон +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Смертные упражняются в фехтовании в лучшем случае несколько десятков лет. Разве они способны достичь искусного мастерства, которое дает вечность?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7c91bd-bfa5-4070-ba5d-1600b1868460\', \'multiverseId\': 336822}, \'multiverseid\': 336822}, {\'name\': \'马可夫大剑师\', \'text\': \'每当马可夫大剑师对一位牌手造成战斗伤害时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「生灵练剑顶多数十年。他们怎有可能达到永恒所造就的高超境界？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=335967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10dd532-e488-44f3-884c-5b4dc3fbc06a\', \'multiverseId\': 335967}, \'multiverseid\': 335967}, {\'name\': \'馬可夫大劍師\', \'text\': \'每當馬可夫大劍師對一位玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～吸血鬼／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「生靈練劍頂多數十年。他們怎有可能達到永恆所造就的高超境界？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbd2b2ff-2c22-4b6a-be11-9df7a505b749\', \'multiverseId\': 336309}, \'multiverseid\': 336309}]', '[{\'name\': \'Markov-Kriegsfürst\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Markov-Kriegsfürst ins Spiel kommt, können bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„In den Händen eines Feiglings sind auch ein Pflock und ein heiliges Symbol nutzlos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06b62c75-503a-466a-8f31-5cbd54d4e458\', \'multiverseId\': 337037}, \'multiverseid\': 337037}, {\'name\': \'Señor de la guerra Markov\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando el Señor de la guerra Markov entre al campo de batalla, hasta dos criaturas objetivo no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿De qué sirve una estaca o un símbolo sagrado en las manos de un cobarde?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f3b4bb8-e53c-408d-b945-4b7c83719223\', \'multiverseId\': 337208}, \'multiverseid\': 337208}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur de guerre Markov\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand le Seigneur de guerre Markov arrive sur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle peut être l\'utilité d\'un pieu ou d\'un symbole sacré dans les mains d\'un lâche ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=336695&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71b1234f-e360-4e71-947f-57ac5d7cc8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 336695}, \'multiverseid\': 336695}, {\'name\': \'Condottiero Markov\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nQuando il Condottiero Markov entra nel campo di battaglia, fino a due creature bersaglio non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"A cosa serve un bastone o un simbolo sacro in mano a un codardo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=337379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\